1
00:00:01,068 --> 00:00:03,905
♪ IN THE NOT
TOO DISTANT FUTURE ♪

2
00:00:03,905 --> 00:00:07,075
♪ SOMEWHERE IN TIME
AND SPACE ♪

3
00:00:07,075 --> 00:00:10,645
♪ MIKE NELSON
AND HIS ROBOT PALS ♪

4
00:00:10,645 --> 00:00:13,382
♪ ARE CAUGHT
IN A NASTY PLACE ♪

5
00:00:13,382 --> 00:00:16,183
♪ THEY TRY TO SURVIVE
THE WRATH OF PEARL ♪

6
00:00:16,183 --> 00:00:19,487
♪ JUST AN EVIL GAL
WHO WANTS TO RULE THE WORLD ♪

7
00:00:19,487 --> 00:00:22,890
♪ FROM HER CASTLE BELOW
SHE SETS HER SIGHTS ABOVE ♪

8
00:00:22,890 --> 00:00:24,192
♪ JUST TO TORTURE
ALL HER CAPTIVES ♪

9
00:00:24,192 --> 00:00:25,993
♪ ON THE SATELLITE ABOVE ♪

10
00:00:25,993 --> 00:00:28,797
GET ME DOWN!

11
00:00:28,797 --> 00:00:31,833
♪ I’LL SEND HIM
CHEESY MOVIES ♪

12
00:00:31,833 --> 00:00:33,868
♪ THE WORST I CAN FIND ♪

13
00:00:33,868 --> 00:00:35,170
♪ LA LA LA ♪

14
00:00:35,170 --> 00:00:38,138
♪ HE’LL HAVE TO SIT
AND WATCH THEM ALL ♪

15
00:00:38,138 --> 00:00:40,040
♪ AND I’LL MONITOR
HIS MIND ♪

16
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:41,342
♪ LA LA LA ♪

17
00:00:41,342 --> 00:00:44,245
♪ NOW KEEP IN MIND
MIKE CAN’T CONTROL ♪

18
00:00:44,245 --> 00:00:46,547
♪ WHERE THE MOVIES
BEGIN OR END ♪

19
00:00:46,547 --> 00:00:47,715
♪ LA LA LA ♪

20
00:00:47,715 --> 00:00:50,552
♪ HE’LL TRY TO KEEP
HIS SANITY ♪

21
00:00:50,552 --> 00:00:55,590
♪ WITH THE HELP
OF HIS ROBOT FRIENDS ♪

22
00:00:55,590 --> 00:00:57,058
ROBOT ROLL CALL.

23
00:00:57,058 --> 00:00:58,760
CAMBOT "YOU’RE ON"

24
00:00:58,760 --> 00:00:59,960
GYPSY "OH MY STARS"

25
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:01,628
TOM SERVO "CHECK ME OUT"

26
00:01:01,628 --> 00:01:03,163
CROOOOW "I’M DIFFERENT"

27
00:01:03,163 --> 00:01:06,433
♪ IF YOU’RE WONDERIN’
HOW HE EATS AND BREATHES ♪

28
00:01:06,433 --> 00:01:07,935
♪ AND OTHER
SCIENCE FACTS ♪

29
00:01:07,935 --> 00:01:09,337
♪ LA LA LA ♪

30
00:01:09,337 --> 00:01:12,240
♪ JUST REPEAT TO YOURSELF,
"IT’S JUST A SHOW ♪

31
00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:15,643
♪ "I SHOULD REALLY JUST RELAX ♪

32
00:01:15,643 --> 00:01:20,548
♪ FOR MYSTERY SCIENCE
THEATER 3000" ♪

33
00:01:34,395 --> 00:01:38,467
OKAY, 26 COLUMNS.
ENTER.

34
00:01:38,467 --> 00:01:40,268
HI, EVERYONE.
WELCOME TO THE S.O.L.

35
00:01:40,268 --> 00:01:44,005
LATELY, GYPSY’S BEEN WONDERING
IF SHE’S ONCE, TWICE,

36
00:01:44,005 --> 00:01:46,173
MAYBE EVEN THREE TIMES
A LADY.

37
00:01:46,173 --> 00:01:48,375
AS A WOMAN,
I’M NATURALLY CURIOUS.

38
00:01:48,375 --> 00:01:51,312
RIGHT, SO CROW HERE CAME UP
WITH A SPREADSHEET PROGRAM

39
00:01:51,312 --> 00:01:52,713
THAT’LL ANSWER
THAT VERY QUESTION.

40
00:01:52,713 --> 00:01:56,083
OKAY, UH, USING
SENATOR DIANE FEINSTEIN
AS A BASELINE...

41
00:01:56,083 --> 00:01:58,218
SINCE SHE IS EXACTLY
ONE TIME A LADY...

42
00:01:58,218 --> 00:02:03,323
RIGHT.
WE ENTER "GYPSY" THERE,
AND THE ANSWER IS...

43
00:02:03,323 --> 00:02:06,427
- YOU’RE 2.7 TIMES A LADY.
- AW.

44
00:02:06,427 --> 00:02:07,828
NO, WELL THAT’S NOT BAD.

45
00:02:07,828 --> 00:02:10,465
SURE,
WINONA IS 3.3 TIMES A LADY,

46
00:02:10,465 --> 00:02:12,833
BUT NINA TOTENBERG
IS ONLY 2 1/2.

47
00:02:12,833 --> 00:02:15,870
AND MELISSA ETHERIDGE
IS, OOH, WELL, PRETTY LOW.

48
00:02:15,870 --> 00:02:18,005
GILLIAN ANDERSON HERSELF
IS ONLY A 2.9.

49
00:02:18,005 --> 00:02:19,007
WOW!

50
00:02:19,007 --> 00:02:21,142
YEAH.
AND SAY, LOOK AT THIS.

51
00:02:21,142 --> 00:02:24,012
IT SAYS THAT MIKE HERE
IS EIGHT TIMES A LADY!

52
00:02:24,012 --> 00:02:25,880
WHAT? WHAT AM I EVEN
DOING IN THERE?

53
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:27,882
WOW. LET ME TAKE A LOOK AT YA,
THERE, MIKE.

54
00:02:27,882 --> 00:02:29,883
OOH, YEAH, I SEE IT.
I SEE IT.

55
00:02:29,883 --> 00:02:32,187
CUT IT OUT.
WE’LL BE RIGHT BACK.
I’M NO TIMES A LADY.

56
00:02:32,187 --> 00:02:34,588
SAY, WHAT ARE YA DOIN’ WITH
YOUR FINE SELF ON SATURDAY?

57
00:02:34,588 --> 00:02:37,325
I AM NOT A LADY. NOT AT ALL.
NOT EVEN A LITTLE.

58
00:02:43,497 --> 00:02:47,602
MIKE, RELAX.
EVEN BEING A HUNDRED TIMES
A LADY ISN’T A BAD THING.

59
00:02:47,602 --> 00:02:50,037
YOU SHOULD KNOW,
YA BIG WOMAN.

60
00:02:50,037 --> 00:02:52,373
WHAT’S THAT SUPPOSED
TO MEAN, YA GIANT LADY?

61
00:02:52,373 --> 00:02:53,675
CH--WHY I OUGHTA...

62
00:02:53,675 --> 00:02:56,077
OH. SPEAKING OF LADIES,
UH, SORT OF--

63
00:02:56,077 --> 00:02:58,245
UH, WHATCHA GOT
FOR US, PEARL?

64
00:03:00,982 --> 00:03:03,752
OH, HI.
UH, MIKE, IS IT?

65
00:03:03,752 --> 00:03:06,653
ANYWHO, NOTHIN’ MUCH
GOIN’ ON AROUND HERE

66
00:03:06,653 --> 00:03:08,723
EXCEPT THE GOVERNMENT
HAS ASKED ME TO DO

67
00:03:08,723 --> 00:03:11,625
SOME SECRET
LSD TESTS ON ROBOTS.

68
00:03:11,625 --> 00:03:13,995
OKAY, THE GOVERNMENT’S
NOT REALLY INVOLVED.

69
00:03:13,995 --> 00:03:16,030
THEY’RE JUST
MY SECRET LSD TESTS.

70
00:03:16,030 --> 00:03:17,998
NOW, BRAIN GUY
SENT UP SOME STUFF

71
00:03:17,998 --> 00:03:19,300
SO I CAN MONITOR
THE RESULTS

72
00:03:19,300 --> 00:03:20,335
RIGHT ON.

73
00:03:20,335 --> 00:03:22,137
EH-EH-EH-EH MIKE,
DO PEARL A LITTLE FAVOR

74
00:03:22,137 --> 00:03:23,872
AND HOOK UP
THE VIDEO AND CO-AX CABLES

75
00:03:23,872 --> 00:03:26,975
SO I˯ CAN MONITOR
THE ROBOTS’ HALLUCINATIONS.

76
00:03:26,975 --> 00:03:29,710
UH, OKAY, PEARL.
LOOKS LIKE WE’RE SET UP HERE.

77
00:03:31,778 --> 00:03:35,950
NOW, I’M NOT GONNA TELL YOU
HOW YOU’LL BE INGESTING THE LSD

78
00:03:35,950 --> 00:03:37,618
IT’S A SECRET.

79
00:03:37,618 --> 00:03:40,388
WHO WANTS VEGETABLES?
YOU DO! YOU DO!

80
00:03:40,388 --> 00:03:42,090
HEY, BRAIN GUY.

81
00:03:42,090 --> 00:03:45,427
NOW, TO HEIGHTEN THE EFFECT,
BOBO AND BRAIN GUY

82
00:03:45,427 --> 00:03:47,562
HAVE COME UP WITH THEIR
OWN LITTLE GARAGE BAND

83
00:03:47,562 --> 00:03:50,130
TO PLAY SOME OF THE
PSYCHEDELIC MUSIC

84
00:03:50,130 --> 00:03:52,967
THAT ALL THE KIDS
ARE TALKING ABOUT THESE DAYS.

85
00:03:52,967 --> 00:03:58,038
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN,
I GIVE YOU "NARCOTIC CASSEROLE."

86
00:04:01,675 --> 00:04:04,945
NOW LET’S SEE WHAT’S GOIN’ ON
IN THOSE LITTLE PEA BRAINS OF
YOURS.

87
00:04:10,418 --> 00:04:11,818
MM. OKAY. WE’VE GOT OUR
VEGETABLES HERE.

88
00:04:11,818 --> 00:04:15,390
SO, UH, LET’S SWITCH
IT TO VIDEO FEED.

89
00:04:28,102 --> 00:04:31,138
SERVO. SERVO. ARE YOU--
WHAT A NIGHTMARE. ARE YOU OKAY?

90
00:04:31,138 --> 00:04:35,310
WHAT? TH-- THAT?
NO, MIKE, THAT’S WHAT I SEE
EVERYDAY! HEH HEH HEH.

91
00:04:35,310 --> 00:04:37,112
LET’S CHECK IN ON CROW, HERE.
HOW YA DOIN’?

92
00:04:37,112 --> 00:04:41,148
MM. BETA-CAROTENE.
MM. PLENTY OF FIBER. MM.

93
00:04:41,148 --> 00:04:43,150
POWERFUL HALLUCINOGENS.

94
00:04:43,150 --> 00:04:46,187
OOH. OKAY, UH, LET’S SWITCH
TO VIDEO FEED NOW.

95
00:04:46,187 --> 00:04:50,392
OH-- OH NO-- EEH, AHH--

96
00:04:50,392 --> 00:04:54,228
BEFORE, IT WAS A MILKY-WAY.
NOW-- NOW IT’S A SNICKERS!

97
00:04:54,228 --> 00:04:55,863
MAKE IT STOP!
MAKE IT STOP, BRO!

98
00:04:55,863 --> 00:04:57,665
IT’S GONNA BE OKAY.
I’M GONNA TALK YA DOWN.

99
00:04:57,665 --> 00:05:01,135
SNICKERS! MILKY-WAY!
ARGH-- SCARY! SCARY!

100
00:05:01,135 --> 00:05:02,237
THANKS A LOT, PEARL.

101
00:05:02,237 --> 00:05:05,305
YEAH, PEARL,
I HOPE YOU’RE HAPPY.

102
00:05:07,875 --> 00:05:09,410
I AM HAPPY.

103
00:05:09,410 --> 00:05:12,213
ROBOT MIS-IDENTIFIED
CANDY BAR.

104
00:05:12,213 --> 00:05:16,017
NOW, YOUR MOVIE TODAY
IS A LITTLE TAB OF ORANGE
SUNSHINE CALLED,

105
00:05:16,017 --> 00:05:17,785
"FUTURE WAR."

106
00:05:17,785 --> 00:05:19,587
WE HAVE A WORD FOR THIS
KIND OF FILM

107
00:05:19,587 --> 00:05:22,023
IN THE ILLICIT PHARMACOLOGY
BUSINESS:

108
00:05:22,023 --> 00:05:24,325
"CRAP."

109
00:05:26,260 --> 00:05:28,997
[LAUGHS]

110
00:05:28,997 --> 00:05:30,263
WHAT?

111
00:05:30,263 --> 00:05:34,735
[CONTINUES LAUGHING]

112
00:05:34,735 --> 00:05:37,538
CROW, YOU’RE
HALLUCINATING A CLOWN.

113
00:05:37,538 --> 00:05:39,873
YOU MEAN YOU’RE
NOT A CLOWN, OR--?

114
00:05:39,873 --> 00:05:41,508
WE’VE GOT MOVIE SIGN!

115
00:05:41,508 --> 00:05:43,443
[ALARM BEEPING]

116
00:05:55,390 --> 00:05:59,727
WHOA, BOY.
FEEL BETTER, CROW?

117
00:06:01,995 --> 00:06:05,833
MY SHIRT SLEEVES ARE
AROUND HERE, SOMEWHERE.

118
00:06:08,268 --> 00:06:09,370
MAKING A BAD MOVIE?

119
00:06:09,370 --> 00:06:11,538
THAT’S TWO WEEKS
IN SOLITARY CONFINEMENT.

120
00:06:11,538 --> 00:06:14,742
[LIQUID DRIPPING]

121
00:06:14,742 --> 00:06:16,743
IS THAT YOU LEAKING, CROW?

122
00:06:16,743 --> 00:06:19,080
UH, NO.

123
00:06:21,148 --> 00:06:22,550
THIS PLACE LOOKS LIKE A MAZE.

124
00:06:22,550 --> 00:06:23,952
WE CALL IT A "CORN."

125
00:06:23,952 --> 00:06:25,018
LOOK OVER THERE.

126
00:06:25,018 --> 00:06:26,753
HM?

127
00:06:26,753 --> 00:06:31,392
YOU MAKE SUCH A BIG DEAL
OUT OF FEEDING THE CHICKENS.

128
00:06:31,392 --> 00:06:34,828
LET’S GO.

129
00:06:34,828 --> 00:06:37,665
WHY’D YOU MAKE YOUR
HOT TUB SO BIG?

130
00:06:37,665 --> 00:06:39,267
WE FOUND ’EM.
DOWN THERE.

131
00:06:39,267 --> 00:06:40,267
LET’S GET ’EM.

132
00:06:40,267 --> 00:06:41,402
I’M RIGHT BEHIND YOU.

133
00:06:41,402 --> 00:06:46,540
SO YOU’LL CUSHION
MY FALL.

134
00:06:46,540 --> 00:06:51,045
UH, COULD I BE IN
YOUR MOVIE TOO?

135
00:06:51,045 --> 00:06:52,380
IT’S A CLOWN LOFT.

136
00:06:52,380 --> 00:06:57,083
PEOPLE JUST KEEP
COMIN’ OUT OF IT.

137
00:06:57,083 --> 00:06:58,252
[GULP]

138
00:06:58,252 --> 00:06:59,920
WELCOME TO PIPE WORLD.

139
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:03,123
ALL WE DO ARE PIPES,
AND WE DO THEM WELL.

140
00:07:07,562 --> 00:07:09,863
THREE LESBIANS
ON A DANGEROUS MISSION.

141
00:07:12,533 --> 00:07:13,533
[GULP]

142
00:07:13,533 --> 00:07:14,535
[SCREAM]

143
00:07:14,535 --> 00:07:16,437
HOLD ON, MAN. I GOT YA.

144
00:07:16,437 --> 00:07:18,672
SORRY. MY CALF JUST ROLLED
UP LIKE A WINDOW SHADE.

145
00:07:18,672 --> 00:07:20,240
VERY DEEP.

146
00:07:21,442 --> 00:07:25,012
OH. THEY SET
A GULLIBLE MORON TRAP.

147
00:07:27,548 --> 00:07:29,550
MOM JUST SENT US
TO THE BASEMENT
FOR MORE PICKLES.

148
00:07:29,550 --> 00:07:32,887
I DIDN’T KNOW
IT WOULD BE THIS HARD.

149
00:07:32,887 --> 00:07:36,523
OUR PRETENDING THERE’S A HOLE
THERE IS GOING REALLY WELL.

150
00:07:37,658 --> 00:07:40,528
HEY, IT’S
JEAN-CLAUDE VAN DAMME.

151
00:07:40,528 --> 00:07:42,963
EH, HE’S MORE LIKE
JEAN-CLAUDE GOSH DARN.

152
00:07:42,963 --> 00:07:45,132
AM I VING RHAMES?

153
00:07:45,132 --> 00:07:46,967
I CAN’T REMEMBER.

154
00:07:46,967 --> 00:07:51,772
HMM.

155
00:07:51,772 --> 00:07:56,543
FOUR DAYS AGO,
A FIRE FELL FROM THE SKY.

156
00:07:56,543 --> 00:07:59,680
AND IT BROUGHT A MAN WHO WOULD
CHANGE MY LIFE FOREVER.

157
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:02,015
DEEPAK CHOPRA.

158
00:08:02,015 --> 00:08:04,285
BUT ALSO CAME A PACK
OF DINOSAUR-LIKE CREATURES.

159
00:08:04,285 --> 00:08:05,285
FOR CUTE.

160
00:08:05,285 --> 00:08:08,822
IN VARIOUS AGES,
SHAPES, SIZES,

161
00:08:08,822 --> 00:08:09,990
AND ITS MASTERS.

162
00:08:09,990 --> 00:08:11,592
HMM? WHAT?

163
00:08:11,592 --> 00:08:15,362
FOR ALL THE QUESTIONS
I HAD ABOUT THE HEAVENS,

164
00:08:15,362 --> 00:08:17,030
ALL IT BROUGHT
WAS HELL ON EARTH.

165
00:08:17,030 --> 00:08:18,732
ALL THE BRAS WERE
HELL ON EARTH?

166
00:08:18,732 --> 00:08:20,735
I DON’T KNOW
IF THAT’S WHAT--

167
00:08:20,735 --> 00:08:22,237
HEY, LISTEN.
IS THAT A HEARTBEAT?

168
00:08:22,237 --> 00:08:23,837
OH, NO, I’M SORRY.
THAT’S A LOVE BEAT.

169
00:08:23,837 --> 00:08:25,038
YEAH.

170
00:08:25,038 --> 00:08:28,708
I HEAR WE GOT FLASHLIGHTS
AND A DARK SPACE.

171
00:08:28,708 --> 00:08:30,978
LET’S MAKE A MOVIE!
[SCOFFS]

172
00:08:33,247 --> 00:08:36,317
SO, WHAT ARE YOU GUYS DOIN’
AFTER WHATEVER WE’RE DOIN’ HERE?

173
00:08:36,317 --> 00:08:38,252
YOU WANNA GO
TO APPLEBEE’S, OR...

174
00:08:41,522 --> 00:08:44,758
REMEMBER.
WE DON’T HAVE HALL PASSES,
SO BE CAREFUL.

175
00:08:47,562 --> 00:08:51,732
[LAUGHS]

176
00:08:51,732 --> 00:08:54,102
ROCK ’EM SOCK ’EM DINOSAURS.

177
00:08:56,370 --> 00:09:00,273
MINE’S NOT COOKED THROUGH.

178
00:09:02,677 --> 00:09:03,912
GO GO GO GO GO GO GO GO!

179
00:09:03,912 --> 00:09:04,912
[SCREAM]

180
00:09:04,912 --> 00:09:07,815
SHE’S GARGLING
WITH FRIGHT.

181
00:09:09,050 --> 00:09:11,752
HURRY!

182
00:09:12,820 --> 00:09:15,022
STRING. I SEE STRING.

183
00:09:17,023 --> 00:09:18,558
SO IT WASN’T
A GIANT METEOR.

184
00:09:18,558 --> 00:09:22,930
IT WAS A DAISY AIR RIFLE
THAT KILLED THE DINOSAURS.

185
00:09:22,930 --> 00:09:25,667
JERRY! NO!

186
00:09:29,303 --> 00:09:33,107
HE WAS THREE DAYS
AWAY FROM RETIREMENT!

187
00:09:33,107 --> 00:09:36,143
LET’S GO!

188
00:09:37,812 --> 00:09:42,583
YOU KNOW, HALF THIS MOVIE HAS
BEEN PEOPLE’S BUTTS ON LADDERS.

189
00:09:45,518 --> 00:09:47,087
[SCREAMS]

190
00:09:47,087 --> 00:09:48,488
DINO, NO!

191
00:09:50,658 --> 00:09:54,562
IN ASSOCIATION WITH BOB TET
OFFENSIVE PRODUCTIONS.

192
00:09:56,563 --> 00:09:57,998
AH, THEY’RE PROMISING
ENTERTAINMENT,

193
00:09:57,998 --> 00:10:00,567
BUT I’M NOT
THAT OPTIMISTIC.

194
00:10:02,370 --> 00:10:04,505
WAIT. ANOTHER
MOVIE’S STARTED.

195
00:10:07,508 --> 00:10:11,778
DUST BUSTER GALACTICA.

196
00:10:11,778 --> 00:10:14,748
MAYBE THIS IS AN ANTHOLOGY
OF SHORT, PLOTLESS MOVIES.

197
00:10:14,748 --> 00:10:17,150
COULD BE.

198
00:10:20,287 --> 00:10:21,888
SO?

199
00:10:21,888 --> 00:10:23,190
[LAUGHS]

200
00:10:25,492 --> 00:10:27,828
TRAVELING AT A MODERATE
15 MILES PER HOUR,

201
00:10:27,828 --> 00:10:30,630
WE MADE OUR WAY,
SAFELY, THROUGH SPACE.

202
00:10:33,700 --> 00:10:36,670
OH, Z’NO!

203
00:10:40,307 --> 00:10:42,477
A PLACE!

204
00:10:42,477 --> 00:10:45,947
HERE TO SING HIS
TOP-TEN COUNTRY HIT.

205
00:10:48,048 --> 00:10:49,250
[DOOR CREAKS]

206
00:10:49,250 --> 00:10:51,718
HEY. WILLIAM CONRAD’S
CAT-SCAN MACHINE.

207
00:10:51,718 --> 00:10:53,120
WHEW.

208
00:10:53,120 --> 00:10:56,257
FORMERLY OF KAZJA GOO GOO.

209
00:10:56,257 --> 00:10:59,160
I THINK.

210
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:00,895
WELL,
THEY SENT THE SHIP UP,

211
00:11:00,895 --> 00:11:02,863
BUT THEY FORGOT
TO PUT IN ASTRONAUTS.

212
00:11:02,863 --> 00:11:05,198
NAMES WITHOUT Zs IN THEM?

213
00:11:05,198 --> 00:11:10,103
WHAT THE HELL?

214
00:11:10,103 --> 00:11:13,040
THE SPACESHIP IS HANDICAP
ACCESSIBLE. THAT’S NICE.

215
00:11:15,642 --> 00:11:18,512
PATRICK, WAIT.
COME BACK AND BE IN THE MOVIE.

216
00:11:18,512 --> 00:11:21,682
OH, NOW.

217
00:11:21,682 --> 00:11:24,552
[DRILL WHIRRING]

218
00:11:24,552 --> 00:11:27,822
I AM A CAMERA.

219
00:11:27,822 --> 00:11:32,660
AH! THERE’S A "Z."
WE’RE BACK ON TRACK NOW.

220
00:11:34,228 --> 00:11:35,328
[DRILL CONTINUES]

221
00:11:35,328 --> 00:11:36,597
UM, WE’RE STILL
BUILDING THE SET.

222
00:11:36,597 --> 00:11:38,998
KEEP THE CREDITS GOING.

223
00:11:40,267 --> 00:11:43,070
MY BRA STRAP BROKE.

224
00:11:46,040 --> 00:11:47,675
OH, HE’S THE FRENCH
COUNTRY SINGER.

225
00:11:47,675 --> 00:11:51,478
YEAH HE’S USUALLY TEAMED
WITH GUILLAUME TUBBS.

226
00:11:51,478 --> 00:11:55,015
[DRILL WHIRRING]

227
00:11:55,015 --> 00:11:58,252
HEY! HE’S COMING
INTO THE THEATER, MIKE.

228
00:11:58,252 --> 00:12:00,020
IT WOULD BE A LOT
MORE SPECIAL

229
00:12:00,020 --> 00:12:02,957
IF WE KNEW WHO
THE HELL HE WAS.

230
00:12:04,525 --> 00:12:06,793
YEAH, ARLAN H. BOLL!

231
00:12:06,793 --> 00:12:10,430
OKAY, OKAY.

232
00:12:13,900 --> 00:12:16,337
I HAD A BOTTLE
OF DOM MAGWILLI ONCE.

233
00:12:16,337 --> 00:12:18,272
IT WAS OVERRATED.

234
00:12:26,113 --> 00:12:29,048
ROMEO WAS RESTLESS,
HE WAS READY TO PRODUCTION
DESIGN.

235
00:12:33,920 --> 00:12:34,955
GESUNDHEIT.

236
00:12:37,057 --> 00:12:38,125
HMM. CREATURE EFFECTS.

237
00:12:38,125 --> 00:12:41,528
HOPEFULLY THIS
DOESN’T MEAN ALF.

238
00:12:43,763 --> 00:12:46,000
IT’S THE FACE OF A SNOW MONKEY
HEADING AT US.

239
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:48,768
[IMITATES MONKEY]

240
00:12:48,768 --> 00:12:50,838
I’M GONNA IGNORE
THIS CREDIT.

241
00:12:50,838 --> 00:12:53,173
JUST GONNA LOOK AWAY
TILL IT’S GONE.

242
00:12:53,173 --> 00:12:55,208
STILL THERE.

243
00:12:55,208 --> 00:12:56,210
OKAY.

244
00:12:56,210 --> 00:12:59,580
OKAY.

245
00:12:59,580 --> 00:13:03,650
TWO FIRST NAMES FROM VAN HALEN.
COINCIDENCE?

246
00:13:03,650 --> 00:13:04,685
YES.

247
00:13:04,685 --> 00:13:05,618
YEAH.

248
00:13:06,920 --> 00:13:08,988
SAVE THE NEUTROGENA BAR!

249
00:13:08,988 --> 00:13:12,158
[IMITATES ENGINE]

250
00:13:12,158 --> 00:13:14,928
THIS MOVIE IS CREDITING
THE ENTIRE UNITED STATES,

251
00:13:14,928 --> 00:13:17,230
PERSON BY PERSON.

252
00:13:20,767 --> 00:13:22,468
EW!
AWKWARD INITIALS.

253
00:13:22,468 --> 00:13:24,405
[SCOFFS]

254
00:13:27,508 --> 00:13:30,710
[HUMMING]

255
00:13:30,710 --> 00:13:31,912
NOT A VERY GOOD TENT.

256
00:13:34,147 --> 00:13:36,950
SEE?
THIS IS WHAT HAPPENS WHEN
YOU DE-REGULATE CREDITS.

257
00:13:39,987 --> 00:13:41,688
TALL, MAN.

258
00:13:41,688 --> 00:13:43,623
YEAH.

259
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:49,963
AFTER MAKING A COUPLE
OF REST STOPS ALONG THE WAY.

260
00:13:51,098 --> 00:13:52,165
AND...

261
00:13:52,165 --> 00:13:55,402
WITHDRAWALS
FROM EARTH’S BANKS.

262
00:13:59,607 --> 00:14:03,410
GERBILS, WELL,
THEY PRETTY MUCH REMAINED
GERBILS.

263
00:14:06,180 --> 00:14:09,917
QUESTIONS?
PLEASE REFER TO THE ADDENDUM.

264
00:14:11,452 --> 00:14:15,990
AND NOW,
"OOH, HEAVEN IS A PLACE ON
EARTH," THE MOVIE.

265
00:14:18,558 --> 00:14:19,860
FUTURE WAX!

266
00:14:19,860 --> 00:14:20,895
UH, WAR.

267
00:14:20,895 --> 00:14:23,897
OH, YEAH.
[LAUGHS] SORRY.

268
00:14:27,500 --> 00:14:29,537
AW. CUTE LITTLE CREDITS.

269
00:14:29,537 --> 00:14:31,072
DON’T BE SHY.
COME ON UP HERE.

270
00:14:31,072 --> 00:14:32,072
COME ON UP.

271
00:14:32,072 --> 00:14:33,007
[KISSES]

272
00:14:34,308 --> 00:14:36,343
I’M HAVING A SECRET STORM
RIGHT NOW, MIKE.

273
00:14:36,343 --> 00:14:37,377
DON’T TELL ANYONE.

274
00:14:37,377 --> 00:14:39,313
OKAY.

275
00:14:41,948 --> 00:14:44,718
THREE MILE ISLAND
ALL-INCLUSIVE RESORT.

276
00:14:44,718 --> 00:14:46,453
WRITE ’EM.

277
00:14:53,727 --> 00:14:56,863
UGH. IT’S TOUGH SWIMMING
IN THIS PART OF THE OCEAN.

278
00:15:02,002 --> 00:15:03,370
A GIANT CHICKEN!

279
00:15:03,370 --> 00:15:05,305
BAWK.

280
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:09,108
UH, HE’S GONNA
NEED A BIG BAG

281
00:15:09,108 --> 00:15:11,078
TO PICK UP AFTER
HIS DINOSAUR.

282
00:15:13,447 --> 00:15:15,950
I’M TELLIN’.
YOU GOT A PET ON THE BEACH.

283
00:15:18,885 --> 00:15:21,255
WOW. THEY LIT THIS
WITH A KFC HEAT LAMP.

284
00:15:23,290 --> 00:15:25,125
CHUCK WEPNER’S
POINT OF VIEW.

285
00:15:25,125 --> 00:15:26,060
[SCOFFS]

286
00:15:30,330 --> 00:15:32,667
LATER, IN HOUSTON,
OR PORTLAND,

287
00:15:32,667 --> 00:15:34,835
OR SOME CRAPPY HOLE
OF A TOWN, I DON’T KNOW.

288
00:15:34,835 --> 00:15:36,270
HEY, IT’S MIKE!

289
00:15:36,270 --> 00:15:38,238
OH, NO.

290
00:15:39,873 --> 00:15:41,708
SANTA CLAUS
HITS THE SKIDS.

291
00:15:43,077 --> 00:15:45,912
KIND OF AN INEFFECTIVE
BEER COMMERCIAL.

292
00:15:49,248 --> 00:15:50,950
GIMME BACK MY BEER!

293
00:15:55,055 --> 00:15:56,090
AAH!

294
00:15:56,090 --> 00:15:57,457
AAH!

295
00:15:59,058 --> 00:16:00,995
[GROWLING]

296
00:16:02,128 --> 00:16:04,097
[YELLING]

297
00:16:05,165 --> 00:16:07,133
WELL, I BETTER
GET BACK TO THE OFFICE.

298
00:16:10,237 --> 00:16:12,005
[LAUGHS]

299
00:16:12,005 --> 00:16:14,708
I WARN YOU,
MY MEAT IS VERY STRINGY.

300
00:16:16,010 --> 00:16:17,477
[YELLING]

301
00:16:17,477 --> 00:16:19,680
THIS HAS GOTTA BE KINDA
THE LAST DANGER YOU THINK OF

302
00:16:19,680 --> 00:16:21,482
WHEN YOU’RE
LIVING IN A DUMPSTER.

303
00:16:21,482 --> 00:16:23,117
YUP.

304
00:16:23,117 --> 00:16:25,118
[GROWLING]

305
00:16:26,187 --> 00:16:27,487
HE’S A CUTE-A-SAURUS.

306
00:16:29,790 --> 00:16:31,625
HE’S BEING ATTACKED
BY A SCHNAUZER

307
00:16:31,625 --> 00:16:33,993
IN A DINOSAUR COSTUME.

308
00:16:33,993 --> 00:16:35,495
OH.

309
00:16:35,495 --> 00:16:37,932
WOW.
WELL, THAT WAS EASY.

310
00:16:37,932 --> 00:16:39,232
MAYBE IT WAS BUTTERFLIES

311
00:16:39,232 --> 00:16:41,802
THAT WIPED OUT
THE DINOSAURS.

312
00:16:41,802 --> 00:16:43,503
TAP DOGS.

313
00:16:46,340 --> 00:16:47,708
OOH!

314
00:16:47,708 --> 00:16:49,843
NO WONDER FOSSILS
ARE SO RARE.

315
00:16:52,045 --> 00:16:53,780
I’LL DISGUISE MYSELF
AS A BOX.

316
00:16:53,780 --> 00:16:56,850
MUST LOOK CORRUGATED
AND SQUARE.

317
00:16:59,787 --> 00:17:00,753
THANK YOU!

318
00:17:03,023 --> 00:17:06,360
WOW.
BEING A SCAB FOR UPS IS HARD.

319
00:17:10,697 --> 00:17:13,100
ALAN JACKSON
IN A VERY SPECIAL CAMEO.

320
00:17:13,100 --> 00:17:14,902
[LAUGHS]

321
00:17:17,703 --> 00:17:21,040
IT’S A WEIRD,
THREATENING CLOWN.

322
00:17:22,408 --> 00:17:24,277
HEY,
THEY GOT GOOD STUFF

323
00:17:24,277 --> 00:17:26,480
HERE AT THE POLICE AUCTION.

324
00:17:30,217 --> 00:17:33,187
VAN-DAMME IT.

325
00:17:33,187 --> 00:17:35,122
[LENS FOCUSING]

326
00:17:38,192 --> 00:17:40,493
BRAIN GUY LOOKED LIKE THIS
IN HIGH SCHOOL.

327
00:17:40,493 --> 00:17:42,528
[LAUGHS]

328
00:17:48,468 --> 00:17:51,003
DAMN BINOCULAR TRICK.

329
00:17:51,003 --> 00:17:52,873
AAH!

330
00:17:52,873 --> 00:17:54,373
GEEZ, I’M SORRY
I KILLED YOUR DINOSAUR.

331
00:17:54,373 --> 00:17:56,910
I DIDN’T KNOW
HE WAS A PET.

332
00:18:00,880 --> 00:18:05,018
BOXES OF AIR,
SHIPPED ANYWHERE IN THE WORLD,
OVERNIGHT.

333
00:18:05,018 --> 00:18:06,820
BOING! BOING!

334
00:18:09,288 --> 00:18:13,160
HE’S GOT CLOWN WHITE
ALL OVER HIS FISTS NOW.

335
00:18:16,597 --> 00:18:20,067
WOW,
MAYBE THEY SHIP FULLY-INFLATED
BALLOONS OVERSEAS.

336
00:18:23,903 --> 00:18:25,305
WORLD’S GROUCHIEST MIME.

337
00:18:27,407 --> 00:18:29,342
HE’S "BOXED" IN!

338
00:18:29,342 --> 00:18:31,512
YEAH,
WELL, I’M "CARD-BORED."

339
00:18:31,512 --> 00:18:32,512
[LAUGHTER]

340
00:18:32,512 --> 00:18:34,748
SHUT UP, YOU TWO.

341
00:18:34,748 --> 00:18:38,285
BE HONEST.
AM I WEARING TOO MUCH EYELINER?

342
00:18:40,987 --> 00:18:43,657
SO HE SEES CONSIDERABLY WORSE
THAN HUMANS.

343
00:18:46,058 --> 00:18:49,095
I LIKE THE
RANDY JOHNSON-MODEL CYBORG.

344
00:18:54,668 --> 00:18:58,305
THE FED-EX / DHL WARS CONTINUED
WELL INTO THE NEXT CENTURY.

345
00:18:58,305 --> 00:19:00,840
UGH.
DON’T COME IN YET! UGH!

346
00:19:05,612 --> 00:19:08,482
THE TRUTH ABOUT RADIO...

347
00:19:11,518 --> 00:19:13,753
AAH!

348
00:19:13,753 --> 00:19:15,955
AAH!

349
00:19:15,955 --> 00:19:17,623
CARDBOARD BOXES
AREN’T WORKING.

350
00:19:17,623 --> 00:19:21,362
TRY THROWING
A PIECE OF PAPER
OR A COTTONBALL.

351
00:19:21,362 --> 00:19:22,462
AAH!

352
00:19:22,462 --> 00:19:24,998
AH. THIS IS HARD
TO WATCH BECAUSE

353
00:19:24,998 --> 00:19:27,500
I CARE ABOUT THEM BOTH
SO MUCH.

354
00:19:27,500 --> 00:19:28,868
I CARE ABOUT THE BOXES.

355
00:19:28,868 --> 00:19:31,205
WHY SHOULD INNOCENT FREIGHT
HAVE TO SUFFER?

356
00:19:36,142 --> 00:19:37,912
HE LOOKS BETTER
WITHOUT MAKEUP.

357
00:19:37,912 --> 00:19:39,145
YEAH, HE’S SO PRETTY.

358
00:19:39,145 --> 00:19:40,913
HE REALLY DOESN’T NEED IT.

359
00:19:45,485 --> 00:19:49,222
BATTLE OF THE GUYS
WHO PEAKED IN HIGH SCHOOL.

360
00:19:49,222 --> 00:19:51,225
AAH!

361
00:19:51,225 --> 00:19:52,225
AAH!

362
00:19:52,225 --> 00:19:53,227
[LAUGHTER]

363
00:19:53,227 --> 00:19:55,895
[GUTTURAL NOISES]

364
00:19:55,895 --> 00:19:59,232
UGH. I GOT
POINT OF VIEW VERTIGO HERE.

365
00:19:59,232 --> 00:20:01,802
MY TRAINED WEINER
WILL FINISH YOU OFF!

366
00:20:04,037 --> 00:20:05,472
AAH!

367
00:20:05,472 --> 00:20:06,707
AAH!

368
00:20:06,707 --> 00:20:08,442
BAAH!

369
00:20:08,442 --> 00:20:09,877
MERENGUE!

370
00:20:09,877 --> 00:20:10,810
♪ DOO DOO DOO ♪

371
00:20:14,948 --> 00:20:16,750
I’LL JUST WAIT ’TIL
YOU’RE DONE TWIRLING.

372
00:20:16,750 --> 00:20:18,018
AUGH!

373
00:20:19,853 --> 00:20:21,722
[LAUGHS]

374
00:20:21,722 --> 00:20:24,023
PACKERS!

375
00:20:25,925 --> 00:20:28,962
SO THESE GUYS
ARE KUNG-FU FIGHTING.

376
00:20:28,962 --> 00:20:32,598
[LAUGHTER]

377
00:20:32,598 --> 00:20:33,800
[OBJECTS CLATTERING]

378
00:20:33,800 --> 00:20:35,802
MY BELL COLLECTION!

379
00:20:37,303 --> 00:20:40,173
AAH! UH-- AH?

380
00:20:40,173 --> 00:20:41,475
[GROWLING]

381
00:20:44,678 --> 00:20:46,580
[GRUNTS]

382
00:20:46,580 --> 00:20:49,783
THE LARGEST ATTEMPT EVER
TO LOCK IN FRESHNESS.

383
00:20:52,585 --> 00:20:54,922
THIS PART WAS FILMED
THROUGH SOUP.

384
00:20:57,023 --> 00:20:58,392
HMM.

385
00:20:58,392 --> 00:21:01,595
KIM WILDE COULD
DO A VIDEO HERE.

386
00:21:03,797 --> 00:21:07,567
I’M ALL MOVED IN, BUT I’M STILL
LIVING OUT OF BOXES.

387
00:21:10,770 --> 00:21:13,140
HE’S USING SENSE MEMORY.

388
00:21:13,140 --> 00:21:14,808
AN ACTOR PREPARES...

389
00:21:14,808 --> 00:21:16,075
TO SUCK.

390
00:21:16,075 --> 00:21:19,747
HE STUDIED UNDER
LEE STRASBERG’S CAR.

391
00:21:19,747 --> 00:21:22,915
HE’S READ UTA HAGEN’S
"RESPECT FOR ACTING...

392
00:21:22,915 --> 00:21:25,152
LIKE AN IMBECILE."

393
00:21:27,020 --> 00:21:29,055
YOU KNOW, HE SHOULD PROBABLY
THROW AN EMPTY BOX

394
00:21:29,055 --> 00:21:31,090
JUST TO KEEP
FROM GETTIN’ RUSTY.

395
00:21:31,090 --> 00:21:33,027
[GROWLING]

396
00:21:36,697 --> 00:21:38,798
I’M DOING THE
MAKING-OUT-WITH-MYSELF GAG

397
00:21:38,798 --> 00:21:40,967
AND NO ONE’S HERE
TO ENJOY IT.

398
00:21:43,337 --> 00:21:45,405
GEEZ,
WHERE’D I PACK THE CAN OPENER?

399
00:21:50,043 --> 00:21:52,412
I CONTINUE
TO REMAIN COLD.

400
00:21:56,883 --> 00:21:58,885
OH, THE WAREHOUSE COVERED
EVERYTHING IN VINYL

401
00:21:58,885 --> 00:22:00,920
SO NO ONE SITS
ON THEIR GOOD BOXES.

402
00:22:03,757 --> 00:22:05,158
[GROWLING]

403
00:22:05,158 --> 00:22:07,627
MM. DO I HAVE SOMETHING
IN MY TEETH? MM.

404
00:22:11,498 --> 00:22:13,633
ALL RIGHT. THERE SHOULD BE
A DELAY-OF-MOVIE PENALTY

405
00:22:13,633 --> 00:22:14,667
RIGHT ABOUT NOW.

406
00:22:14,667 --> 00:22:15,902
[WHISTLE]
FIFTEEN YARDS.

407
00:22:15,902 --> 00:22:18,938
[GROWLING]

408
00:22:18,938 --> 00:22:21,140
KOOL-AID VISION.

409
00:22:22,475 --> 00:22:23,510
NOTHING, NOTHING.

410
00:22:23,510 --> 00:22:24,610
I DON’T HEAR YA,
DINOSAUR.

411
00:22:24,610 --> 00:22:28,013
LA LA LA LA LA.
DON’T YEAR YA.

412
00:22:29,448 --> 00:22:31,452
THIS DINOSAUR USED TO RULE
HOLLYWOOD.

413
00:22:31,452 --> 00:22:33,420
NOW SPIELBERG WON’T
RETURN HIS CALLS.

414
00:22:33,420 --> 00:22:34,722
MM. SAD.

415
00:22:34,722 --> 00:22:35,655
CH-YA!

416
00:22:36,723 --> 00:22:38,725
YOW!
THAT HURTS!

417
00:22:38,725 --> 00:22:39,727
[LAUGHS]

418
00:22:39,727 --> 00:22:41,995
KILLED BY A PENCIL!

419
00:22:56,075 --> 00:22:57,277
LAY THAT HAM UP THERE.

420
00:22:57,277 --> 00:22:58,278
THERE WE GO.

421
00:22:58,278 --> 00:22:59,880
THERE’S THE NEW LEGS,

422
00:22:59,880 --> 00:23:01,280
BUT I DON’T THINK
THEY’RE GONNA BE VERY
FUNCTIONAL.

423
00:23:01,280 --> 00:23:02,348
THAT’S OKAY.
THANKS, MIKE.

424
00:23:02,348 --> 00:23:03,883
HELLO, FOLKS!

425
00:23:03,883 --> 00:23:06,052
YOU MAY BE WONDERING
WHY I’M NOT KICKBOXING RIGHT
NOW.

426
00:23:06,052 --> 00:23:07,353
I APOLOGIZE.

427
00:23:07,353 --> 00:23:09,722
YOU HAVE EVERY RIGHT TO EXPECT
CONSTANT KICKBOXING!

428
00:23:09,722 --> 00:23:12,525
BUT THE TRUTH IS,
UNTIL RECENTLY I HAD NO LEGS.

429
00:23:12,525 --> 00:23:15,895
HOWEVER! I JUST REMEDIED THAT
BY ACTUALLY MAKING MYSELF SOME!

430
00:23:15,895 --> 00:23:17,097
HAHA!

431
00:23:17,097 --> 00:23:19,098
SO GET READY FOR SOME HOT
KICKBOXING ACTION!

432
00:23:19,098 --> 00:23:21,802
THE FIRST POOR SHMOE COMES ALONG
IS GONNA GET A TASTE OF MY

433
00:23:21,802 --> 00:23:24,070
ASHLEY JUDD-LIKE
KICKBOXING WRATH.

434
00:23:24,070 --> 00:23:27,073
♪ YOU SHOOK ME
ALL NIGHT LONG ♪

435
00:23:27,073 --> 00:23:28,542
AH, A CHALLENGER.

436
00:23:28,542 --> 00:23:29,943
HI, TOM.

437
00:23:29,943 --> 00:23:32,312
HA! YOU DARE TO OPPOSE ME,
STRANGE TOP-HEAVY PURPLE ONE?

438
00:23:32,312 --> 00:23:33,313
WHAT?

439
00:23:33,313 --> 00:23:35,115
PREPARE TO BE KICKBOXED
BY MY NEW LEGS!

440
00:23:35,115 --> 00:23:36,650
I DON’T WANNA FIGHT,
TOM.

441
00:23:36,650 --> 00:23:37,683
I LIKE YOU.

442
00:23:37,683 --> 00:23:38,985
YOU WILL FIGHT,
COWARD!

443
00:23:38,985 --> 00:23:40,120
[GRUNTING]

444
00:23:40,120 --> 00:23:41,522
GOSH DANG IT!
COME ON, LEGS!

445
00:23:41,522 --> 00:23:43,257
THEY’RE PRETTY NEW LEGS,
TOM.

446
00:23:43,257 --> 00:23:44,825
FAWNING FLATTERY
WILL NOT HELP YOU.

447
00:23:44,825 --> 00:23:46,793
[GRUNT]
DUMB, STUPIDY, STINKY LEGS.

448
00:23:46,793 --> 00:23:47,960
OH! AAH! WOW!

449
00:23:47,960 --> 00:23:49,562
OH, BOY!
OH, GEEZ!

450
00:23:49,562 --> 00:23:51,330
JUST A TEMPORARY SETBACK.

451
00:23:51,330 --> 00:23:52,532
DO YOU NEED HELP,
TOM?

452
00:23:52,532 --> 00:23:54,333
NO! NO.
[GRUNTS]

453
00:23:54,333 --> 00:23:55,502
PHEW!
THERE.

454
00:23:55,502 --> 00:23:57,503
NOW STOP YOUR
PATHETIC DELAYING TACTICS.

455
00:23:57,503 --> 00:23:58,938
I INSIST YOU FIGHT ME,
WEAKLING!

456
00:23:58,938 --> 00:24:00,573
WELL,
IF YOU WANT.

457
00:24:00,573 --> 00:24:01,808
OKAY, TOM.

458
00:24:01,808 --> 00:24:02,808
OH. OH, BOY!

459
00:24:02,808 --> 00:24:04,377
HI-YA!

460
00:24:04,377 --> 00:24:05,378
OW!

461
00:24:05,378 --> 00:24:06,378
[CRASHING]

462
00:24:06,378 --> 00:24:07,580
SORRY.

463
00:24:07,580 --> 00:24:09,448
I THOUGHT YOU DIDN’T
HAVE LEGS EITHER!

464
00:24:09,448 --> 00:24:10,617
JUST MADE IT TODAY.

465
00:24:10,617 --> 00:24:11,685
NEAT, HUH?

466
00:24:11,685 --> 00:24:13,753
WE’LL BE RIGHT BACK.

467
00:24:13,753 --> 00:24:16,055
I SHOULD MAKE
ANOTHER ONE.

468
00:24:26,933 --> 00:24:29,035
OH.

469
00:24:33,407 --> 00:24:35,275
[GASPS]

470
00:24:35,275 --> 00:24:37,943
WOW.
SISTER VEHICULAR HOMICIDE.

471
00:24:39,512 --> 00:24:42,782
OH, GREAT.
THIRD TIME THIS WEEK.

472
00:24:42,782 --> 00:24:45,218
I’LL JUST LEAVE
A NOTE ON HIM.

473
00:24:45,218 --> 00:24:47,987
YEAH, HE’S ALIVE.
SOMEBODY HELP ME!

474
00:24:47,987 --> 00:24:51,457
PLEASE!
SOMEBODY HELP ME!

475
00:24:53,560 --> 00:24:54,793
HELP ME,
SISTER ROSCOE.

476
00:24:54,793 --> 00:24:56,262
FRED.
OH, FRED.

477
00:24:56,262 --> 00:24:58,232
I’M ALL
FLIBBERTIGIBBET.

478
00:24:58,232 --> 00:25:01,668
IN THE CAR.
A MAN.

479
00:25:01,668 --> 00:25:03,102
HER HAIR WEAVE
DOESN’T BLEND IN THAT WELL.

480
00:25:03,102 --> 00:25:05,005
THERE’S AN INJURED MAN
IN THE CAR.

481
00:25:05,005 --> 00:25:07,173
HE NEEDS OUR HELP.

482
00:25:07,173 --> 00:25:09,242
HEY, OSCAR!
WE NEED YOUR HELP OUTSIDE.

483
00:25:09,242 --> 00:25:12,178
I’LL LOAN HIM
SOME FLESH.

484
00:25:12,178 --> 00:25:15,782
ANN?
LONG TIME NO SEE.

485
00:25:15,782 --> 00:25:18,452
SHE’S WEARING
A MATERNITY HABIT.

486
00:25:21,287 --> 00:25:22,588
YOUR VAN
IS UNDER ARREST

487
00:25:22,588 --> 00:25:25,892
FOR NOT HAVING "SCENE"
PAINTED ON THE SIDE.

488
00:25:25,892 --> 00:25:27,993
THE VAN MUST BE HAVING
EMISSIONS PROBLEMS.

489
00:25:27,993 --> 00:25:33,233
IT’S BLACKENED
THE LOWER ATMOSPHERE.

490
00:25:33,233 --> 00:25:35,068
HEY, WHAT DO WE’VE GOT?

491
00:25:35,068 --> 00:25:37,737
HOMELESS GUY WITH HIS
THROAT RIPPED OUT.

492
00:25:37,737 --> 00:25:39,338
BY WHAT?

493
00:25:39,338 --> 00:25:40,573
WHO CARES?

494
00:25:40,573 --> 00:25:42,908
FIGURE MOUNTAIN LION, GRIZZLIES
COME OUT OF THE HILLS

495
00:25:42,908 --> 00:25:44,077
IN SEARCH OF FOOD.

496
00:25:44,077 --> 00:25:46,378
FOUND THIS
POOR BASTARD INSTEAD.

497
00:25:46,378 --> 00:25:47,947
GREAT.
JUST GREAT.

498
00:25:47,947 --> 00:25:49,548
HAS ANYBODY CALLED
THE HUMANE SOCIETY?

499
00:25:49,548 --> 00:25:50,550
THE ZOO?

500
00:25:50,550 --> 00:25:52,185
THEY’RE SENDING
SOME PEOPLE OUT.

501
00:25:52,185 --> 00:25:53,620
CAPTAIN!

502
00:25:53,620 --> 00:25:55,022
HE DROPPED
SOMETHING HERE.

503
00:25:55,022 --> 00:25:57,723
I FOUND PART OF A BURGER.
I WANNA KNOW IF I CAN EAT IT?

504
00:26:00,727 --> 00:26:03,530
IT’S NOT THAT DIRTY.
SPLIT IT WITH YA.

505
00:26:03,530 --> 00:26:05,665
WE FOUND THIS.

506
00:26:05,665 --> 00:26:08,602
WHAT THE HELL MADE THAT?

507
00:26:08,602 --> 00:26:10,903
THAT’S YOUR SHADOW,
BOSS.

508
00:26:10,903 --> 00:26:14,107
[BIRDS CHIRPING]

509
00:26:14,107 --> 00:26:16,508
JESUS.

510
00:26:16,508 --> 00:26:18,478
I THINK I SHOULD
BE WEARING A TIE.

511
00:26:18,478 --> 00:26:19,478
OW!

512
00:26:19,478 --> 00:26:21,013
OH, MY GOUT!

513
00:26:21,013 --> 00:26:23,883
I MEAN,
DON’T GIVE ME A HARD TIME,
OKAY?

514
00:26:23,883 --> 00:26:25,585
I THINK YOU
BROKE A BONE.

515
00:26:25,585 --> 00:26:27,420
I MEAN,
WHAT IS THIS BULL?

516
00:26:27,420 --> 00:26:28,988
I MEAN,
NO SPECIAL FAVORS.

517
00:26:28,988 --> 00:26:30,523
OKAY,
ANYTHING YOU SAY.

518
00:26:30,523 --> 00:26:32,458
[...]

519
00:26:32,458 --> 00:26:34,760
AND WATCH THAT LANGUAGE.

520
00:26:34,760 --> 00:26:36,062
OKAY, OKAY.

521
00:26:36,062 --> 00:26:37,997
HEY, SO NOW YOU DON’T LIKE
MY COOKING, SISTER?

522
00:26:37,997 --> 00:26:39,565
OH, NO.
I’M JUST NOT HUNGRY.

523
00:26:39,565 --> 00:26:40,900
THANKS FOR COOKIN’.

524
00:26:40,900 --> 00:26:42,702
HEY, I HAVE SOME
NICE CHOCOLATE CAKE,

525
00:26:42,702 --> 00:26:43,870
SOME MOCHA ALMOND
ICE CREAM.

526
00:26:43,870 --> 00:26:44,937
HEY I’LL HAVE SOME.

527
00:26:44,937 --> 00:26:46,405
NO, THANKS.
I THINK I’LL PASS.

528
00:26:46,405 --> 00:26:48,273
IS THIS A HALFWAY HOUSE
FOR HUGE GUYS?

529
00:26:48,273 --> 00:26:50,443
[LAUGHTER]

530
00:26:50,443 --> 00:26:51,678
THIS IS WORSE
THAN I THOUGHT.

531
00:26:51,678 --> 00:26:54,680
THERE’S NO BUTTER
IN MY COFFEE.

532
00:26:56,115 --> 00:26:58,585
YOU’RE AT HOME NOW,
ANNIE.

533
00:26:58,585 --> 00:27:01,420
SO WHAT’S GOIN’ ON?

534
00:27:01,420 --> 00:27:04,457
WHOA!
THAT’S WHAT’S GOIN’ ON!

535
00:27:04,457 --> 00:27:05,725
OKAY, LET’S SEE.

536
00:27:05,725 --> 00:27:09,062
I’LL TAKE HIS WALLET,
AND HIS ECHINACEA,

537
00:27:09,062 --> 00:27:10,830
OOH,
AND HIS GOAT CHEESE.

538
00:27:10,830 --> 00:27:11,932
SHOULD I?

539
00:27:11,932 --> 00:27:14,667
YES I’LL TAKE HIS
’70s WATCH.

540
00:27:14,667 --> 00:27:16,102
YOU KNOW MAYBE I’M--

541
00:27:16,102 --> 00:27:17,970
MAYBE I’M NOT
MEANT FOR THIS.

542
00:27:17,970 --> 00:27:21,073
MAYBE I’M MEANT
FOR SOMETHING ELSE.

543
00:27:21,073 --> 00:27:22,808
MAYBE.

544
00:27:22,808 --> 00:27:25,712
SISTER SUPERIOR SAYS
THAT I’M HAVING

545
00:27:25,712 --> 00:27:27,547
A CRISIS OF FAITH.

546
00:27:27,547 --> 00:27:28,615
[IMITATES BELCH]

547
00:27:28,615 --> 00:27:30,717
MAYBE.

548
00:27:30,717 --> 00:27:31,752
WELL, WHAT DO YOU THINK?

549
00:27:31,752 --> 00:27:34,953
I THINK I LIKE
THE HAAGEN DAZS BETTER.

550
00:27:34,953 --> 00:27:36,155
MAYBE.

551
00:27:36,155 --> 00:27:37,390
COME ON.

552
00:27:37,390 --> 00:27:40,360
I’M LOOKING FOR SOME
COUNSELING HERE, FRED.

553
00:27:40,360 --> 00:27:42,262
HEY, I CUT MEAT,
YA KNOW?

554
00:27:42,262 --> 00:27:45,065
PERSONALLY, I THINK YOU’RE
GETTING A LITTLE STUPID

555
00:27:45,065 --> 00:27:46,632
ABOUT THAT KID THAT
BOUGHT THE FARM.

556
00:27:46,632 --> 00:27:47,767
HMM?

557
00:27:47,767 --> 00:27:51,070
REMEMBER JIMMY HO?
REMEMBER LENA MELCHER?

558
00:27:51,070 --> 00:27:52,172
I HEARD ABOUT TERRY.

559
00:27:52,172 --> 00:27:53,172
MINK STOLE.

560
00:27:53,172 --> 00:27:54,173
SORRY.

561
00:27:54,173 --> 00:27:55,508
HOW’S OUR GUEST?

562
00:27:55,508 --> 00:27:56,542
UNCONSCIOUS.

563
00:27:56,542 --> 00:27:57,577
LOOK WHAT I FOUND.

564
00:27:57,577 --> 00:27:59,945
CALISTA FLOCKHART’S
BELT.

565
00:27:59,945 --> 00:28:02,148
MAYBE HE’S INTO SOME KINDA
BONDAGE THING.

566
00:28:02,148 --> 00:28:03,717
SMART GUY.

567
00:28:03,717 --> 00:28:06,552
I PATCHED UP WHAT I COULD
WITHOUT X-RAYS.

568
00:28:06,552 --> 00:28:08,588
I’LL KNOW MORE TOMORROW.

569
00:28:08,588 --> 00:28:09,922
WHY DON’T YOU HAVE
A SEAT, NURSE?

570
00:28:09,922 --> 00:28:11,057
YEAH, COME ON.
SIT DOWN.

571
00:28:11,057 --> 00:28:12,058
NAH, NO TIME.

572
00:28:12,058 --> 00:28:13,325
I GOTTA GET BACK
TO THE CLINIC.

573
00:28:13,325 --> 00:28:15,395
TERRIBLE HABIT,
GIRL.

574
00:28:15,395 --> 00:28:16,695
HEY, NOT ON THE FLOOR.

575
00:28:16,695 --> 00:28:18,197
IT’S GOOD TO HAVE YOU BACK,
ANN.

576
00:28:18,197 --> 00:28:19,298
THANKS.

577
00:28:19,298 --> 00:28:21,868
I’LL STOP BY AFTER MY SHIFT,
OKAY?

578
00:28:21,868 --> 00:28:22,868
BYE.

579
00:28:22,868 --> 00:28:23,870
BYE.

580
00:28:23,870 --> 00:28:25,238
HEY, YOU WANT SOMETHIN’,
MAX?

581
00:28:25,238 --> 00:28:27,373
UNCLE FRED SAYS
YOU DON’T HAVE A HUSBAND.

582
00:28:27,373 --> 00:28:28,975
UNCLE FRED SAYS
YOU’RE GONNA SHAVE YOUR HEAD

583
00:28:28,975 --> 00:28:30,743
AND TURN INTO
A PENGUIN.

584
00:28:30,743 --> 00:28:31,778
A PENGUIN.

585
00:28:31,778 --> 00:28:32,778
CAN I WATCH?

586
00:28:32,778 --> 00:28:34,547
IT WAS A METAPHOR.

587
00:28:34,547 --> 00:28:36,750
HE SAYS YOU DON’T KNOW
WHAT YOU’RE DOING.

588
00:28:36,750 --> 00:28:38,852
MAX. IT’S TIME
TO GO TO BED NOW.

589
00:28:38,852 --> 00:28:39,852
GO BRUSH YOUR TEETH.

590
00:28:39,852 --> 00:28:40,853
GO ON.

591
00:28:40,853 --> 00:28:41,855
SAY GOODNIGHT.

592
00:28:41,855 --> 00:28:42,855
NIGHT,
MOM AND DAD.

593
00:28:42,855 --> 00:28:44,490
YOU’RE RIGHT,
YOU KNOW.

594
00:28:44,490 --> 00:28:46,358
AW, COME ON, ANNIE.
I WAS JUST TALKIN’.

595
00:28:46,358 --> 00:28:48,293
MM, TWO DAYS AGO
I WAS SO SURE.

596
00:28:48,293 --> 00:28:50,130
AND WHAT?
TODAY YOU DON’T KNOW NOTHIN’?

597
00:28:50,130 --> 00:28:52,832
IT’S HARD BEING
A NUN WITH A FAMILY.

598
00:28:52,832 --> 00:28:57,870
LOOK. WHEN WE MET,
YOU WERE HIDING FROM A PIMP.

599
00:28:57,870 --> 00:28:59,405
YOU JUST DID A MONTH
IN THE JOINT.

600
00:28:59,405 --> 00:29:01,340
YOU WERE SUICIDAL
AND ADDICTED.

601
00:29:01,340 --> 00:29:02,808
AND YA THREW
IT ALL AWAY.

602
00:29:02,808 --> 00:29:04,277
KEEPING YOU IN HERE
WAS HARD.

603
00:29:05,745 --> 00:29:07,213
WHEN LENA WAS KILLED

604
00:29:07,213 --> 00:29:08,982
BY SOME GUY

605
00:29:08,982 --> 00:29:11,918
WIRED UP ON THE DRUGS
HE BOUGHT FROM ME.

606
00:29:11,918 --> 00:29:13,887
AW, COME OFF IT,
ANNIE.

607
00:29:13,887 --> 00:29:15,255
IT’S LIKE I PULLED
THE TRIGGER.

608
00:29:15,255 --> 00:29:16,957
BUT YOU DIDN’T.
HE DID.

609
00:29:16,957 --> 00:29:18,692
YOU CAME HERE.

610
00:29:18,692 --> 00:29:19,892
GOT CLEAN.

611
00:29:19,892 --> 00:29:21,660
YOU HELPED OTHER GIRLS
OFF THE JUNK

612
00:29:21,660 --> 00:29:22,895
AND OFF THE STREET.

613
00:29:22,895 --> 00:29:23,897
HMPH.

614
00:29:23,897 --> 00:29:25,097
THAT MEANS SOMETHING,
ANNIE.

615
00:29:25,097 --> 00:29:28,133
IT MEANS GREAT SERVICE
AND LOW, LOW PRICES.

616
00:29:30,737 --> 00:29:31,737
[SIGH]

617
00:29:31,737 --> 00:29:35,175
I WAS A GREAT HOOKER.

618
00:29:35,175 --> 00:29:36,810
[SIGH]

619
00:29:36,810 --> 00:29:38,612
I’M GONNA GO UP NORTH
AND VISIT AN AUNT.

620
00:29:38,612 --> 00:29:40,813
SHE LIVES
ON AN "AUNT" FARM.

621
00:29:40,813 --> 00:29:41,815
[LAUGHTER]

622
00:29:41,815 --> 00:29:44,050
TAKE CARE OF THAT GUY.

623
00:29:44,050 --> 00:29:45,252
LISTEN, KID.

624
00:29:45,252 --> 00:29:47,887
EVERYTHING’S GONNA
WORK OUT JUST FINE.

625
00:29:47,887 --> 00:29:48,922
YOU’LL SEE.

626
00:29:48,922 --> 00:29:50,957
AH.
WHAT IF GOD WAS ONE OF US?

627
00:29:50,957 --> 00:29:51,992
I HOPE SO.

628
00:29:51,992 --> 00:29:53,760
[CRICKETS]

629
00:29:53,760 --> 00:29:56,528
PROMISE MARGARINE.
A NEW KIND OF SPREAD.

630
00:29:57,963 --> 00:29:59,532
GUESS HE’S AWAKE.

631
00:29:59,532 --> 00:30:00,533
YUP.

632
00:30:00,533 --> 00:30:01,533
HOW’S HE DOING?

633
00:30:01,533 --> 00:30:02,568
OKAY.

634
00:30:02,568 --> 00:30:03,570
I TRIED TO TALK TO HIM.

635
00:30:03,570 --> 00:30:05,505
ENGLISH. SPANISH.

636
00:30:05,505 --> 00:30:08,140
HE DOESN’T TALK,
BUT I THINK HE UNDERSTANDS.

637
00:30:08,140 --> 00:30:09,675
I LEFT HIM
IN THE DAY-CARE ROOM.

638
00:30:09,675 --> 00:30:10,977
HMM.
LET’S GO HAVE A LOOK.

639
00:30:10,977 --> 00:30:12,945
THEY MUST GO THROUGH
A LOT OF ZUBAZ IN THIS HOUSE.

640
00:30:12,945 --> 00:30:14,247
MM-HMM.

641
00:30:14,247 --> 00:30:17,583
AND MAYBE HE CAN TELL US
WHAT THIS THING IS FOR.

642
00:30:17,583 --> 00:30:18,718
WHERE’RE YOU GOIN’?

643
00:30:18,718 --> 00:30:20,720
I’M GONNA
GO TO MY ROOM AND PACK.

644
00:30:20,720 --> 00:30:22,255
I WANNA BE ON THE ROAD
BY 12:00.

645
00:30:22,255 --> 00:30:23,288
OH, NO.
AREN’T YOU GONNA STAY

646
00:30:23,288 --> 00:30:24,723
AND HELP US WITH THIS GUY?

647
00:30:24,723 --> 00:30:25,725
HE’S YOURS.

648
00:30:25,725 --> 00:30:26,825
YEAH, SISTER, COME ON.

649
00:30:26,825 --> 00:30:28,160
YOU’RE GOOD AT THIS
KIND OF THING.

650
00:30:28,160 --> 00:30:31,397
THEY DON’T GET
THE ALL-KICKBOXING STATION.

651
00:30:32,498 --> 00:30:35,000
SORRY, I ATE YOUR
BREAKFAST ON THE WAY IN.

652
00:30:35,000 --> 00:30:37,203
[STATIC]

653
00:30:37,203 --> 00:30:39,305
IT’S HARD TO SAMPLE
OFF THE RADIO.

654
00:30:39,305 --> 00:30:40,240
MM.

655
00:30:43,743 --> 00:30:45,143
[IMITATES FLATULENCE]

656
00:30:45,143 --> 00:30:48,247
OH, SORRY.
THAT’S NOT VERY APPETIZING,
IS IT?

657
00:30:49,915 --> 00:30:51,183
[LAUGHS]

658
00:30:51,183 --> 00:30:53,018
I JUST THOUGHT OF A GREAT JOKE
FROM NUNSENSE.

659
00:30:58,457 --> 00:31:00,393
GOOD THING WE SWITCHED
PLACES THERE.

660
00:31:02,562 --> 00:31:04,130
HI THERE, I’M FRED.

661
00:31:04,130 --> 00:31:06,065
THAT’S ROMERO AND THAT’S
SISTER ANN.

662
00:31:06,065 --> 00:31:09,535
I ASSUME YOU’VE MET YOUR
CORN WITH PIMENTOS.

663
00:31:09,535 --> 00:31:11,003
HEY, MAN,
WHAT’S YOUR STORY?

664
00:31:11,003 --> 00:31:12,205
A MACY’S BALLOON.

665
00:31:12,205 --> 00:31:13,405
OH, IT’S YOU. HI.

666
00:31:13,405 --> 00:31:16,108
YOU UNDERSTAND ENGLISH?

667
00:31:16,108 --> 00:31:19,545
AH. HE’S GONNA
FIT RIGHT IN.

668
00:31:19,545 --> 00:31:23,683
♪ ALL HIS PANTS
ARE LOW-RIDERS ♪

669
00:31:23,683 --> 00:31:26,385
♪ DOO DOO DOO DOO
DOO DOO DOO DOO DOO ♪

670
00:31:29,388 --> 00:31:31,790
WHERE’S THAT LIGHT STATION
THAT EVERYONE CAN LISTEN TO

671
00:31:31,790 --> 00:31:34,260
AT HOME, IN THE CAR,
OR AT THE OFFICE?

672
00:31:36,095 --> 00:31:38,263
UH, WHO’S UP FOR A SNACK?

673
00:31:48,908 --> 00:31:50,175
TWO HUGE DINOSAURS.

674
00:31:50,175 --> 00:31:51,710
UH--OH, IT’S THOSE GUYS.

675
00:31:51,710 --> 00:31:53,078
LEAVE ME ALONE WITH HIM.

676
00:31:53,078 --> 00:31:55,682
THIS GUY MIGHT BE A PSYCHO.

677
00:31:55,682 --> 00:31:58,050
AND,
UM WHAT DO YOU THINK?

678
00:31:58,050 --> 00:32:00,118
HE’S GONNA OPEN UP
WITH YOU IN THERE?

679
00:32:00,118 --> 00:32:01,553
WELL, WHY NOT?
I’M A LIKABLE GUY.

680
00:32:01,553 --> 00:32:04,123
THE SAD THING IS THEY’RE
ALL FORMER PROSTITUTES.

681
00:32:04,123 --> 00:32:05,592
GIMME THE COLLAR.

682
00:32:05,592 --> 00:32:06,692
YOU JUST SAY THE WORD.

683
00:32:06,692 --> 00:32:08,460
I’LL BE RIGHT OUTSIDE
THE DOOR.

684
00:32:08,460 --> 00:32:09,995
IT WAS FUN TO BE IN HERE
FOR A WHILE,

685
00:32:09,995 --> 00:32:11,463
BUT NOW LET’S
GO IN THERE AGAIN.

686
00:32:11,463 --> 00:32:13,800
[STATIC CONTINUES]

687
00:32:13,800 --> 00:32:17,437
MUST BE MINNEAPOLIS.
HE CAN’T FIND A GOOD STATION.

688
00:32:18,905 --> 00:32:21,607
GERMAN? DUTCH? HUH?

689
00:32:21,607 --> 00:32:22,808
HMM?

690
00:32:22,808 --> 00:32:25,043
HEY, YOU LIKE THE PICTURES
IN THE MAGAZINES?

691
00:32:25,043 --> 00:32:26,645
WHAT OTHER RANDOM THINGS
CAN I SAY?

692
00:32:26,645 --> 00:32:29,115
LAMP?
ELEPHANTS IN THE STREET?

693
00:32:30,917 --> 00:32:32,185
[SIGHS]

694
00:32:32,185 --> 00:32:33,352
IS THIS YOURS?

695
00:32:33,352 --> 00:32:36,255
I’M GONNA WEAR IT
TO THE RAVE TONIGHT.

696
00:32:37,990 --> 00:32:40,258
HANG YOUR CRAPPY ART
HIGH ON THE WALL.

697
00:32:40,258 --> 00:32:42,895
THIS IS A CON.

698
00:32:42,895 --> 00:32:45,832
YOU CAN HEAR US,
AND I THINK YOU
UNDERSTAND US.

699
00:32:45,832 --> 00:32:48,000
US BEING ME AND THE LAMP.

700
00:32:48,000 --> 00:32:49,635
YOU WANNA GIVE
US A BREAK?

701
00:32:49,635 --> 00:32:51,370
[RADIO MUSIC]

702
00:32:51,370 --> 00:32:52,472
MM. THAT BASS.

703
00:32:52,472 --> 00:32:54,673
SOMEWHERE SEINFELD
MUST BE STARTING.

704
00:32:54,673 --> 00:32:56,642
GUESS NOT.

705
00:32:56,642 --> 00:32:58,945
WELL, ENJOY.

706
00:32:58,945 --> 00:33:00,713
I DON’T THINK
I WILL ENJOY,

707
00:33:00,713 --> 00:33:02,715
IF IT’S ALL RIGHT WITH YOU.

708
00:33:04,317 --> 00:33:06,118
GREAT WARREN MOON
IMPRESSION.

709
00:33:06,118 --> 00:33:07,120
MM. MM-HMM.

710
00:33:07,120 --> 00:33:09,722
[BREATHING HEAVILY]

711
00:33:09,722 --> 00:33:11,657
WELL.

712
00:33:11,657 --> 00:33:14,627
THANK YOU
FOR NOT KILLING ME.

713
00:33:14,627 --> 00:33:17,463
THEY SHOULD MAKE
A HALLMARK CARD FOR THAT.

714
00:33:20,900 --> 00:33:23,268
MM. HMM.

715
00:33:23,268 --> 00:33:26,038
HEY, YOU’RE THE SAME SIZE
AS MY ALSATIAN.

716
00:33:26,038 --> 00:33:28,473
OH. OH.

717
00:33:30,108 --> 00:33:33,378
THERE’S...
THERE’S SOMETHING WRONG WITH
YOUR THROAT.

718
00:33:33,378 --> 00:33:34,713
YEAH.

719
00:33:34,713 --> 00:33:37,650
YOU CAN UNDERSTAND US,
BUT YOU CAN’T TALK, RIGHT?

720
00:33:37,650 --> 00:33:39,385
IS THAT IT? IS THAT IT?

721
00:33:39,385 --> 00:33:40,587
NO, JUST CHOKIN’ YA.

722
00:33:40,587 --> 00:33:43,588
WHEN I NOD MY HEAD LIKE THIS,
I MEAN "YES."

723
00:33:43,588 --> 00:33:45,090
IS THAT IT? YES?

724
00:33:45,090 --> 00:33:48,460
AND WHEN I SHAKE MY HEAD NO,
I MEAN "NO."

725
00:33:48,460 --> 00:33:50,362
RIGHT? YES.

726
00:33:50,362 --> 00:33:51,797
YES.

727
00:33:51,797 --> 00:33:53,733
WE’RE ALL OUT OF STEAK.

728
00:33:53,733 --> 00:33:56,268
WHERE ARE YOU FROM?

729
00:33:58,703 --> 00:34:00,940
HEY, MAYBE YOU CAN WRITE.

730
00:34:00,940 --> 00:34:04,443
OKAY. UM...

731
00:34:04,443 --> 00:34:07,913
A, B, C.

732
00:34:07,913 --> 00:34:10,115
IT’S NOT EVEN "ASS,"
SERVO.

733
00:34:10,115 --> 00:34:11,317
GO ON.

734
00:34:11,317 --> 00:34:15,053
[PRONOUNCES ALPHABET
PHONETICALLY]

735
00:34:18,958 --> 00:34:20,125
NOT A CLUE.

736
00:34:20,125 --> 00:34:21,827
HE’S GOT LADY WEIGHTLIFTER
CLEAVAGE.

737
00:34:21,827 --> 00:34:22,828
HEY, THE MAP.

738
00:34:22,828 --> 00:34:24,397
LET’S SEE...

739
00:34:24,397 --> 00:34:25,698
HERE?

740
00:34:25,698 --> 00:34:26,698
[GRUNTS]

741
00:34:26,698 --> 00:34:27,700
ARE YOU FROM HERE?

742
00:34:27,700 --> 00:34:29,802
CANARY ISLANDS? MOROCCO?

743
00:34:29,802 --> 00:34:32,738
NEW JERSEY? HONG KONG?
SAUK RAPIDS? WHAT?

744
00:34:32,738 --> 00:34:33,738
HERE?

745
00:34:33,738 --> 00:34:35,040
[MOANS]

746
00:34:35,040 --> 00:34:36,875
EH... OH, YOU’RE FROM EH.

747
00:34:36,875 --> 00:34:39,512
[GRUNTS]

748
00:34:39,512 --> 00:34:40,713
I LIVE IN YOUR AIR VENT.

749
00:34:40,713 --> 00:34:44,383
I’M SORRY I CAN’T
UNDERSTAND.

750
00:34:44,383 --> 00:34:46,785
OH. OH. UP HERE?

751
00:34:47,853 --> 00:34:48,855
[MOANS]

752
00:34:48,855 --> 00:34:50,623
YOU THICK WOMAN. MAN!

753
00:34:52,725 --> 00:34:55,327
WHAT HAPPENED?
WE WERE BATTER-DIPPING.

754
00:35:01,933 --> 00:35:04,303
HI. MY NAME’S MAX.

755
00:35:04,303 --> 00:35:07,340
HI. I’M YOUR TOY.
PLEASED TO MEET YOU.

756
00:35:07,340 --> 00:35:09,342
HI. MY NAME’S MAX.

757
00:35:09,342 --> 00:35:11,010
HMM?

758
00:35:11,010 --> 00:35:13,378
[GRUNTING]

759
00:35:13,378 --> 00:35:14,713
WHERE ARE YOU GOING?

760
00:35:14,713 --> 00:35:17,783
I’M GONNA GO VISIT
AN AUNT I HAVE UP NORTH.

761
00:35:17,783 --> 00:35:19,085
I JUST CAME
TO SAY GOODBYE.

762
00:35:19,085 --> 00:35:20,085
[GRUNTS]

763
00:35:20,085 --> 00:35:22,222
SO GOODBYE.

764
00:35:22,222 --> 00:35:23,555
HEY, DON’T WORRY.
THEY’RE GONNA TAKE GOOD CARE--

765
00:35:23,555 --> 00:35:26,358
HEY.

766
00:35:26,358 --> 00:35:30,630
WELL, MAYBE NOW YOU CAN
TELL ME WHERE YOU COME FROM.

767
00:35:30,630 --> 00:35:32,932
- YOU...
- [GRUNTING]

768
00:35:32,932 --> 00:35:34,433
HERE...

769
00:35:34,433 --> 00:35:37,370
I...COME...

770
00:35:37,370 --> 00:35:38,370
I’M SORRY
I DON’T UNDERSTAND.

771
00:35:38,370 --> 00:35:39,638
I WASN’T DONE.

772
00:35:39,638 --> 00:35:41,407
I’M SORRY.

773
00:35:41,407 --> 00:35:43,977
THE SON OF MOE HOWARD.

774
00:35:47,547 --> 00:35:49,615
I’LL HIT YOU SO HARD
WITH THIS,

775
00:35:49,615 --> 00:35:53,518
YOU’LL GO FLYING
THAT WAY, AND--

776
00:35:53,518 --> 00:35:55,420
YEAH.
MAX, DID YOU SHOW HIM

777
00:35:55,420 --> 00:35:56,422
ANY SPACE VIDEOS?

778
00:35:56,422 --> 00:35:58,323
YEAH.

779
00:35:58,323 --> 00:36:01,493
HEY, YOU KNOW YOUR
SPRINKLER WAS ON?

780
00:36:03,595 --> 00:36:05,932
ARE ALL NUNS SO STUPID?

781
00:36:11,170 --> 00:36:12,638
[SCREAMS]

782
00:36:12,638 --> 00:36:15,542
DAMN BUMPUS’S DINOSAURS.

783
00:36:20,412 --> 00:36:22,382
SAVE THE MEAT LOAF.

784
00:36:26,652 --> 00:36:28,653
YEAH, THIS HAPPENS
A COUPLE TIMES A DAY.

785
00:36:34,260 --> 00:36:36,295
NO! THEY’RE MY FRIENDS!

786
00:36:36,295 --> 00:36:39,098
RUN. MUST RUN.

787
00:36:39,098 --> 00:36:40,398
AMWAY.

788
00:36:45,503 --> 00:36:46,705
WHAA.

789
00:36:48,173 --> 00:36:50,542
HEY, IT’S A FULL ASPIRIN
OUT TONIGHT.

790
00:36:52,245 --> 00:36:54,813
UGH. GLAD THE DINOSAUR
GOT THE KID.

791
00:36:54,813 --> 00:36:57,082
REALLY DISTRACTED HIM.

792
00:36:59,052 --> 00:37:00,285
GOD.

793
00:37:00,285 --> 00:37:01,287
THANK YOU.

794
00:37:01,287 --> 00:37:02,688
[GRUNTS]

795
00:37:02,688 --> 00:37:04,790
I THINK WE’VE
OUTRUN THEM.

796
00:37:04,790 --> 00:37:07,760
YOU ARE A PENGUIN?

797
00:37:07,760 --> 00:37:09,795
NO, I’M A PUFFIN.

798
00:37:09,795 --> 00:37:12,598
NO. I’M A SISTER.

799
00:37:12,598 --> 00:37:13,598
NOT A PENGUIN.

800
00:37:13,598 --> 00:37:16,435
YOU KNOW,
ONE OF THE SLEDGE GIRLS.

801
00:37:18,770 --> 00:37:19,738
YOU KNOW...

802
00:37:19,738 --> 00:37:22,775
HOW IS IT YOU KNOW
ENGLISH TODAY

803
00:37:22,775 --> 00:37:23,875
WHEN YOU DIDN’T
KNOW ENGLISH YESTERDAY?

804
00:37:23,875 --> 00:37:25,645
UH, BAD SCREENWRITING,
REALLY.

805
00:37:25,645 --> 00:37:27,980
IT WAS HARD FOR ME
TO UNDERSTAND HIM.

806
00:37:27,980 --> 00:37:29,415
FOR ALL THE PROBLEMS
I HAD,

807
00:37:29,415 --> 00:37:32,217
MAYBE I JUST DIDN’T WANT
TO BE A PART OF HIS.

808
00:37:32,217 --> 00:37:34,653
HE EXPLAINED TO ME HOW
QUICKLY HE COULD LEARN,

809
00:37:34,653 --> 00:37:37,990
HOW HIS VOCAL CORDS NEEDED
TO ADJUST TO SPEAK OUR TONGUE,

810
00:37:37,990 --> 00:37:39,658
AND HOW HE HAD HEARD
OUR WORDS BEFORE.

811
00:37:39,658 --> 00:37:40,660
GO AHEAD.

812
00:37:40,660 --> 00:37:42,093
HIS EYES WERE SO HONEST,

813
00:37:42,093 --> 00:37:45,632
BUT STILL THERE WAS A PART
OF HIM THAT I DIDN’T TRUST.

814
00:37:45,632 --> 00:37:46,632
AND WHO ARE YOU?

815
00:37:46,632 --> 00:37:47,667
A TOOL.

816
00:37:47,667 --> 00:37:49,802
I’M A BOXWRENCH.

817
00:37:49,802 --> 00:37:51,137
AND YOU COME FROM--?

818
00:37:51,137 --> 00:37:52,905
UH, JUST LET ME CHECK THE WIND
AND I’LL TELL YA.

819
00:37:52,905 --> 00:37:54,540
NEVER MIND.

820
00:37:54,540 --> 00:37:56,275
[BELLS CLANGING]

821
00:37:56,275 --> 00:37:58,243
TRAINS BRINGING IN FOOD
FOR THE ROOMMATES.

822
00:38:02,113 --> 00:38:06,252
WELL, I SUPPOSE ONE OF US
HAS TO PLAY HARMONICA.

823
00:38:07,887 --> 00:38:10,890
WANT A LITTLE
CONVENT-ISSUED POT HERE?

824
00:38:10,890 --> 00:38:12,257
HERE.

825
00:38:14,627 --> 00:38:18,130
WILL YOU CHEW IT
AND REGURGITATE IT FOR ME?

826
00:38:18,130 --> 00:38:19,465
MM.

827
00:38:19,465 --> 00:38:21,467
[LAUGHS]

828
00:38:21,467 --> 00:38:24,537
WHOA.
I NEEDED THAT JERKY.

829
00:38:26,272 --> 00:38:27,305
YOU’RE HUMAN.

830
00:38:27,305 --> 00:38:28,507
AND YOU’RE
PUTTING UP WITH ME.

831
00:38:28,507 --> 00:38:30,408
I AM...TOOL.

832
00:38:30,408 --> 00:38:31,743
CALL ME "SNAP-ON."

833
00:38:31,743 --> 00:38:35,080
AND YOU’RE FROM UP THERE.

834
00:38:35,080 --> 00:38:36,682
THE PAGAM.

835
00:38:36,682 --> 00:38:40,687
THE FIRST WERE HARVESTED
FROM THIS WORLD,

836
00:38:40,687 --> 00:38:43,422
LIKE, TRACKERS LONG AGO.

837
00:38:43,422 --> 00:38:44,657
I PREFERRED HIS GRUNTING.

838
00:38:44,657 --> 00:38:47,393
WE ARE USED TO BUILD

839
00:38:47,393 --> 00:38:49,662
BECAUSE...

840
00:38:49,662 --> 00:38:51,363
WE HAVE THESE.

841
00:38:51,363 --> 00:38:53,465
HAMBURGLAR FINGER PUPPETS.

842
00:38:54,533 --> 00:38:56,202
THE MASTER

843
00:38:56,202 --> 00:38:59,438
DO NOT HAVE THESE.

844
00:38:59,438 --> 00:39:00,973
THEY CAN MAKE
THEIR OWN THUMBS,

845
00:39:00,973 --> 00:39:03,042
BUT THEY JUST
DON’T WANT TO?

846
00:39:03,042 --> 00:39:06,245
THEY WANT
US TO DO THE WORK.

847
00:39:06,245 --> 00:39:09,682
YEAH, I KNEW
A FEW PIMPS IN MY TIME.

848
00:39:09,682 --> 00:39:10,817
PIMPS?

849
00:39:10,817 --> 00:39:12,250
DID YOU KNOW ROOSTER?

850
00:39:12,250 --> 00:39:14,353
YOU WOULDN’T UNDERSTAND.

851
00:39:14,353 --> 00:39:16,622
LIKE THE BIBLE SAYS,

852
00:39:16,622 --> 00:39:18,390
MY THOUGHTS
ARE NOT YOUR THOUGHTS.

853
00:39:18,390 --> 00:39:21,793
NEITHER ARE YOUR WAYS
MY WAYS,

854
00:39:21,793 --> 00:39:22,995
SAYS THE LORD.

855
00:39:22,995 --> 00:39:24,630
JACK LORD.

856
00:39:25,898 --> 00:39:27,667
THIS IS A CON.

857
00:39:27,667 --> 00:39:29,168
NO, NO, NO, NO.

858
00:39:29,168 --> 00:39:31,570
NO. NO TRICK. NO LIE.

859
00:39:31,570 --> 00:39:34,173
HOW DOES AN ALIEN-BRED HUMAN

860
00:39:34,173 --> 00:39:36,775
KNOW QUOTES FROM THE BIBLE?

861
00:39:36,775 --> 00:39:39,778
IN THE WORLD WHERE
I AM FROM,

862
00:39:39,778 --> 00:39:43,382
IN THE PLACE WHERE
THE TOOLS ARE KEPT

863
00:39:43,382 --> 00:39:46,618
ARE...
UNSKETCHED WITH WORDS.

864
00:39:46,618 --> 00:39:49,588
A PHRASE
TOLD IN DARKNESS.

865
00:39:49,588 --> 00:39:52,725
I HAVE HEARD
YOUR LANGUAGE BEFORE.

866
00:39:52,725 --> 00:39:56,562
WELL, UM, EXPLAIN THIS
SO I CAN UNDERSTAND IT.

867
00:39:56,562 --> 00:39:58,463
WHY ARE WE ON THIS TRAIN?

868
00:39:58,463 --> 00:40:00,265
THIS PLACE

869
00:40:00,265 --> 00:40:02,902
WAS THE MOST
IMPORTANT STORY.

870
00:40:02,902 --> 00:40:05,503
OUR DREAM.

871
00:40:05,503 --> 00:40:07,440
OUR HEAVEN.

872
00:40:07,440 --> 00:40:08,473
AND NOW,

873
00:40:08,473 --> 00:40:09,508
OUR GANG.

874
00:40:09,508 --> 00:40:10,810
I’M FREE.

875
00:40:10,810 --> 00:40:13,912
- [VOICE OVER]
HE WAS SO HONEST.
- WHAT?

876
00:40:13,912 --> 00:40:15,982
I EXPLAINED TO HIM,
ABOUT THE HEAVENS.

877
00:40:15,982 --> 00:40:18,050
I WAS STUDYING
TO BECOME A NUN.

878
00:40:18,050 --> 00:40:19,152
MM-HMM.

879
00:40:19,152 --> 00:40:20,218
BUT NOW I’M HAVING
SECOND THOUGHTS.

880
00:40:20,218 --> 00:40:22,822
I’M MARY.
THIS IS MY STORY.

881
00:40:22,822 --> 00:40:25,023
WHEN I WAS YOUNGER,
I RAN AWAY AND

882
00:40:25,023 --> 00:40:27,527
I HAVE A PAST THAT
I’M NOT PROUD OF.

883
00:40:27,527 --> 00:40:29,027
THAT’S WHY I KEPT
A SCRAPBOOK.

884
00:40:29,027 --> 00:40:30,028
[LAUGHS]

885
00:40:30,028 --> 00:40:31,530
I FOUND THE CHURCH

886
00:40:31,530 --> 00:40:32,698
AND THEY HELPED ME.

887
00:40:34,267 --> 00:40:37,102
BUT JUST RECENTLY
A FRIEND OF MINE, UM,

888
00:40:37,102 --> 00:40:38,537
DIED OF A DRUG OVERDOSE.

889
00:40:38,537 --> 00:40:39,672
PEPCID AC.

890
00:40:39,672 --> 00:40:42,675
I BLAME MYSELF
FOR HER DEATH.

891
00:40:42,675 --> 00:40:44,143
I DON’T KNOW.

892
00:40:44,143 --> 00:40:46,945
I FEEL SOMEHOW RESPONSIBLE.

893
00:40:46,945 --> 00:40:50,248
I GUESS THAT’S WHY I BLAME
MYSELF FOR THE DEATH.

894
00:40:51,317 --> 00:40:53,452
YEAH, I MADE HER SWALLOW
A POUND OF COKE.

895
00:40:53,452 --> 00:40:54,820
SHE WAS YELLING,
"PLEASE STOP,"

896
00:40:54,820 --> 00:40:56,588
BUT STILL.

897
00:40:56,588 --> 00:40:58,490
[BELLS RINGING]

898
00:40:58,490 --> 00:40:59,792
THE ONLY THING
THAT KEEPS ME GOING

899
00:40:59,792 --> 00:41:02,027
IS MY ALL-BELLS CD.

900
00:41:09,402 --> 00:41:10,668
HEY, YOU KNOW WHAT, GUYS?

901
00:41:10,668 --> 00:41:11,670
WHAT?

902
00:41:11,670 --> 00:41:12,672
WE HAVE BEEN REMISS.

903
00:41:12,672 --> 00:41:13,672
I KNOW WHAT
YOU’RE THINKING.

904
00:41:13,672 --> 00:41:16,008
YEAH,
YOU KNOW WE HAVE NEVER,

905
00:41:16,008 --> 00:41:17,042
LIKE IN THE MOVIE,

906
00:41:17,042 --> 00:41:18,877
THANKED PEARL
FOR NOT KILLING US.

907
00:41:18,877 --> 00:41:19,878
NOT ONCE.

908
00:41:19,878 --> 00:41:21,213
WELL, LET’S DO IT.

909
00:41:21,213 --> 00:41:22,247
RIGHT NOW.

910
00:41:22,247 --> 00:41:23,682
YEAH.

911
00:41:23,682 --> 00:41:25,050
HELLO, PEARL?

912
00:41:25,050 --> 00:41:26,652
[MAN OVER INTERCOM]
SATELLITE KILLER LAUNCH--

913
00:41:26,652 --> 00:41:29,588
SIX...
FIVE...

914
00:41:29,588 --> 00:41:32,525
FOUR...
THREE...

915
00:41:32,525 --> 00:41:33,525
TWO...

916
00:41:33,525 --> 00:41:34,893
YEAH? WHAT?

917
00:41:34,893 --> 00:41:35,995
WELL, UH, PEARL,

918
00:41:35,995 --> 00:41:38,463
I DON’T KNOW
HOW ELSE TO SAY THIS.

919
00:41:38,463 --> 00:41:40,365
UH, THANK YOU
FOR NOT KILLING US.

920
00:41:40,365 --> 00:41:41,667
- YEAH.
- RIGHT.

921
00:41:45,503 --> 00:41:47,438
HUH?

922
00:41:48,507 --> 00:41:50,542
WELL, THAT’S OKAY.

923
00:41:50,542 --> 00:41:51,710
AH--

924
00:41:51,710 --> 00:41:55,280
I WOULD NEVER...

925
00:41:55,280 --> 00:41:56,982
KILL...

926
00:41:56,982 --> 00:42:00,452
BRAIN GUY, GET OVER HERE.

927
00:42:00,452 --> 00:42:03,222
HELLO.

928
00:42:03,222 --> 00:42:04,457
WELL, YOU KNOW,

929
00:42:04,457 --> 00:42:06,625
THINGS GET PRETTY TENSE
BETWEEN US.

930
00:42:06,625 --> 00:42:08,193
WHAT WITH ONE THING
OR ANOTHER, I MEAN,

931
00:42:08,193 --> 00:42:09,762
YOU COULD EASILY
HAVE KILLED US.

932
00:42:09,762 --> 00:42:10,762
AND YOU DIDN’T DO THAT.

933
00:42:10,762 --> 00:42:13,498
SO--SO THANKS.

934
00:42:14,667 --> 00:42:15,968
REALLY, THAT’S OKAY.

935
00:42:15,968 --> 00:42:16,968
AH--

936
00:42:16,968 --> 00:42:18,337
I GUESS I JUST...

937
00:42:18,337 --> 00:42:20,305
TAKE IT FOR GRANTED
THAT I WOULD NEVER...

938
00:42:22,373 --> 00:42:23,575
HOW DO YOU TURN
THE ROCKET?

939
00:42:23,575 --> 00:42:25,410
WELL, FIRST YOU SAY
YOU WANT TO KILL THEM,

940
00:42:25,410 --> 00:42:26,945
THEN YOU SAY YOU DON’T
WANT TO KILL THEM.

941
00:42:26,945 --> 00:42:28,280
I MEAN,
WHAT AM I SUPPOSED TO DO?

942
00:42:28,280 --> 00:42:30,648
WELL, I CAN’T
KILL THEM NOW.

943
00:42:30,648 --> 00:42:32,483
REALLY, DON’T THINK
A SECOND THING ABOUT IT.

944
00:42:32,483 --> 00:42:34,487
"IT WOULD BE SO FUN TO KILL
MIKE AND THE BOTS TODAY."

945
00:42:34,487 --> 00:42:35,587
[GRUNTS]

946
00:42:35,587 --> 00:42:38,023
UM, ANYTHING ELSE
YOU GUYS WANNA ADD?

947
00:42:38,023 --> 00:42:39,123
I DON’T THINK SO.

948
00:42:39,123 --> 00:42:41,393
JUST THANKS.
FOR NOT KILLING US.

949
00:42:41,393 --> 00:42:42,795
YEAH.

950
00:42:42,795 --> 00:42:44,363
YEAH. THAT’S OKAY.

951
00:42:44,363 --> 00:42:45,630
DON’T WORRY ABOUT IT.

952
00:42:45,630 --> 00:42:47,132
BUT, BUT, BUT,
AREN’T YOU KILLING THEM NOW?

953
00:42:47,132 --> 00:42:48,400
SHH.

954
00:42:48,400 --> 00:42:49,802
THEY’RE THANKING YOU
FOR NOT KILLING THEM,

955
00:42:49,802 --> 00:42:50,802
BUT YOU’RE KILLING THEM--

956
00:42:50,802 --> 00:42:52,672
UGH. OH.
[GRUNTS]

957
00:42:52,672 --> 00:42:55,073
THERE. READY.

958
00:42:55,073 --> 00:42:57,810
WELL, I GUESS
THAT’S ABOUT IT.

959
00:42:57,810 --> 00:42:58,810
JUST THANKS FOR NOT KI--

960
00:42:58,810 --> 00:43:01,880
[SHOUTS]

961
00:43:01,880 --> 00:43:02,915
HEY.

962
00:43:02,915 --> 00:43:04,317
HEY, YOU TRIED
TO KILL US.

963
00:43:04,317 --> 00:43:05,317
WHAT THE--?

964
00:43:06,418 --> 00:43:08,187
NO!

965
00:43:08,187 --> 00:43:10,455
I DIDN’T. NO.

966
00:43:10,455 --> 00:43:11,457
NEVER.

967
00:43:11,457 --> 00:43:12,457
YES, YOU DID.

968
00:43:12,457 --> 00:43:13,458
UGH.

969
00:43:13,458 --> 00:43:14,793
[SCOFFS]

970
00:43:14,793 --> 00:43:16,562
WELL,
I JUST THINK THIS CHANGES
EVERYTHING.

971
00:43:16,562 --> 00:43:19,498
I SUPPOSE THERE’S OTHER TIMES
YOU’VE TRIED TO KILL US TOO.

972
00:43:19,498 --> 00:43:20,698
OH,
NOW WE HAVE MOVIE SIGN.

973
00:43:20,698 --> 00:43:22,702
CAN I EVEN TRUST THAT?

974
00:43:22,702 --> 00:43:24,637
I DON’T KNOW.

975
00:43:34,413 --> 00:43:35,713
SISTER ANN?

976
00:43:35,713 --> 00:43:36,715
ARE YOU ALL RIGHT?

977
00:43:36,715 --> 00:43:39,352
I CAN’T BELIEVE IT.
WOW.

978
00:43:39,352 --> 00:43:41,353
EVER SINCE YESTERDAY
AT THE BURIAL

979
00:43:41,353 --> 00:43:43,455
I’VE BEEN ASKING MYSELF...

980
00:43:43,455 --> 00:43:45,023
HOW MUCH
DO UNDERTAKERS MAKE?

981
00:43:45,023 --> 00:43:46,358
WHAT I MISSED.

982
00:43:46,358 --> 00:43:48,693
YOU DIDN’T MISS ANYTHING,
MY DEAR.

983
00:43:48,693 --> 00:43:50,862
IT WASN’T YOUR FAULT.

984
00:43:50,862 --> 00:43:52,463
HOW COME I WASN’T TAKEN?

985
00:43:52,463 --> 00:43:53,832
BECAUSE YOU WEREN’T.

986
00:43:53,832 --> 00:43:54,833
AND THAT’S THAT.

987
00:43:54,833 --> 00:43:56,602
SO SHUT YOUR TRAP.

988
00:43:56,602 --> 00:44:01,573
I DON’T KNOW
IF I’M GOING TO TAKE
MY FINAL VOWS NEXT WEEK.

989
00:44:01,573 --> 00:44:03,542
I HAVE A NAIL APPOINTMENT.

990
00:44:03,542 --> 00:44:05,377
BECAUSE OF TERRY JO?
THAT’S WHAT THIS IS--?

991
00:44:05,377 --> 00:44:07,913
YOU KNOW WHAT I WAS
BEFORE I CAME HERE.

992
00:44:07,913 --> 00:44:10,148
SISTER WILLIAM
LOOKS CONCERNED.

993
00:44:10,148 --> 00:44:11,917
WELL, YOU HAD A RECORD.

994
00:44:11,917 --> 00:44:12,952
SO DID MARY MAGDALENE.

995
00:44:12,952 --> 00:44:14,387
I WAS A WHORE

996
00:44:14,387 --> 00:44:16,088
DOING TRICKS IN BACK ALLEYS.

997
00:44:16,088 --> 00:44:17,155
I SOLD DRUGS.

998
00:44:17,155 --> 00:44:18,623
SISTER ANN, THAT WAS THEN.

999
00:44:18,623 --> 00:44:20,425
THIS IS THEN TOO.
IT’S WEIRD.

1000
00:44:20,425 --> 00:44:22,093
I’M VERY PROUD OF YOU NOW.

1001
00:44:22,093 --> 00:44:24,328
YOU’RE BRINGING IN
A LOT OF CASH
TO THE CONVENT.

1002
00:44:24,328 --> 00:44:26,732
I’M NOT.

1003
00:44:27,833 --> 00:44:29,435
WELL, THEN.

1004
00:44:29,435 --> 00:44:31,870
WE HAVE A PROBLEM HERE,
DON’T WE?

1005
00:44:31,870 --> 00:44:35,173
SHE WAS SMART, SISTER.

1006
00:44:35,173 --> 00:44:37,977
GOOD. TOUGH.

1007
00:44:37,977 --> 00:44:40,012
SHE WAS BUILT "FORD TOUGH."

1008
00:44:40,012 --> 00:44:41,580
SISTER.

1009
00:44:41,580 --> 00:44:43,548
I SHOULD HAVE BEEN THERE
FOR HER WHEN SHE NEEDED ME.

1010
00:44:43,548 --> 00:44:45,150
SISTER ANN.
WHY DON’T YOU TAKE
THE WEEKEND?

1011
00:44:45,150 --> 00:44:46,652
GO OUT TO THE TRACK
OR SOMETHING.

1012
00:44:46,652 --> 00:44:48,887
VISIT YOUR FRIENDS
AND FAMILY.

1013
00:44:48,887 --> 00:44:51,457
PERFECTION IS NOT
ONE OF THE REQUIREMENTS.

1014
00:44:51,457 --> 00:44:52,892
FAITH IS.

1015
00:44:52,892 --> 00:44:55,327
SISTER.
DO YOU BELIEVE IN SIGNS?

1016
00:44:55,327 --> 00:44:57,528
I BELIEVE IN
"YIELD FROM RIGHT."

1017
00:44:57,528 --> 00:44:59,230
I GUESS I DO.

1018
00:44:59,230 --> 00:45:01,267
REALLY? I--I DON’T KNOW
WHAT TO SAY.

1019
00:45:01,267 --> 00:45:02,700
I THOUGHT YOU WERE GONNA
SAY NO.

1020
00:45:02,700 --> 00:45:03,835
KEEP YOUR EYES OPEN.

1021
00:45:03,835 --> 00:45:05,203
CAN’T TRUST THESE NUNS.

1022
00:45:05,203 --> 00:45:07,505
GOD ALWAYS ANSWERS PRAYERS.

1023
00:45:07,505 --> 00:45:09,975
BUT ONLY FROM CATHOLICS.

1024
00:45:12,343 --> 00:45:15,047
WE’LL TAKE A BRIEF BREAK
FROM MY FLASHBACK NOW.

1025
00:45:15,047 --> 00:45:16,982
WHAT ABOUT THE TRACKER?

1026
00:45:16,982 --> 00:45:19,485
WHAT HAPPENS NOW?

1027
00:45:19,485 --> 00:45:21,753
THE TRACKER WILL REST.

1028
00:45:21,753 --> 00:45:23,955
THEN GO BACK.

1029
00:45:23,955 --> 00:45:25,957
WHAT WAS I TALKING ABOUT?

1030
00:45:25,957 --> 00:45:27,893
TO WHERE IT FIRST FOUND US.

1031
00:45:27,893 --> 00:45:29,260
IS HE TALKING ABOUT
A "WARWOLF?"

1032
00:45:29,260 --> 00:45:32,163
I DON’T BELIEVE THIS.

1033
00:45:33,432 --> 00:45:37,502
THIS IS A CITY.
TWELVE-MILLION PUDDY-TATS.

1034
00:45:37,502 --> 00:45:39,403
ARE YOU GOING BACK?

1035
00:45:39,403 --> 00:45:40,638
YES.

1036
00:45:40,638 --> 00:45:42,842
BUT THE TRACKER
HAS YOUR SCENT NOW.

1037
00:45:42,842 --> 00:45:43,842
TOUGH.

1038
00:45:43,842 --> 00:45:44,877
HE’LL HAVE TO DEAL WITH IT.

1039
00:45:44,877 --> 00:45:48,680
IF I GO WITH YOU,
IT WILL FIND ME.

1040
00:45:48,680 --> 00:45:51,082
WELL THEN YOU BETTER
GET BACK ON THE TRAIN.

1041
00:45:51,082 --> 00:45:54,285
SAY, BY THE WAY,
WHAT IS "KISS?"

1042
00:45:54,285 --> 00:45:57,055
I DO NOT UNDERSTAND.

1043
00:45:57,055 --> 00:45:58,457
THIS IS SOMETHING
I HAVE TO DO.

1044
00:45:58,457 --> 00:46:02,227
I’D LIKE TO GIVE YOU
SOME BIG WORDS OF WISDOM,

1045
00:46:02,227 --> 00:46:03,762
BUT I JUST DON’T HAVE ANY.

1046
00:46:03,762 --> 00:46:05,530
MY MIND’S BLANK.

1047
00:46:05,530 --> 00:46:07,332
YOU DO WHAT YOU HAVE TO DO.

1048
00:46:07,332 --> 00:46:08,833
GOODBYE.

1049
00:46:08,833 --> 00:46:10,768
WE DON’T HAVE A PERMIT
TO SHOOT ON THE CURB.

1050
00:46:12,872 --> 00:46:15,307
AM I A WILD AND CRAZY GUY?

1051
00:46:15,307 --> 00:46:17,608
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

1052
00:46:17,608 --> 00:46:18,977
DOING WHAT I BELIEVE TO.

1053
00:46:18,977 --> 00:46:21,078
IS THAT OKAY AT YOU?

1054
00:46:21,078 --> 00:46:23,182
AND WHAT’S THAT?

1055
00:46:23,182 --> 00:46:24,783
I’M GOING WITH YOU.

1056
00:46:24,783 --> 00:46:26,618
LOOK.

1057
00:46:26,618 --> 00:46:28,320
LET’S GET THIS STRAIGHT.

1058
00:46:28,320 --> 00:46:29,320
I WORK ALONE.

1059
00:46:29,320 --> 00:46:31,290
I NUN OUTTA MY HOME.

1060
00:46:31,290 --> 00:46:33,125
ALONE.

1061
00:46:33,125 --> 00:46:36,462
BY MYSELF.
I WANT TO BE ALONE.

1062
00:46:36,462 --> 00:46:42,033
BETTER IS A NEIGHBOR
THAT IS NEAR
THAN A BROTHER FAR OFF.

1063
00:46:42,033 --> 00:46:44,503
UH, THAT’S FROM ONE OF THEM
"CHICKEN SOUP" BOOKS.

1064
00:46:44,503 --> 00:46:46,438
I DON’T WANNA
TALK ABOUT THIS.

1065
00:46:48,373 --> 00:46:50,308
COULD YOU BUTTON MY SHIRT?

1066
00:46:52,277 --> 00:46:56,915
I’M GONNA CALL SISTER GARY
AND SEE IF SHE CAN COVER
MY SHIFT.

1067
00:46:56,915 --> 00:47:00,152
THE NUMBER YOU HAVE REACHED
IS NOT IN SERVICE.

1068
00:47:00,152 --> 00:47:02,587
OH, VATICAN.
PAY YOUR PHONE BILL.

1069
00:47:04,222 --> 00:47:06,057
HEAVEN’S A MESS,
ISN’T IT?

1070
00:47:06,057 --> 00:47:07,625
I DON’T KNOW.
I LIKE IT.

1071
00:47:07,625 --> 00:47:11,497
"THE ALIEN AND THE NUN."
THIS FALL ON CBS.

1072
00:47:11,497 --> 00:47:14,365
HOW MANY PEOPLE
GOT MURDERED TODAY? HUH?

1073
00:47:14,365 --> 00:47:18,537
OR RAPED? BEATEN?
OH. MISSING!

1074
00:47:18,537 --> 00:47:19,938
YOU’RE UPSET.

1075
00:47:19,938 --> 00:47:21,038
YEAH, I’M UPSET.

1076
00:47:21,038 --> 00:47:22,507
DIDN’T MY ACTING
CONVEY THAT?

1077
00:47:22,507 --> 00:47:24,142
BUT YOU WANT
TO HELP YOUR FRIENDS.

1078
00:47:24,142 --> 00:47:26,212
AND THAT’S DIFFERENT.
I KNOW THEM.

1079
00:47:26,212 --> 00:47:27,712
YOU DON’T KNOW ME.

1080
00:47:27,712 --> 00:47:30,282
YOU HELPED ME.

1081
00:47:30,282 --> 00:47:33,252
GREATER LOVE
HAS NO MAN THAN THIS...

1082
00:47:33,252 --> 00:47:36,187
THAN A MAN LAY DOWN
HIS LIFE...

1083
00:47:36,187 --> 00:47:37,222
HEARD IT.

1084
00:47:37,222 --> 00:47:38,357
FOR HIS FRIEND.

1085
00:47:38,357 --> 00:47:41,560
UGH.
I GOTTA GET OUTTA HERE.

1086
00:47:41,560 --> 00:47:43,895
SHOULD WE BE WORRIED
ABOUT OUR FRIENDS?

1087
00:47:43,895 --> 00:47:46,465
THAT IS WHAT I WANT TO BE.

1088
00:47:46,465 --> 00:47:47,598
WHAT?

1089
00:47:47,598 --> 00:47:49,367
A MAN.

1090
00:47:49,367 --> 00:47:50,868
YOU ARE A MAN.

1091
00:47:50,868 --> 00:47:55,140
NO.
I MEAN, GREATER LOVE.

1092
00:47:55,140 --> 00:47:57,142
THAT KIND OF MAN.

1093
00:47:57,142 --> 00:47:59,343
YOU BETTER BE CAREFUL
WHAT YOU WISH FOR.

1094
00:47:59,343 --> 00:48:01,078
SISTER MARY DESPAIR.

1095
00:48:01,078 --> 00:48:02,180
[LAUGHS]

1096
00:48:08,720 --> 00:48:12,290
AH, LIFE IS GOOD.
I LIVE IN MAUI
AND I GOT A MONSTER MAG.

1097
00:48:12,290 --> 00:48:14,893
[LAUGHS]

1098
00:48:14,893 --> 00:48:16,562
[GROWLS]

1099
00:48:16,562 --> 00:48:19,430
♪ WASTIN’ AWAY AGAIN
IN MARGARITAVILLE ♪

1100
00:48:22,400 --> 00:48:23,368
EW.

1101
00:48:25,470 --> 00:48:29,240
HE HAS THE LIVE,
SUPPLE FIGURE
OF JAMES DOOHAN.

1102
00:48:30,408 --> 00:48:32,945
[GROWLING]

1103
00:48:34,578 --> 00:48:36,815
A MAN WAS SNAPPED AT BY
A FORCED-PERSPECTIVE PUPPET
TODAY.

1104
00:48:36,815 --> 00:48:38,417
WE’RE GOING
ON THE ASSUMPTION

1105
00:48:38,417 --> 00:48:42,120
THAT SOME ANIMAL
OUT OF THE HILLS
HAS GONE ON A RAMPAGE.

1106
00:48:42,120 --> 00:48:44,255
THE BODY FOUND HERE
AT THIRD STREET

1107
00:48:44,255 --> 00:48:46,558
MAKES FOUR DEATHS
IN SIX HOURS.

1108
00:48:46,558 --> 00:48:48,560
THIS CREATURE KNOWS
WHERE IT’S GOING.

1109
00:48:48,560 --> 00:48:51,363
I WANT CARS POSTED
ALL ALONG THIS ROUTE.

1110
00:48:51,363 --> 00:48:52,897
MAKE ’EM ALL TERCELS.

1111
00:48:52,897 --> 00:48:55,567
STAY IN CLOSE RADIO CONTACT
AT ALL TIMES.

1112
00:48:55,567 --> 00:48:56,935
LET’S GO.

1113
00:48:59,303 --> 00:49:00,572
IS GOD OUT THERE?

1114
00:49:00,572 --> 00:49:02,307
HE IS OUT THERE, MAN!

1115
00:49:02,307 --> 00:49:05,310
GOD OF GODS.
KING OF KINGS.

1116
00:49:05,310 --> 00:49:07,245
YOU DON’T EVEN KNOW
WHAT YOU’RE SAYING, DO YOU?

1117
00:49:07,245 --> 00:49:08,747
[GIBBERISH]

1118
00:49:08,747 --> 00:49:09,748
YOU DON’T.

1119
00:49:09,748 --> 00:49:11,583
[GIBBERISH]

1120
00:49:11,583 --> 00:49:14,653
WHAT’S OUT THERE?
IS HEAVEN OUT THERE?

1121
00:49:14,653 --> 00:49:15,987
EARTH IS HEAVEN.

1122
00:49:15,987 --> 00:49:18,223
THANKS TO OLESTRA.

1123
00:49:19,490 --> 00:49:21,493
AND THE SUPREME BEING
IS WHAT?

1124
00:49:21,493 --> 00:49:22,860
WELL,
IT’S NOT EARL HOLLIMAN.

1125
00:49:22,860 --> 00:49:25,430
HANDLERS. MASTERS.

1126
00:49:25,430 --> 00:49:28,467
NO, NO, NO, NO. NOT THEM.
GREATER THAN THEM.

1127
00:49:28,467 --> 00:49:31,235
WHAT IS YOUR WORD
FOR "BORING?"

1128
00:49:31,235 --> 00:49:32,937
[LAUGHS]

1129
00:49:32,937 --> 00:49:35,840
THE MOVIE’S DRAGGING,
THEN THEY SHOW US SOCCER.

1130
00:49:35,840 --> 00:49:37,375
GOOD.

1131
00:49:37,375 --> 00:49:40,078
SOCCER’S MY GAME.
I’VE NO ARMS, YA SEE.

1132
00:49:40,078 --> 00:49:42,313
AAH!

1133
00:49:42,313 --> 00:49:43,315
[PHONE RINGING]

1134
00:49:43,315 --> 00:49:44,348
"PUFFY HAT POLICE."

1135
00:49:44,348 --> 00:49:45,583
WESTERN DIVISION.

1136
00:49:45,583 --> 00:49:46,818
OFFICER FRY SPEAKING.

1137
00:49:46,818 --> 00:49:47,952
HOW MAY I HELP YOU?

1138
00:49:47,952 --> 00:49:49,187
HELLO.

1139
00:49:49,187 --> 00:49:50,422
THIS IS MAILBOXES ETC.

1140
00:49:50,422 --> 00:49:51,723
PEOPLE REALLY NEED OUR BOXES.

1141
00:49:51,723 --> 00:49:52,790
BE CALM, SIR.

1142
00:49:52,790 --> 00:49:54,793
HELP US. PLEASE.

1143
00:49:54,793 --> 00:49:55,927
[LAUGHS]

1144
00:49:55,927 --> 00:49:59,630
MAN. WHY’D WE TAKE
THE TRAIN TO SACRAMENTO?

1145
00:50:01,032 --> 00:50:03,068
I’M SUPPOSED TO GET YOU FOLKS
BACK IN THE MOVIE.

1146
00:50:04,770 --> 00:50:08,340
10-4 UNIT 41-K.
905-V IN PROGRESS.

1147
00:50:08,340 --> 00:50:10,275
FIFTH STREET WAREHOUSE.
CODE THREE.

1148
00:50:10,275 --> 00:50:13,378
IT’S THE WORLD’S
MOST PUT-UPON NUN.

1149
00:50:15,680 --> 00:50:18,883
THIS IS BORIS BECKER
REPORTING LIVE.

1150
00:50:20,018 --> 00:50:22,287
THIS IS WCNG REPORTER...

1151
00:50:22,287 --> 00:50:23,288
[LAUGHTER]

1152
00:50:23,288 --> 00:50:24,288
REPORTING TO YOU LIVE

1153
00:50:24,288 --> 00:50:26,290
FROM THE FIFTH STREET
WAREHOUSE

1154
00:50:26,290 --> 00:50:30,762
WHERE THERE HAS BEEN
A REPORTED ANIMAL ATTACK.

1155
00:50:30,762 --> 00:50:32,697
[LAUGHTER]

1156
00:50:32,697 --> 00:50:34,632
TED NUGENT HELPS OUT.

1157
00:50:36,902 --> 00:50:39,503
MORE UPDATES AS THEY OCCUR.

1158
00:50:39,503 --> 00:50:41,707
THANKS FOR PLAYING REPORTER
AND CAMERA GUY WITH ME.

1159
00:50:41,707 --> 00:50:44,675
I THINK THE CARDBOARD CAMERA’S
WORKING GOOD.

1160
00:50:44,675 --> 00:50:46,412
[LAUGHTER]

1161
00:50:46,412 --> 00:50:48,413
CAPTAIN,
THERE ARE EMPLOYEES

1162
00:50:48,413 --> 00:50:50,615
STILL IN THE PLANT
AT THE BACK OF A STORE ROOM.

1163
00:50:50,615 --> 00:50:51,817
HE’S REPORTING
OVER A BABY MONITOR.

1164
00:50:51,817 --> 00:50:54,718
JOEY,
LEAD IN THE TACTICAL TEAM.

1165
00:50:54,718 --> 00:50:56,888
YOU TAKE THE POINT.

1166
00:50:58,590 --> 00:51:03,128
UGH. NOW, I HAVE UNBRIDLED
ENTHUSIASM FOR BOXES, MIKE,

1167
00:51:03,128 --> 00:51:04,262
YOU KNOW THAT.

1168
00:51:04,262 --> 00:51:06,230
BUT EVEN I THINK
THEY’VE OVERDONE

1169
00:51:06,230 --> 00:51:09,100
THE BOX THEME
IN THIS MOVIE.

1170
00:51:09,100 --> 00:51:13,538
OKAY, BOXES. IF YOU HAVE ANY
INSERTS THROW ’EM OUT NOW.

1171
00:51:13,538 --> 00:51:15,073
I REALLY DO LIKE BOXES.

1172
00:51:15,073 --> 00:51:16,073
YEAH.

1173
00:51:16,073 --> 00:51:18,210
JUST CALL ME
"BRUCE BOX-LIKER."

1174
00:51:18,210 --> 00:51:19,210
[LAUGHS]

1175
00:51:19,210 --> 00:51:20,212
OH.

1176
00:51:20,212 --> 00:51:21,212
PLEASE?

1177
00:51:21,212 --> 00:51:22,213
I DON’T THINK SO.

1178
00:51:22,213 --> 00:51:24,148
OKAY.

1179
00:51:27,118 --> 00:51:31,155
UGH. MANDY PATINKIN’S GONNA
DO A CONCERT BACK THERE.

1180
00:51:32,857 --> 00:51:36,695
HEY, JOEY.
CAPTAIN WANTS TO KNOW IF YOU’VE
SPOTTED THAT BEAR YET.

1181
00:51:36,695 --> 00:51:39,130
NO--NO, SIR.

1182
00:51:39,130 --> 00:51:41,432
TRY A PICK-A-NICK BASKET,
BOO BOO.

1183
00:51:41,432 --> 00:51:42,367
HMM?

1184
00:51:45,470 --> 00:51:47,538
WHERE’S THE REST
OF MY SWAT TEAM?

1185
00:51:47,538 --> 00:51:49,473
AM I JUST A SWAT GUY?

1186
00:51:54,545 --> 00:51:57,282
I JUST FOUND THE BLOOD STAINS.
THIS LOOKS FRESH.

1187
00:51:57,282 --> 00:51:58,750
AND I’VE TRIED
SCRUBBING THEM OUT.

1188
00:51:58,750 --> 00:52:00,885
YOU SURE IT’S NOT KETCHUP?

1189
00:52:00,885 --> 00:52:05,023
NO, SIR. IT’S REAL.

1190
00:52:05,023 --> 00:52:07,092
FOCUS ON, UH, POLARIS.

1191
00:52:07,092 --> 00:52:09,928
AND ARCTIC CAT.

1192
00:52:09,928 --> 00:52:12,397
WHAT HAPPENED?

1193
00:52:12,397 --> 00:52:14,098
YOU TWO. FOLLOW ME.

1194
00:52:14,098 --> 00:52:16,835
THEY WERE TRANSFERRED
TO A COSTA-GAVRAS FILM.

1195
00:52:18,403 --> 00:52:21,138
ALL PATROLS.
NORTHEAST CORNER.

1196
00:52:21,138 --> 00:52:23,073
YOUR LIGHTS ARE ON.

1197
00:52:25,277 --> 00:52:28,580
UH, ANYBODY GOT
A BLOODY GLOVE WE COULD PLANT?

1198
00:52:30,615 --> 00:52:32,583
SWEET JESUS.

1199
00:52:34,085 --> 00:52:35,753
LEO.

1200
00:52:35,753 --> 00:52:39,357
REMINDS ME OF THE TIME
CHIEF GATES CHUNKED ALL OVER
HEADQUARTERS.

1201
00:52:39,357 --> 00:52:40,358
UGH.

1202
00:52:40,358 --> 00:52:42,727
SOMETIMES TOOLS WILL RUN.

1203
00:52:42,727 --> 00:52:46,263
WHEN THE TRACKERS CATCH THEM,
IT’S LIKE THIS.

1204
00:52:47,632 --> 00:52:49,968
SO, UH, WALLY,
YOU NEED A DOCTOR OR...?

1205
00:52:49,968 --> 00:52:52,470
[GUNSHOTS]

1206
00:52:52,470 --> 00:52:55,473
THE DINOSAUR IS SKEET SHOOTING
OFF THE PORT BOW.

1207
00:52:59,243 --> 00:53:01,145
[GROWLING]

1208
00:53:01,145 --> 00:53:02,413
HEY, IT’S COMING BACK.

1209
00:53:02,413 --> 00:53:05,383
THE MOVIE THAT
PUSHES OVER BOXES.

1210
00:53:05,383 --> 00:53:06,985
DON’T SHOOT.
FLOYD’S BEHIND ’EM.

1211
00:53:06,985 --> 00:53:08,085
MIGHT HIT EACH OTHER.

1212
00:53:08,085 --> 00:53:09,487
I’VE GOT FLOYD.

1213
00:53:09,487 --> 00:53:11,322
CAN YOU KILL HIM WITH THAT?

1214
00:53:11,322 --> 00:53:13,292
YEAH. HERE. CUT HERE.

1215
00:53:13,292 --> 00:53:14,392
IT’S THE SOFTEST PLACE.

1216
00:53:14,392 --> 00:53:16,160
OOH.

1217
00:53:16,160 --> 00:53:17,162
HOW LONG?

1218
00:53:17,162 --> 00:53:18,630
JUST A MOMENT.

1219
00:53:18,630 --> 00:53:20,598
DON’T MISS.

1220
00:53:20,598 --> 00:53:23,902
THIS IS HOW DINOSAURS
SEE PLAID.

1221
00:53:25,603 --> 00:53:27,938
THIS IS A CASE WHERE PARENTS
SHOULD HAVE CRUSHED

1222
00:53:27,938 --> 00:53:29,807
A CHILD’S DREAM
OF BECOMING A FILMMAKER.

1223
00:53:29,807 --> 00:53:30,808
MM. RIGHT.

1224
00:53:30,808 --> 00:53:31,810
AAH!

1225
00:53:31,810 --> 00:53:32,977
SO WHEN YOU EDIT IT,

1226
00:53:32,977 --> 00:53:35,813
IT’LL LOOK LIKE I STABBED HIM,
RIGHT?

1227
00:53:39,783 --> 00:53:42,787
I WAS COMING TO WARN YOU.
AN ASTEROID...

1228
00:53:42,787 --> 00:53:44,122
UGH...

1229
00:53:45,890 --> 00:53:49,193
SWAT GUY WHO’S DEAD
MUST BE FEELIN’ PRETTY DUMB
RIGHT NOW.

1230
00:53:49,193 --> 00:53:51,162
[BEEPING]

1231
00:53:51,162 --> 00:53:52,730
THAT’S MINE. I GOT IT.

1232
00:53:52,730 --> 00:53:55,033
GET DOWN!

1233
00:53:55,033 --> 00:53:57,768
OH. I HAD A WOODCHUCK
DO THIS TO ME ONCE.

1234
00:53:57,768 --> 00:53:59,703
[LAUGHS]

1235
00:54:04,542 --> 00:54:07,478
WELL.

1236
00:54:07,478 --> 00:54:09,080
CAPTAIN POLARIS.

1237
00:54:09,080 --> 00:54:10,115
[LAUGHTER]

1238
00:54:10,115 --> 00:54:12,950
CAPTAIN POLARIS?
ARE YOU THERE?

1239
00:54:12,950 --> 00:54:14,185
CAPTAIN POLARIS?

1240
00:54:14,185 --> 00:54:16,688
WE GOT THE BASTARD, SERGEANT.

1241
00:54:16,688 --> 00:54:18,623
WE’VE GOT A SITUATION HERE.

1242
00:54:18,623 --> 00:54:21,258
WHAT DO YOU MEAN
YOU GOT A SITUATION?

1243
00:54:21,258 --> 00:54:24,128
I MEAN WE’VE GOT MORE MONSTER
SIGHTINGS IN THE CITY.

1244
00:54:24,128 --> 00:54:26,665
MORE?
HOW COULD THERE BE MORE?

1245
00:54:26,665 --> 00:54:27,732
THEY COME IN PACKS.

1246
00:54:27,732 --> 00:54:28,733
OR CARTONS.

1247
00:54:28,733 --> 00:54:30,635
THEY’RE AFTER ME.

1248
00:54:30,635 --> 00:54:33,438
THEY WILL CONTINUE
TO HURT PEOPLE

1249
00:54:33,438 --> 00:54:35,340
UNTIL THEY FIND ME.

1250
00:54:35,340 --> 00:54:36,507
BRING ME TO THEM.

1251
00:54:36,507 --> 00:54:38,977
OTIS. SMITTY.
PLACE THIS MAN UNDER ARREST.

1252
00:54:38,977 --> 00:54:40,978
HEY. HE JUST SAVED YOU AND
EVERYBODY IN THE BUILDING

1253
00:54:40,978 --> 00:54:42,013
FROM THAT THING.

1254
00:54:42,013 --> 00:54:43,013
THAT’S RIGHT.

1255
00:54:43,013 --> 00:54:44,315
HE’S NOT A CRIMINAL.

1256
00:54:44,315 --> 00:54:45,917
HE WON’T RUN AWAY
THIS TIME.

1257
00:54:45,917 --> 00:54:47,718
NOW, IF YOU’LL EXCUSE US,
SISTER ANN,

1258
00:54:47,718 --> 00:54:49,687
YOUR FRIEND’S GOT
SOME QUESTIONS TO ANSWER.

1259
00:54:49,687 --> 00:54:51,857
HEY.
HOW DID YOU KNOW WHO I WAS?

1260
00:54:51,857 --> 00:54:54,558
FRED BURROUGHS TOLD US HOW
HE GOT YOU TO GIVE HIM A RIDE,

1261
00:54:54,558 --> 00:54:56,360
BUT DON’T WORRY.
YOU’RE FREE TO GO.

1262
00:54:56,360 --> 00:54:59,597
FRED BURROUGHS.
SOMEBODY LOOK IN YOUR ROLODEX
FOR A FRED BURROUGHS.

1263
00:54:59,597 --> 00:55:02,600
WHO’S FRED BURROUGHS?

1264
00:55:04,302 --> 00:55:07,472
FRED BURROUGHS! HELP ME!

1265
00:55:09,573 --> 00:55:13,978
A SKINNY, BELGIAN IDIOT
WAS ARRAIGNED ON CHARGES
EARLY TODAY.

1266
00:55:15,580 --> 00:55:18,148
WELL, I AM BELGIAN.

1267
00:55:18,148 --> 00:55:19,583
[STATIC]

1268
00:55:19,583 --> 00:55:22,720
HEY, THE L.A. POLICE
GOT THEMSELVES A BOOMBOX.

1269
00:55:22,720 --> 00:55:23,788
AND A COPIER.

1270
00:55:23,788 --> 00:55:24,822
WHOO.

1271
00:55:24,822 --> 00:55:25,857
[LAUGHS]

1272
00:55:25,857 --> 00:55:26,858
...HAS CAUSED A NUMBER

1273
00:55:26,858 --> 00:55:28,225
OF WILD ANIMALS TO ESCAPE

1274
00:55:28,225 --> 00:55:29,293
FROM THE ZOO.

1275
00:55:29,293 --> 00:55:30,962
THEY ARE EXTREMELY
DANGEROUS.

1276
00:55:30,962 --> 00:55:34,565
[IMITATES MONKEY]

1277
00:55:36,735 --> 00:55:39,203
JUST WAIT UNTIL FRED BURROUGHS
GETS HERE, MAN.

1278
00:55:39,203 --> 00:55:40,838
[GRUNTS]

1279
00:55:42,007 --> 00:55:43,273
UGH. HAVEN’T HAD HARDEE’S

1280
00:55:43,273 --> 00:55:44,342
IN OVER AN HOUR.

1281
00:55:44,342 --> 00:55:46,343
THEY DON’T CARE ABOUT US,
ANNIE.

1282
00:55:46,343 --> 00:55:47,778
THEY JUST CUT US LOOSE.

1283
00:55:47,778 --> 00:55:50,948
IN FACT,
EVERYBODY CUT FOOTLOOSE.

1284
00:55:50,948 --> 00:55:55,187
IS TERRY JO’S BROTHER
STILL RUNNING WITH
THE 12TH STREET GANG?

1285
00:55:55,187 --> 00:55:57,122
YEAH.

1286
00:55:57,122 --> 00:55:59,123
CAN YOU SET UP
A MEETING WITH ME?

1287
00:55:59,123 --> 00:56:00,125
WHAT FOR?

1288
00:56:00,125 --> 00:56:02,127
YOU’RE SUCH A NUN.

1289
00:56:02,127 --> 00:56:03,862
SO HE CAN SHOOT ME.

1290
00:56:03,862 --> 00:56:04,862
[LAUGHS]

1291
00:56:04,862 --> 00:56:06,330
WE’RE SHARING
A VAGUE MOMENT.

1292
00:56:06,330 --> 00:56:07,265
[LAUGHS]

1293
00:56:09,033 --> 00:56:10,835
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN,

1294
00:56:10,835 --> 00:56:11,903
FRED BURROUGHS.

1295
00:56:11,903 --> 00:56:13,838
[LAUGHTER]

1296
00:56:16,673 --> 00:56:19,910
WE’RE NUMBER ONE.

1297
00:56:19,910 --> 00:56:22,580
BASED ON A PLAY BY
TERRENCE MCNALLY.

1298
00:56:29,287 --> 00:56:31,088
HMM?

1299
00:56:31,088 --> 00:56:32,957
MAYBE HE IS
TOM OF FINLAND.

1300
00:56:32,957 --> 00:56:34,892
COULD BE.

1301
00:56:38,195 --> 00:56:39,563
HEY, LITTLE PAL.

1302
00:56:39,563 --> 00:56:41,498
WHERE’D MY THUMB GO?

1303
00:56:43,768 --> 00:56:45,035
CHA.

1304
00:56:45,035 --> 00:56:46,037
CHA.

1305
00:56:46,037 --> 00:56:47,372
CHA.

1306
00:56:47,372 --> 00:56:49,007
HE’S BEATING UP
HIS MEMORIES.

1307
00:56:49,007 --> 00:56:50,007
CHA.

1308
00:56:50,007 --> 00:56:51,008
CHA.

1309
00:56:51,008 --> 00:56:52,010
CHA.

1310
00:56:52,010 --> 00:56:53,143
CHA.

1311
00:56:53,143 --> 00:56:56,413
HE’S WARMING UP TO SING
THE BIG COUNTRY SONG.

1312
00:56:56,413 --> 00:56:57,415
CHA.

1313
00:56:57,415 --> 00:56:58,415
CHA.

1314
00:56:58,415 --> 00:57:00,418
CHA.

1315
00:57:00,418 --> 00:57:02,553
UH, PRETTY SOON
HE’S GONNA BE FLASHING BACK

1316
00:57:02,553 --> 00:57:04,622
TO THE BEGINNING
OF THE FLASHBACK.

1317
00:57:07,458 --> 00:57:09,360
CHA!

1318
00:57:09,360 --> 00:57:11,963
THAT PRETTY MUCH
BRINGS US UP TO SPEED.

1319
00:57:15,400 --> 00:57:17,768
THANK YOU, SOLOFLEX.

1320
00:57:22,273 --> 00:57:24,808
WELL, I’M ALL "CHA’D" OUT.

1321
00:57:26,945 --> 00:57:29,780
I WONDER IF I GET BODY WAXING
PRIVILEGES IN HERE.

1322
00:57:33,485 --> 00:57:37,422
THE THINGS MY STEREO
CAME PACKED IN FLY
THROUGH SPACE.

1323
00:57:42,360 --> 00:57:43,662
A MARK VII PRODUCTION.

1324
00:57:43,662 --> 00:57:46,397
SO?

1325
00:57:46,397 --> 00:57:47,765
OH GOOD. ANOTHER LARGE GUY.

1326
00:57:47,765 --> 00:57:48,833
THE MOVIE WAS NEEDING ONE.

1327
00:57:48,833 --> 00:57:51,568
[LAUGHS]

1328
00:57:51,568 --> 00:57:54,672
WELL, THEIR STAIR-CLIMBING
LESSONS SEEM TO BE GOING WELL.

1329
00:57:56,173 --> 00:57:59,977
♪ BEAT IT
BEAT IT ♪

1330
00:58:03,782 --> 00:58:05,450
YOU GOT SOMETHING
TO SAY TO ME?

1331
00:58:05,450 --> 00:58:08,920
I’M SORRY I TOOK
YOUR PARKING SPACE.

1332
00:58:08,920 --> 00:58:10,488
SORRY ABOUT TERRY JO.

1333
00:58:10,488 --> 00:58:12,423
HE WAS A GOOD PYTHON.

1334
00:58:15,058 --> 00:58:16,227
ANYTHING ELSE?

1335
00:58:16,227 --> 00:58:18,763
I’M SORRY.

1336
00:58:18,763 --> 00:58:20,765
SHE HAD DEEP THOUGHTS,
YOU KNOW?

1337
00:58:20,765 --> 00:58:23,568
IS HE A SISTER HAZEL,
MIKE?

1338
00:58:23,568 --> 00:58:25,303
I NEED YOUR HELP.

1339
00:58:26,403 --> 00:58:27,738
FOR WHAT?

1340
00:58:27,738 --> 00:58:29,573
I NEED TO BORROW YOUR TUKE.

1341
00:58:29,573 --> 00:58:31,275
MONSTERS IN THE ’HOOD.

1342
00:58:34,745 --> 00:58:38,348
MEANWHILE, IN THE LIFE
OF A BASEMENT-DWELLING
COMPUTER NERD...

1343
00:58:41,718 --> 00:58:44,522
BUT NEVER MIND THAT.
LET’S GO HERE.

1344
00:58:47,158 --> 00:58:49,360
THESE ARE THINGS.

1345
00:58:49,360 --> 00:58:50,428
THEY EXIST.

1346
00:58:50,428 --> 00:58:51,728
WOW.

1347
00:58:51,728 --> 00:58:53,163
SO.

1348
00:58:53,163 --> 00:58:54,832
DR. TANAKA.

1349
00:58:54,832 --> 00:58:56,567
WHAT’S YOUR HONEST OPINION?

1350
00:58:56,567 --> 00:58:58,102
WHAT’S THERE NOT TO BELIEVE?

1351
00:58:58,102 --> 00:59:01,738
A RACE OF TRANSPLANTED HUMANS
BRED ON ANOTHER PLANET...

1352
00:59:01,738 --> 00:59:03,340
ONE OF THEM ESCAPES,

1353
00:59:03,340 --> 00:59:05,610
RETURNS TO HIS
ANCESTRAL WORLD,

1354
00:59:05,610 --> 00:59:10,147
AND THESE DINOSAURS AND THEIR
MASTERS ARE HERE TO BRING HIM
BACK.

1355
00:59:10,147 --> 00:59:12,250
PERSONALLY I THINK HE’S NUTS.

1356
00:59:12,250 --> 00:59:13,517
DETECTIVE ALAN THICKE.

1357
00:59:13,517 --> 00:59:16,553
I’VE SEEN THESE DINOSAURS,
DOCTOR.

1358
00:59:16,553 --> 00:59:18,890
THEY’RE REAL.

1359
00:59:18,890 --> 00:59:21,792
MAYBE HIS STORY
IS REAL TOO.

1360
00:59:21,792 --> 00:59:22,793
CAPTAIN...

1361
00:59:22,793 --> 00:59:24,062
FEDERAL AGENTS.

1362
00:59:24,062 --> 00:59:26,063
WE’RE TAKING OVER THIS CASE
AS OF RIGHT NOW.

1363
00:59:26,063 --> 00:59:27,632
BUT MY PUFFY HAIR.

1364
00:59:27,632 --> 00:59:29,400
UNDER WHO’S AUTHORITY?

1365
00:59:29,400 --> 00:59:31,235
NATIONAL SECURITY, CAPTAIN.

1366
00:59:31,235 --> 00:59:32,437
YOU’RE HEREBY RELIEVED
OF THIS CASE

1367
00:59:32,437 --> 00:59:33,638
AND ORDERED
TO LEAVE THE ROOM NOW.

1368
00:59:33,638 --> 00:59:35,707
I’M TAKING THIS
TO THE COMMISSIONER!

1369
00:59:35,707 --> 00:59:38,442
WHY, IF THIS DOOR WASN’T
JUST A FLAT PANEL I’D...

1370
00:59:38,442 --> 00:59:40,578
I DON’T BELIEVE THIS.

1371
00:59:40,578 --> 00:59:42,613
CAN YOU EXPLAIN THIS?

1372
00:59:42,613 --> 00:59:45,015
THEY’RE PHOTOGRAPHS.

1373
00:59:45,015 --> 00:59:47,085
I SAID,
CAN YOU EXPLAIN THIS?

1374
00:59:47,085 --> 00:59:49,053
THEY’RE TRACKERS.

1375
00:59:49,053 --> 00:59:52,323
WHEN THE TRACKER WAS KILLED,
WHAT HAPPENED TO HIS BODY?

1376
00:59:52,323 --> 00:59:54,625
SELF-DESTRUCT.

1377
00:59:54,625 --> 00:59:56,693
SO THEY LEAVE NO TRACE.

1378
00:59:56,693 --> 00:59:57,695
TRICE?

1379
00:59:57,695 --> 00:59:58,697
TRICE.

1380
00:59:58,697 --> 01:00:00,130
LIKE THIS?

1381
01:00:00,130 --> 01:00:01,165
DEE SNYDER’S DANCE BELT.

1382
01:00:04,668 --> 01:00:06,303
YOU LOOK SO HUMAN.

1383
01:00:06,303 --> 01:00:07,505
I’M A MAN.

1384
01:00:07,505 --> 01:00:09,007
IN MY PARTICULAR
RELATIONSHIP.

1385
01:00:09,007 --> 01:00:10,675
SO YOU SAY.

1386
01:00:20,518 --> 01:00:24,088
SORRY. THIS NIPPLE RING’S
HARD TO REMOVE.

1387
01:00:25,423 --> 01:00:26,823
WELL?

1388
01:00:26,823 --> 01:00:30,462
IT APPEARS TO BE A TRANSMITTER
OF SOME KIND.

1389
01:00:30,462 --> 01:00:32,563
I’M TAKING IT TO THE LAB.

1390
01:00:32,563 --> 01:00:34,532
CAN YOU ALL LEAVE THE ROOM,
PLEASE?

1391
01:00:34,532 --> 01:00:37,568
SAY, YOU WANNA GET MY POLYP
WHILE YOU’RE AT IT?

1392
01:00:37,568 --> 01:00:42,673
I APOLOGIZE FOR THIS
HUMILIATION. IT’S MY JOB.

1393
01:00:42,673 --> 01:00:45,543
I HAVE A JOB TOO.
I’M A TOOL.

1394
01:00:47,012 --> 01:00:49,180
MY LIFE IS MY JOB.

1395
01:00:49,180 --> 01:00:50,213
MINE TOO.

1396
01:00:50,213 --> 01:00:51,848
OH, OKAY. YOU BOTH HAVE
INTERESTING JOBS.

1397
01:00:51,848 --> 01:00:54,818
DON’T FIGHT ABOUT IT.

1398
01:00:54,818 --> 01:00:56,953
BARBARA, HERE.
TAKE A LOOK AT THIS.

1399
01:00:56,953 --> 01:00:59,257
AND SEND THE RESULTS
TO MY OFFICE, PLEASE.

1400
01:01:02,693 --> 01:01:05,262
LOOK, THEY DRAPED STUFF
IN FRONT OF THE EDITING MACHINE.

1401
01:01:07,132 --> 01:01:10,233
PAYLESS SHOES
CAN BE UNCOMFORTABLE.

1402
01:01:11,968 --> 01:01:14,772
DR. PAM TILLIS.

1403
01:01:15,907 --> 01:01:18,675
OH,
HIS EXTERIOR PATELLAS HURT.

1404
01:01:21,745 --> 01:01:23,815
SORRY.
THOUGHT I SAW A DEER
IN THERE.

1405
01:01:23,815 --> 01:01:26,383
[GASPS]

1406
01:01:26,383 --> 01:01:27,752
NOOGIE!

1407
01:01:32,090 --> 01:01:34,292
EASY SPIRIT LAB SHOES.

1408
01:01:35,393 --> 01:01:37,562
WON’T ANYONE GIVE ME FIVE?

1409
01:01:37,562 --> 01:01:40,130
DANGER RESTROOM AREA?

1410
01:01:40,130 --> 01:01:42,900
UH, YEAH.
A COWORKER HAS
IRRITABLE BOWEL SYNDROME.

1411
01:01:42,900 --> 01:01:44,702
AH.

1412
01:01:46,037 --> 01:01:47,805
I GOT CAUGHT
IN THE TOWEL MACHINE.

1413
01:01:47,805 --> 01:01:51,108
[LAUGHS]

1414
01:01:51,108 --> 01:01:53,377
FREDDIE MERCURY
AFTER A GOOD BEATING.

1415
01:01:53,377 --> 01:01:54,778
[SCREAMS]

1416
01:01:54,778 --> 01:01:56,780
[LASER BLASTS]

1417
01:01:56,780 --> 01:01:58,715
AH. VAPOR ACTION.

1418
01:02:00,552 --> 01:02:04,322
HMM.
DO I PUT THIS
ON MY TIME CARD?

1419
01:02:06,057 --> 01:02:09,793
SHE DID HIM THE FAVOR
OF PRE-STUFFING HERSELF
IN THE CRAWL SPACE.

1420
01:02:11,262 --> 01:02:13,865
[YELLS]

1421
01:02:13,865 --> 01:02:14,865
[GASPS]

1422
01:02:14,865 --> 01:02:17,535
FUTURE DOCTOR
OF CHIROPRACTIC.

1423
01:02:17,535 --> 01:02:18,635
[MACHINE WHIRRING]

1424
01:02:18,635 --> 01:02:19,837
WHAT’S THAT NOISE?

1425
01:02:19,837 --> 01:02:21,638
HIS TIMING BELT
MUST BE LOOSE.

1426
01:02:21,638 --> 01:02:22,973
[LAUGHS]

1427
01:02:22,973 --> 01:02:24,108
WILLIS.

1428
01:02:24,108 --> 01:02:25,275
WHAT YOU TALKING ’BOUT?

1429
01:02:25,275 --> 01:02:26,743
DEXTER.

1430
01:02:26,743 --> 01:02:29,347
WE’RE TAKING HIM TO THE...

1431
01:02:29,347 --> 01:02:32,483
I’M GOING BACK TO BEING
THE APOSTLE, BOSS.

1432
01:02:32,483 --> 01:02:33,885
OKAY, PAPERWORK. TALK.

1433
01:02:33,885 --> 01:02:34,985
[EXPLOSION]

1434
01:02:34,985 --> 01:02:36,520
WHAT IS IT?
YOU KNOW, DON’T YA?

1435
01:02:36,520 --> 01:02:37,955
[MOANS]

1436
01:02:37,955 --> 01:02:40,190
IT’S A GIANT-FACED
BRUNO KIRBY.

1437
01:02:45,362 --> 01:02:46,363
SOMEBODY SHOT THE EDITOR.

1438
01:02:46,363 --> 01:02:48,032
[LAUGHS]

1439
01:02:51,268 --> 01:02:54,272
SHOT IN THE LOUNGE
OF A COLLEGE DORMITORY.

1440
01:02:54,272 --> 01:02:55,607
ON ANY GIVEN NIGHT.

1441
01:02:55,607 --> 01:02:56,773
MM.

1442
01:03:00,645 --> 01:03:01,645
AAH!

1443
01:03:01,645 --> 01:03:02,747
AAH! RICKY.

1444
01:03:06,783 --> 01:03:07,885
WOOPS. BANANA PEEL.

1445
01:03:07,885 --> 01:03:08,820
[SCREAMS]

1446
01:03:11,488 --> 01:03:13,892
THE L.A.P.D. GUN CLOSET.

1447
01:03:16,093 --> 01:03:18,662
CAN I BORROW YOUR SHIRT?

1448
01:03:21,265 --> 01:03:22,600
AAH!

1449
01:03:22,600 --> 01:03:25,435
LET’S DO SOME CRIMES.

1450
01:03:26,803 --> 01:03:27,972
SAY "UNCLE."

1451
01:03:27,972 --> 01:03:29,207
UNCLE.

1452
01:03:29,207 --> 01:03:31,142
THAT’S RIGHT.
NOW GIMME YOUR LUNCH MONEY.

1453
01:03:35,312 --> 01:03:37,080
FREEZE, DAMN IT.

1454
01:03:37,080 --> 01:03:38,648
OH. THAT WAS DUMB.

1455
01:03:40,952 --> 01:03:43,587
THIS ISN’T A REAL MOVIE.
IT’S MORE OF A MOVIE LOAF.

1456
01:03:43,587 --> 01:03:46,790
YEAH, IT’S MADE FROM
REAL MOVIE PARTS,
CHUNKED AND FORMED.

1457
01:03:46,790 --> 01:03:48,860
MM.

1458
01:03:48,860 --> 01:03:51,095
[NERVOUS LAUGHTER]

1459
01:03:52,530 --> 01:03:54,065
ANYWAY,
THANKS FOR LISTENING.

1460
01:03:54,065 --> 01:03:56,433
IT’S JUST MY LITTLE ARMS
ARE KIND OF FRUSTRATING.

1461
01:03:59,437 --> 01:04:00,638
HERE,
LET ME PICK YOUR TEETH.

1462
01:04:00,638 --> 01:04:02,740
YOU’VE GOT A HUGE PIECE
OF CHIVE STUCK IN THERE.

1463
01:04:04,875 --> 01:04:07,678
OKAY. MY THEORY IS THAT
THE DIRECTOR SHOT
THE ENTIRE MOVIE

1464
01:04:07,678 --> 01:04:08,845
WITHOUT LOOKING AT IT.

1465
01:04:08,845 --> 01:04:10,615
[LAUGHS]
THAT WAS GOOD.

1466
01:04:12,283 --> 01:04:14,518
IT’S THE BIG ONE.
I’M COMIN’, ELIZABETH.

1467
01:04:15,953 --> 01:04:17,255
AH, THAT’S HOW YOU
KILL AN ANDROID--

1468
01:04:17,255 --> 01:04:19,757
YOU WIPE A LENGTH OF THIN PIPE
ACROSS HIS STOMACH.

1469
01:04:19,757 --> 01:04:21,225
[BEEPING]

1470
01:04:21,225 --> 01:04:22,360
UH OH.

1471
01:04:22,360 --> 01:04:24,862
AND LIKE SPENT LOVERS,
THEY LAY TOGETHER.

1472
01:04:26,363 --> 01:04:30,100
CAN’T COUNT ON THE POLICE.
CAN’T COUNT ON ANYBODY.

1473
01:04:30,100 --> 01:04:31,702
WHAT DO YOU WANT US TO DO?

1474
01:04:31,702 --> 01:04:33,770
WE CAN STOP THESE THINGS
TOGETHER.

1475
01:04:33,770 --> 01:04:35,973
YEAH RIGHT.
"TOGETHER."

1476
01:04:35,973 --> 01:04:37,775
"TOGETHER" MEANS
WE DO ALL THE WORK, RIGHT?

1477
01:04:37,775 --> 01:04:39,677
NO. WE’RE OUTTA HERE.

1478
01:04:39,677 --> 01:04:40,812
SIT YOUR ASS DOWN.

1479
01:04:40,812 --> 01:04:42,078
SISTER’S RIGHT.

1480
01:04:42,078 --> 01:04:44,082
NOBODY’S GONNA
HELP US BUT US.

1481
01:04:44,082 --> 01:04:46,150
THEY GOT THE NEIGHBORHOOD
BY THE BALLS.

1482
01:04:46,150 --> 01:04:48,252
DON’T SCARE US.

1483
01:04:48,252 --> 01:04:49,620
DON’T SEE YA ON THE STREETS,
EITHER.

1484
01:04:49,620 --> 01:04:50,955
THAT’S ENOUGH.

1485
01:04:50,955 --> 01:04:52,957
LET ’EM GO.

1486
01:04:52,957 --> 01:04:55,660
THEY DON’T HAVE TO HELP US
IF THEY DON’T WANT TO.

1487
01:04:55,660 --> 01:04:57,495
YOU SAYIN’ WE’RE AFRAID?

1488
01:04:57,495 --> 01:04:59,497
NO.

1489
01:04:59,497 --> 01:05:01,098
BUT THERE’S GONNA BE A FIGHT.

1490
01:05:01,098 --> 01:05:03,800
AND IT’S GONNA BE BAD,
AND IT’S GONNA BE BLOODY.

1491
01:05:03,800 --> 01:05:05,502
SO WHERE DO WE FIND
THESE THINGS?

1492
01:05:05,502 --> 01:05:07,505
UGH. SORRY I’M LATE.
MY SLEEVES FELL OFF.

1493
01:05:07,505 --> 01:05:09,173
ALWAYS NEAR WATER.

1494
01:05:09,173 --> 01:05:10,507
WATER.

1495
01:05:10,507 --> 01:05:12,510
THAT COULD BE A LOT
OF PLACES.

1496
01:05:12,510 --> 01:05:14,745
THEN WE DO IT THE HARD WAY,
AND WE LOOK.

1497
01:05:14,745 --> 01:05:17,815
WATER OBVIOUSLY CUT THIS FENCE
AND BROKE THROUGH.

1498
01:05:18,915 --> 01:05:20,718
MEANWHILE ON THE AFRICAN QUEEN,

1499
01:05:20,718 --> 01:05:22,720
BOGART AND HEPBURN
PICK LEECHES OFF EACH OTHER.

1500
01:05:24,855 --> 01:05:26,790
WATER.

1501
01:05:28,858 --> 01:05:31,395
UH, THE CRIPS LIKE TO GO DOWN
TO THE REFLECTING POOL

1502
01:05:31,395 --> 01:05:32,730
FOR THEIR GANG RETREATS.

1503
01:05:36,400 --> 01:05:38,902
YO.
LET’S COLLECT WILDFLOWERS.

1504
01:05:40,905 --> 01:05:42,840
HEY,
AN OUTER VOMITORIUM.

1505
01:05:45,442 --> 01:05:47,378
HMM.
THOUGHT THAT WAS A BABY RUTH.

1506
01:05:50,113 --> 01:05:52,048
WAIT.
IS THAT A CLARK BAR?

1507
01:05:53,617 --> 01:05:56,653
COME HERE.
FRESH TRACKS.

1508
01:05:56,653 --> 01:05:57,855
OH NO.
THEY’RE A DAY OLD.

1509
01:05:57,855 --> 01:05:59,323
THEY’VE BEEN MARKED DOWN.

1510
01:05:59,323 --> 01:06:00,490
VERY DEEP.

1511
01:06:00,490 --> 01:06:03,427
[GROWLING]

1512
01:06:05,730 --> 01:06:07,097
RUN!

1513
01:06:07,097 --> 01:06:09,067
WHO ARE THEY?

1514
01:06:09,067 --> 01:06:10,600
GET ON A TRUCK!

1515
01:06:10,600 --> 01:06:11,602
[GROWLING]

1516
01:06:11,602 --> 01:06:13,270
♪ I’M YOUR PUPPET ♪

1517
01:06:13,270 --> 01:06:14,838
GO, GO, GO, GO,
GO, GO, GO.

1518
01:06:14,838 --> 01:06:15,840
DRIVE THE CAR!

1519
01:06:15,840 --> 01:06:16,840
GO!

1520
01:06:16,840 --> 01:06:18,375
THE HELL YOU DOING
IN MY TRUCK?

1521
01:06:18,375 --> 01:06:20,277
TAXI!

1522
01:06:22,413 --> 01:06:25,182
DRIVE!

1523
01:06:25,182 --> 01:06:26,917
SURGE!

1524
01:06:28,918 --> 01:06:30,587
DRIVE!

1525
01:06:30,587 --> 01:06:32,723
LOOK, HOW MUCH MORE
CAN I DRIVE?

1526
01:06:32,723 --> 01:06:34,658
THERE’S NO INHERENT QUANTITY
OF DRIVING

1527
01:06:34,658 --> 01:06:36,060
THAT I CAN INCREASE.

1528
01:06:36,060 --> 01:06:38,662
IF YOU WANT ME TO FASTER
THEN YOU NEED TO TELL ME THAT.

1529
01:06:38,662 --> 01:06:40,497
[LAUGHS]

1530
01:06:40,497 --> 01:06:43,433
THE CHARACTER OF BOB
THE FRIENDLY SECURITY GUARD
IMPLIED HERE.

1531
01:06:43,433 --> 01:06:45,435
GOD.
WE’RE GONNA BE MASSACRED.

1532
01:06:45,435 --> 01:06:47,672
WE’RE GONNA
HAVE TO TAKE A STAND TONIGHT.

1533
01:06:47,672 --> 01:06:49,773
YOU WILL ATTACK THE TRACKERS?

1534
01:06:49,773 --> 01:06:51,842
YOU GOT SOMETHING BETTER?

1535
01:06:51,842 --> 01:06:53,910
LISTEN.
THEY’RE AFTER ME.

1536
01:06:53,910 --> 01:06:55,245
I WILL GIVE MYSELF TO THEM.

1537
01:06:55,245 --> 01:06:57,247
GOOD. MEETING ADJOURNED.

1538
01:06:57,247 --> 01:06:59,250
BUT THEY ARE AFTER HIM.

1539
01:06:59,250 --> 01:07:00,417
CAN THESE THINGS DIE?

1540
01:07:00,417 --> 01:07:02,587
THE UTNE READER STAFF.

1541
01:07:02,587 --> 01:07:04,788
YEAH.

1542
01:07:04,788 --> 01:07:06,790
COME ON, MAN.
YOU’RE TALKING
HEAVY ARTILLERY.

1543
01:07:06,790 --> 01:07:08,425
WE CAN’T GET
ANYTHING LIKE THAT.

1544
01:07:08,425 --> 01:07:09,860
MM. GOOD COFFEE.

1545
01:07:09,860 --> 01:07:11,762
YES WE CAN.

1546
01:07:23,607 --> 01:07:24,708
IS THIS YOURS?

1547
01:07:24,708 --> 01:07:25,743
NO. I DIDN’T...

1548
01:07:25,743 --> 01:07:26,743
AAH!

1549
01:07:26,743 --> 01:07:27,745
HELLO.

1550
01:07:27,745 --> 01:07:28,745
HELLO.

1551
01:07:28,745 --> 01:07:30,080
I’M DROPPY
THE WATER DROPLET.

1552
01:07:30,080 --> 01:07:31,682
HERE TO TALK TO YOU
ABOUT WATER.

1553
01:07:31,682 --> 01:07:32,783
NATURE’S LIQUID.

1554
01:07:32,783 --> 01:07:33,983
OKAY. WHY?

1555
01:07:33,983 --> 01:07:35,652
WELL,
IN TODAY’S MOTION PICTURE

1556
01:07:35,652 --> 01:07:37,822
MUCH WAS MADE
OF THE PROPENSITY OF DINOSAURS

1557
01:07:37,822 --> 01:07:39,223
TO GATHER NEAR WATER.

1558
01:07:39,223 --> 01:07:40,323
I REMEMBER ONE LINE.

1559
01:07:40,323 --> 01:07:43,127
AND YET, SADLY WATER
WAS NOT FEATURED.

1560
01:07:43,127 --> 01:07:44,428
UH, THAT’S TRUE.

1561
01:07:44,428 --> 01:07:46,763
AND SO I’VE BEEN HIRED
BY THE WATER COUNCIL

1562
01:07:46,763 --> 01:07:49,600
TO DISPEL SOME OF THE MYTHS
BEING PROPAGATED

1563
01:07:49,600 --> 01:07:52,368
PROBABLY BY JEALOUS SOLIDS
AND SEMI-SOLIDS

1564
01:07:52,368 --> 01:07:55,272
ABOUT THIS TREMENDOUSLY
VERSATILE FLUID.

1565
01:07:55,272 --> 01:07:56,273
OH.

1566
01:07:56,273 --> 01:07:57,273
WELL.

1567
01:07:57,273 --> 01:07:58,508
NOW WHERE THE HELL
DID HE GO?

1568
01:07:58,508 --> 01:08:00,510
[CAMPY MUSIC]

1569
01:08:00,510 --> 01:08:03,347
HELLO. I’M DROPPY
THE WATER DROPLET.

1570
01:08:03,347 --> 01:08:04,515
YES YOU ARE.

1571
01:08:04,515 --> 01:08:05,850
DID YOU KNOW THAT
THERE ARE LITERALLY

1572
01:08:05,850 --> 01:08:07,985
TENS OF THOUSANDS
OF USES FOR WATER?

1573
01:08:07,985 --> 01:08:10,320
HERE ARE
JUST A FEW THOUSAND.

1574
01:08:10,320 --> 01:08:11,888
MOISTEN YOUR HAIR WITH ME

1575
01:08:11,888 --> 01:08:14,125
AND APPLY
A COMMERCIAL-GRADE DETERGENT.

1576
01:08:14,125 --> 01:08:16,393
LATHER, RINSE AND REPEAT
FOR A CLEANER-SMELLING HEAD.

1577
01:08:16,393 --> 01:08:18,028
CROW, I THINK WE’RE ALL
FAMILIAR WITH--

1578
01:08:18,028 --> 01:08:19,563
SEND ME THROUGH YOUR
LOWER ATMOSPHERE

1579
01:08:19,563 --> 01:08:22,767
FREEZING ME INTO MULTIFACETED,
CRYSTALLINE PATTERNS.

1580
01:08:22,767 --> 01:08:25,435
CHILDREN ENJOY
MY EASY SHAPEABILITY.

1581
01:08:25,435 --> 01:08:27,972
STORE ME IN HUGE,
GLASS-LINED TANKS,

1582
01:08:27,972 --> 01:08:30,173
AND ALLOW GRAINS
AND YEAST TO FERMENT IN ME.

1583
01:08:30,173 --> 01:08:31,975
THEN JUST FILTER,
AGE AND BOTTLE ME

1584
01:08:31,975 --> 01:08:34,010
FOR A TREAT THAT
DAD’S CAN’T RESIST.

1585
01:08:34,010 --> 01:08:35,278
ARE THESE IN ANY
KIND OF ORDER?

1586
01:08:35,278 --> 01:08:37,280
SIR, WE’VE GOT A LOT
OF THESE TO GO THROUGH

1587
01:08:37,280 --> 01:08:38,515
SO IF YOU COULD
PLEASE HOLD YOUR WATER.

1588
01:08:38,515 --> 01:08:39,650
[LAUGHS]

1589
01:08:39,650 --> 01:08:41,985
THE WATER COUNCIL
FED ME THAT ONE.

1590
01:08:41,985 --> 01:08:44,555
ANYWAY.
USE ME IN YOUR
CELLULAR STRUCTURE

1591
01:08:44,555 --> 01:08:47,390
AS AN AFFORDABLE
BUILDING BLOCK OF LIFE ITSELF.

1592
01:08:47,390 --> 01:08:49,760
STORE ME FROZEN ON YOUR
INEFFICIENT ROOFS,

1593
01:08:49,760 --> 01:08:51,428
ALLOWING PORTIONS
OF ME TO MELT

1594
01:08:51,428 --> 01:08:54,732
AND RE-FREEZE ON YOUR EAVES
IN BEAUTIFUL, CONICAL SHAPES.

1595
01:08:54,732 --> 01:08:56,100
YOU KNOW WHAT? WE’LL TELL YOU
WHAT YOU MISSED...

1596
01:08:56,100 --> 01:08:57,968
USE ME TO FLUSH TOXINS
FROM YOUR BODY

1597
01:08:57,968 --> 01:08:59,203
AND STORE ME IN YOUR BLADDER.

1598
01:08:59,203 --> 01:09:00,838
OKAY. THAT’S ABOUT ENOUGH.

1599
01:09:00,838 --> 01:09:01,772
THEN--WHAT? WHAT?

1600
01:09:10,213 --> 01:09:11,982
[LAUGHS]
NICE, CROW.

1601
01:09:11,982 --> 01:09:14,918
THE MEAN STREETS OF BURBANK.

1602
01:09:16,687 --> 01:09:17,988
I’M JUMPY THE PUSHER.

1603
01:09:17,988 --> 01:09:19,055
CONROY.

1604
01:09:19,055 --> 01:09:21,092
♪ DOO DOO DOO DOO
DOO DOO DOO ♪

1605
01:09:21,092 --> 01:09:24,562
I NEED SOME WEAPONS.
SOME REAL HEAVY STUFF.

1606
01:09:24,562 --> 01:09:26,963
I GOT YOU A FORD PINTO.
THEY’RE GREAT WEAPONS.

1607
01:09:26,963 --> 01:09:29,333
OH, OH. WAIT. DO YOU WANNA
KILL OTHER PEOPLE?

1608
01:09:29,333 --> 01:09:30,902
HEY, ANNIE.

1609
01:09:30,902 --> 01:09:32,537
HELLO, CHADWICK.

1610
01:09:32,537 --> 01:09:34,672
HOW’S YOUR CATALOG OF CHEAP,
WOMEN’S APPAREL?

1611
01:09:34,672 --> 01:09:36,907
WE GO BACK DON’T WE?
WE GO WAY BACK.

1612
01:09:36,907 --> 01:09:38,642
I’M NOT HERE
TO TALK ABOUT THAT.

1613
01:09:38,642 --> 01:09:40,443
HOLD IT. OKAY, OKAY.
I’M SORRY.

1614
01:09:40,443 --> 01:09:41,645
I DIDN’T MEAN NOTHIN’.

1615
01:09:41,645 --> 01:09:43,213
I COME TO CONTRIBUTE.

1616
01:09:43,213 --> 01:09:44,215
HERE.

1617
01:09:44,215 --> 01:09:46,117
HERE’S SOME ZUCCHINI LOAF.

1618
01:09:46,117 --> 01:09:47,117
WHAT’S THIS?

1619
01:09:47,117 --> 01:09:48,985
POUND OF HIGH-GRADE WHITE.

1620
01:09:48,985 --> 01:09:50,587
KILLING DOSE?

1621
01:09:50,587 --> 01:09:53,023
[...] KILL
A WHOLE CITY BLOCK.

1622
01:09:53,023 --> 01:09:54,692
AND THERE’S THIS.

1623
01:09:54,692 --> 01:09:56,127
DOLLAR OFF
ON TIDE DETERGENT.

1624
01:09:56,127 --> 01:09:58,795
EVERY WAR NEEDS
SOME FINANCE, BABE.

1625
01:09:58,795 --> 01:10:00,965
WHO’S THAT?

1626
01:10:00,965 --> 01:10:02,900
NONE OF YOUR BUSINESS.

1627
01:10:02,900 --> 01:10:05,102
GUESS YOU GOTTA TAKE
THE BAD WITH THE GOOD, HUH?

1628
01:10:05,102 --> 01:10:06,303
GOODNIGHT, SISTER.

1629
01:10:06,303 --> 01:10:08,905
I GOTTA GO MANAGE
A DENNY’S.

1630
01:10:10,107 --> 01:10:11,475
HEY. CASABLANCA.

1631
01:10:11,475 --> 01:10:13,010
WOULD YOU DOPPLE ME INTO THAT,
MIKE?

1632
01:10:13,010 --> 01:10:14,578
[LAUGHS]

1633
01:10:14,578 --> 01:10:16,647
SISTER SUZUKI SIDEKICK.

1634
01:10:16,647 --> 01:10:19,148
CONROY.
I GOT THE MONEY.

1635
01:10:19,148 --> 01:10:20,150
NOW CAN YOU HELP?

1636
01:10:20,150 --> 01:10:21,185
SURE, ANNIE.

1637
01:10:21,185 --> 01:10:22,252
AH,
PUSHING’S KINDA SLOW TODAY.

1638
01:10:22,252 --> 01:10:24,187
FINE. GET IN.

1639
01:10:27,658 --> 01:10:31,128
OKAY. WE’LL OPEN A PETSMART HERE
AND A HOME DEPOT THERE.

1640
01:10:32,228 --> 01:10:33,763
HMM?

1641
01:10:33,763 --> 01:10:37,602
OH. IT’S ONE OF THOSE THINGS
THAT COPS ALWAYS HIT ME WITH.

1642
01:10:39,002 --> 01:10:42,105
OKAY, AND WALDENBOOKS HERE
AND A COUPLE STARBUCKS.

1643
01:10:43,473 --> 01:10:45,142
WOULD YOU STOP MESSING AROUND
WITH THAT FLASHLIGHT

1644
01:10:45,142 --> 01:10:46,643
AND HELP US?

1645
01:10:46,643 --> 01:10:48,045
CH-YEAH.

1646
01:10:48,045 --> 01:10:50,880
SO, IN THE FUTURE THEY SIMPLY
FORGOT ABOUT FLASHLIGHTS.

1647
01:10:50,880 --> 01:10:52,048
[LAUGHS]

1648
01:10:55,018 --> 01:10:57,153
THESE HAVE NOTHING
TO DO WITH EACH OTHER.

1649
01:10:57,153 --> 01:10:58,722
[LAUGHS]

1650
01:10:58,722 --> 01:11:00,992
IT’S GREAT THEY GOT A FRENCH
RESISTANCE FIGHTER

1651
01:11:00,992 --> 01:11:02,927
TO HELP THEM.

1652
01:11:06,330 --> 01:11:09,098
UH, THIS WILL HAVE TO PASS
FOR HUMOR.

1653
01:11:09,098 --> 01:11:11,035
UNTIL ACTUAL HUMOR
CAN BE FOUND,

1654
01:11:11,035 --> 01:11:13,437
PLEASE ENJOY
THIS SUBSTITUTE.

1655
01:11:13,437 --> 01:11:16,140
UH-HUH. GREAT.
YOU GETTIN’ THIS, DUMBO?

1656
01:11:20,043 --> 01:11:22,713
YEAH. I THINK THIS SCENE
IS OVER. YUP.

1657
01:11:22,713 --> 01:11:24,080
CAMERA STILL ON?

1658
01:11:24,080 --> 01:11:25,983
OH, CRAP.
TURN IT OFF, WILL YA?

1659
01:11:25,983 --> 01:11:27,550
PETE.

1660
01:11:28,985 --> 01:11:31,322
LIEUTENANT NUN
LEADS THE TROOPS.

1661
01:11:31,322 --> 01:11:33,623
WAIT.
THIS IS IT.

1662
01:11:33,623 --> 01:11:35,892
MOVIE SPONSORED
BY THE PLAID COUNCIL.

1663
01:11:35,892 --> 01:11:37,762
PLAID--IT’S WHAT’S
FOR DINNER.

1664
01:11:37,762 --> 01:11:40,130
[LAUGHS]

1665
01:11:40,130 --> 01:11:44,435
OKAY. EVERYONE
GETS ONE JUICE BOX.
BUT THAT’S ALL.

1666
01:11:46,337 --> 01:11:49,940
I MADE A MEMORIAL
TO YOUR PEE STAIN.

1667
01:11:49,940 --> 01:11:51,942
LET’S GO.

1668
01:11:51,942 --> 01:11:55,778
PLAID AVENGERS HO!

1669
01:11:55,778 --> 01:11:59,148
SERVING 19.
WHO HAS 19?

1670
01:12:00,850 --> 01:12:04,187
OH, SUDDENLY HE’S LIKE
MR. FLASHLIGHT.

1671
01:12:04,187 --> 01:12:05,888
[LAUGHS]

1672
01:12:05,888 --> 01:12:10,427
MY GOD. I’VE FOUND
THE BEGINNING OF THE MOVIE.

1673
01:12:10,427 --> 01:12:15,832
YEAH. YEAH. OKAY.
"COME THIS WAY."
WE GET IT. YEAH.

1674
01:12:15,832 --> 01:12:19,970
THERE’S SEVEN DWARVES
COMIN’ RIGHT AT US.

1675
01:12:21,405 --> 01:12:24,608
THAT’S THE MOST COMPLICATED
TROMBONE IN THE WORLD.

1676
01:12:27,543 --> 01:12:29,980
THANKS FOR COMING DOWN
INTO MY WINE CELLAR WITH ME,
GUYS.

1677
01:12:29,980 --> 01:12:32,917
I GET SCARED.

1678
01:12:32,917 --> 01:12:35,385
SEE, I COULD POINT OUT
THAT THIS ISN’T THE FUTURE

1679
01:12:35,385 --> 01:12:37,320
AND IT’S NOT A WAR,
BUT YOU KNOW ME.

1680
01:12:37,320 --> 01:12:38,488
I DON’T LIKE TO COMPLAIN.

1681
01:12:38,488 --> 01:12:39,490
NOT YOU.

1682
01:12:39,490 --> 01:12:40,490
NO.
NOT ME.

1683
01:12:40,490 --> 01:12:41,492
NO.

1684
01:12:41,492 --> 01:12:43,693
[LAUGHS]
LIGHTING BUDGET RAN OUT,

1685
01:12:43,693 --> 01:12:46,730
BUT THEY JUST
KEEP ON A-FILMIN’.

1686
01:12:46,730 --> 01:12:49,332
THEY’RE HUNTING ED NORTON.

1687
01:12:51,468 --> 01:12:54,672
♪ N B C ♪

1688
01:12:56,740 --> 01:13:01,145
WHY’D DALE HAVE TO BRING
HIS IRONING BOARD?

1689
01:13:01,145 --> 01:13:02,880
VIVA LE RESISTANCE.

1690
01:13:05,348 --> 01:13:09,285
WOW. DINOSAUR’S GOT
A 10K BACK THERE.

1691
01:13:09,285 --> 01:13:10,787
OH, BY THE WAY,
THE WALL YOU’RE SEEING

1692
01:13:10,787 --> 01:13:12,188
WASN’T THE TRAIN
FROM THE EARLIER SCENE.

1693
01:13:12,188 --> 01:13:13,223
SO DON’T EVEN
THINK ABOUT IT.

1694
01:13:13,223 --> 01:13:16,327
"BONG BONG"

1695
01:13:16,327 --> 01:13:18,895
YOU KNOW, I HOPE THEY
DO THE "BONG BONG" SOUND AGAIN,
MIKE.

1696
01:13:18,895 --> 01:13:20,763
YOU KNOW,
I HOPE THEY NEVER STOP.

1697
01:13:20,763 --> 01:13:23,400
YEAH. I WISH I HAD A HUGE
BONG BONG RIGHT NOW.

1698
01:13:23,400 --> 01:13:26,137
[LAUGHTER]

1699
01:13:26,137 --> 01:13:27,537
WHAT’S THAT LIGHT
SUPPOSED TO BE?

1700
01:13:27,537 --> 01:13:31,708
IS GOD OUTSIDE?

1701
01:13:31,708 --> 01:13:34,143
GO.
GO HERE.

1702
01:13:34,143 --> 01:13:36,213
GO.

1703
01:13:36,213 --> 01:13:37,347
COME ON.
GO.

1704
01:13:37,347 --> 01:13:38,348
COME ON AND GO.

1705
01:13:38,348 --> 01:13:40,317
GO MORE.
AND THEN DRIVE.

1706
01:13:40,317 --> 01:13:41,852
GO. GO.

1707
01:13:41,852 --> 01:13:45,355
♪ CAN YOU HEAR THEM
THEY’RE TALKIN’ ’BOUT US ♪

1708
01:13:45,355 --> 01:13:47,723
♪ TELLIN’ LIES ♪

1709
01:13:47,723 --> 01:13:49,627
GO.
GO, GO, GO, GO, GO, GO.

1710
01:13:49,627 --> 01:13:52,797
GO. GO.
NOW STAY.

1711
01:13:52,797 --> 01:13:55,265
HOORAY. WE DID AN AWESOME JOB
OF WALKING DOWN THE HALL.

1712
01:13:55,265 --> 01:13:57,200
WHOO.

1713
01:13:58,802 --> 01:14:00,203
COME ON.
ANOTHER HIGH FIVE.

1714
01:14:00,203 --> 01:14:03,207
WE MADE IT FIVE MORE FEET
DOWN THE HALL. WHOO.

1715
01:14:03,207 --> 01:14:08,145
JACK JOHNSON’S BACK
AND HE’S FIGHTIN’
WITH A GUN THIS TIME.

1716
01:14:08,145 --> 01:14:11,648
AND YOU BROUGHT ALONG
THE RACCOON TRAP. WHY?

1717
01:14:13,883 --> 01:14:17,787
NOW, WHEN FOGHORN LEGHORN
COMES AROUND THE CORNER,
HE’S OURS.

1718
01:14:21,358 --> 01:14:23,793
[GROWLING]

1719
01:14:25,862 --> 01:14:29,232
I ONLY WISH MY ARMS
WERE LONG ENOUGH TO HOLD YOU.

1720
01:14:33,670 --> 01:14:36,138
SO I SAID,
"UP YOUR JURASSIC, PAL."

1721
01:14:36,138 --> 01:14:37,273
[LAUGHTER]

1722
01:14:37,273 --> 01:14:39,242
THAT’S A GOOD ONE.

1723
01:14:41,578 --> 01:14:44,515
[LAUGHS]
WELL, I SHOULD GET HOME.

1724
01:14:50,520 --> 01:14:51,622
HEY, STAN.

1725
01:14:51,622 --> 01:14:52,923
CAN YOU RECOMMEND
A GOOD PLACE TO GET

1726
01:14:52,923 --> 01:14:54,625
AN EXPLODING COLLAR FIXED?

1727
01:14:57,928 --> 01:14:59,863
NOW SERVING NINE.

1728
01:15:02,098 --> 01:15:04,602
WE FOUND ’EM.
DOWN THERE.

1729
01:15:04,602 --> 01:15:07,037
IT’S A FIXX VIDEO
WITHOUT THE MUSIC.

1730
01:15:07,037 --> 01:15:08,972
MM. GOOD.

1731
01:15:11,642 --> 01:15:13,577
ROBERT-CLAIRE
GUARDS HIS COMRADES.

1732
01:15:20,183 --> 01:15:22,785
♪ ALOUETTE
GENTILLE ALOUETTE ♪

1733
01:15:22,785 --> 01:15:25,355
♪ ALOUETTE
JE TE PLUMERAI ♪

1734
01:15:25,355 --> 01:15:27,323
♪ YA PA PA PA
PA PA PA ♪

1735
01:15:30,027 --> 01:15:33,063
SO, ACCORDING TO THE BELLS
IT’S 97 O’CLOCK.

1736
01:15:34,163 --> 01:15:37,167
[SIGHS]

1737
01:15:37,167 --> 01:15:39,168
WELL, DO YOU WANNA,
I DON’T KNOW...

1738
01:15:39,168 --> 01:15:42,438
HIGH-FIVE ME?

1739
01:15:42,438 --> 01:15:45,342
WE HAVE TO DRAW THEM
OUT OF THERE.

1740
01:15:45,342 --> 01:15:46,343
I KNOW.

1741
01:15:46,343 --> 01:15:48,045
CAN I USE THE FLASHLIGHT?

1742
01:15:48,045 --> 01:15:50,847
ARE YOU SCARED?

1743
01:15:50,847 --> 01:15:51,948
YEAH.

1744
01:15:51,948 --> 01:15:54,752
BUT THE SAUNA’S
HELPING ME RELAX.

1745
01:15:54,752 --> 01:15:58,488
GREATER LOVE HATH NO MAN,
REMEMBER?

1746
01:15:58,488 --> 01:15:59,555
I DO.

1747
01:15:59,555 --> 01:16:01,925
HE’S AN APPRENTICE
BRYAN BROWN.

1748
01:16:03,793 --> 01:16:08,032
YOU REALLY GOT A CLEAN SHAVE
THIS MORNING.

1749
01:16:08,032 --> 01:16:09,933
BY THE WAY,
I ASKED SISTER BERTRILLE

1750
01:16:09,933 --> 01:16:12,502
TO GIVE US AIR SUPPORT
AGAINST THE DINOSAURS.

1751
01:16:14,337 --> 01:16:15,738
LET’S DO THIS THING.

1752
01:16:15,738 --> 01:16:17,873
WOW. RIGHT HERE?
I MEAN, RIGHT NOW?

1753
01:16:17,873 --> 01:16:21,578
I--I--I MEAN,
I WANTED TO, BUT WOW.

1754
01:16:23,113 --> 01:16:25,482
INTRODUCING NEW,
FASTER SECONDS.

1755
01:16:25,482 --> 01:16:26,583
[LAUGHS]

1756
01:16:28,252 --> 01:16:32,188
OH, SURE.
DSS IS EASY TO INSTALL.

1757
01:16:33,657 --> 01:16:36,327
CAN’T GET THAT STUPID PIGEON
OUT OF THERE.

1758
01:16:39,128 --> 01:16:42,465
I, UH--I NEED THE KEY
TO THE CHEST FREEZER.

1759
01:16:44,802 --> 01:16:46,168
AH, [LAUGHS]

1760
01:16:46,168 --> 01:16:48,205
TICK TICK TICK,
LITTLE BOMBY.

1761
01:16:48,205 --> 01:16:50,473
TICK TICK TICK. REMEMBER?

1762
01:16:50,473 --> 01:16:53,043
MAY YOU ROAD BE PAVED
WITH SAUSAGES.

1763
01:16:55,778 --> 01:16:58,315
♪ WHY DON’T YOU ASK HIM ♪

1764
01:16:58,315 --> 01:17:02,018
♪ IF HE’S GOING TO STAY ♪

1765
01:17:02,018 --> 01:17:03,520
♪ WHY DON’T YOU ASK HIM ♪

1766
01:17:03,520 --> 01:17:06,590
♪ IF HE’S GOING AWAY ♪

1767
01:17:06,590 --> 01:17:10,393
♪ HMM HMM HMM
TUSK ♪

1768
01:17:10,393 --> 01:17:12,462
♪ DON’T SAY THAT
YA LOVE ME ♪

1769
01:17:12,462 --> 01:17:15,998
[LAUGHS]

1770
01:17:15,998 --> 01:17:17,400
THINGS.

1771
01:17:17,400 --> 01:17:19,970
COME ON.
OVER HERE.

1772
01:17:19,970 --> 01:17:22,505
WE’RE GETTING EXTINCT.
DO YOU MIND?

1773
01:17:22,505 --> 01:17:25,475
SHOULD JUST WAIT UNTIL THEIR
SCALES TURN INTO FEATHERS

1774
01:17:25,475 --> 01:17:26,477
AND THEN PLUCK ’EM.

1775
01:17:26,477 --> 01:17:30,180
[GROWLING]

1776
01:17:30,180 --> 01:17:32,748
HI.
GOOD TO SEE YOU AGAIN.

1777
01:17:35,685 --> 01:17:37,753
I’M ON FLASHLIGHT.

1778
01:17:41,023 --> 01:17:43,627
HELP!

1779
01:17:53,803 --> 01:17:55,805
I’M JUST GONNA THROW
A COUPLE OF BALES OF HAY

1780
01:17:55,805 --> 01:17:57,573
WHILE I’M HERE.

1781
01:17:58,642 --> 01:17:59,977
♪ DOO DOO DOO
DOO DOO ♪

1782
01:17:59,977 --> 01:18:01,745
AND IN THIS CORNER...

1783
01:18:01,745 --> 01:18:03,513
[LAUGHS]

1784
01:18:03,513 --> 01:18:07,483
♪ DOO DOO DOO DOO
DOO DOO DOO ♪

1785
01:18:07,483 --> 01:18:10,487
UH-HUH.
AS PREVIOUSLY SEEN.

1786
01:18:10,487 --> 01:18:13,357
[SCREAMS]

1787
01:18:13,357 --> 01:18:14,490
NO!

1788
01:18:14,490 --> 01:18:17,993
DINOSAUR SUPER-SIZED IT.

1789
01:18:17,993 --> 01:18:20,130
OH, THE ICE FISHING’S
BAD HERE.

1790
01:18:21,398 --> 01:18:23,467
WEE.

1791
01:18:27,570 --> 01:18:29,807
SO, THEY HEAVED
A MIC STAND AT HIM.

1792
01:18:29,807 --> 01:18:31,775
[LAUGHS]

1793
01:18:35,012 --> 01:18:37,213
AIN’T IT FUNNY
HOW TIME SLIPS AWAY?

1794
01:18:40,317 --> 01:18:41,718
STUPID MAMMALS.

1795
01:18:46,990 --> 01:18:48,023
CONROY!

1796
01:18:48,023 --> 01:18:49,492
COME ON.
THEY’RE RIGHT BEHIND US.

1797
01:18:49,492 --> 01:18:50,493
WE GOTTA GO.

1798
01:18:50,493 --> 01:18:51,528
THEY NEED MORE TIME.

1799
01:18:51,528 --> 01:18:53,263
I NEED TO BUY THEM MORE TIME.

1800
01:18:53,263 --> 01:18:54,730
TAKE HER. TAKE HER.

1801
01:18:54,730 --> 01:18:57,700
[SCOFFS]

1802
01:18:57,700 --> 01:18:59,302
BONJOUR.

1803
01:19:02,372 --> 01:19:04,007
AW, [...]

1804
01:19:05,308 --> 01:19:06,943
BOY,
DRESSING LIKE CHE GUEVARA

1805
01:19:06,943 --> 01:19:08,145
DIDN’T HELP AT ALL.

1806
01:19:08,145 --> 01:19:09,745
HIS CAREFUL PLAN INVOLVING
PUTTING ON A BERET

1807
01:19:09,745 --> 01:19:11,915
AND RUSHING AT THE DINOSAUR
WITH A BOY SCOUT KNIFE.

1808
01:19:16,252 --> 01:19:17,720
IT WOULD HAVE BEEN
MUCH MORE EFFECTIVE

1809
01:19:17,720 --> 01:19:19,923
TO GET HIM INTO A BATHTUB
AND THEN DROP A HAIR DRYER

1810
01:19:19,923 --> 01:19:20,923
INTO THE WATER.

1811
01:19:20,923 --> 01:19:21,992
MM-HMM.

1812
01:19:21,992 --> 01:19:23,193
OOH.

1813
01:19:23,193 --> 01:19:25,695
THE AWESOME POWER
OF A 60 WATT BULB.

1814
01:19:25,695 --> 01:19:27,697
YEAH.

1815
01:19:27,697 --> 01:19:31,167
NOW BACK TO DRUG DEALIN’.
WHOO.

1816
01:19:32,235 --> 01:19:33,637
HMM?

1817
01:19:35,472 --> 01:19:37,407
I GOT BETTER.

1818
01:19:39,742 --> 01:19:41,978
CAREFUL.
THAT CHIN MIGHT GO OFF.

1819
01:19:44,747 --> 01:19:47,717
GO GET ’EM, SISTER.
GOOD LUCK NOW.

1820
01:19:55,092 --> 01:19:58,027
TIME FOR A LITTLE
CHIN MUSIC.

1821
01:19:58,027 --> 01:19:59,295
OW.

1822
01:19:59,295 --> 01:20:02,332
Z’DON’T.

1823
01:20:02,332 --> 01:20:03,367
AM I A HIPPIE?

1824
01:20:03,367 --> 01:20:04,467
[LAUGHS]

1825
01:20:05,702 --> 01:20:07,503
AAH!

1826
01:20:07,503 --> 01:20:08,505
AAH!

1827
01:20:08,505 --> 01:20:11,173
RAAH REEH RAAH!

1828
01:20:13,577 --> 01:20:14,710
I’M FRETTING.

1829
01:20:14,710 --> 01:20:15,812
SEE AUDIENCE?

1830
01:20:15,812 --> 01:20:17,580
I’M FRETTING.

1831
01:20:19,648 --> 01:20:21,918
OH, THE DOCTOR SAYS
HE HAS TO WEAR

1832
01:20:21,918 --> 01:20:24,120
HIS GLAUCOMA TEST FOREVER.

1833
01:20:28,123 --> 01:20:30,393
GOT YA.

1834
01:20:34,297 --> 01:20:37,600
UH, HIS CHIN’S
OFF BALANCE.

1835
01:20:41,905 --> 01:20:43,807
OOH.
BIG ZIT.

1836
01:20:46,242 --> 01:20:48,812
LET’S GO BE ON FAME.

1837
01:20:50,680 --> 01:20:53,182
♪ DOO DOO DOO
DOO DOO DOO ♪

1838
01:20:53,182 --> 01:20:55,585
IT’S A 5K SPAZ RUN.

1839
01:20:57,420 --> 01:20:59,322
SLOWER.
SLOWER.

1840
01:20:59,322 --> 01:21:01,658
JOG LIGHTLY
OUT OF DANGER.

1841
01:21:03,092 --> 01:21:06,763
♪ DINOSAURS
ARE CHASIN’ US ♪

1842
01:21:09,832 --> 01:21:11,735
YOU FORGOT
YOUR BACKPACK--AAH!

1843
01:21:15,605 --> 01:21:17,207
YOU GUYS GET
DINOSAUR INTESTINES

1844
01:21:17,207 --> 01:21:19,175
ALL OVER YOU TOO?

1845
01:21:19,175 --> 01:21:20,877
HI.
I’M A DIRECTOR.

1846
01:21:20,877 --> 01:21:23,012
PLEASE ENJOY THIS SMALL,
INACCURATE MODEL

1847
01:21:23,012 --> 01:21:24,747
OF WHAT WE’D LIKE TO IMPLY
JUST HAPPENED.

1848
01:21:24,747 --> 01:21:26,148
THANK YOU.

1849
01:21:26,148 --> 01:21:28,318
FOUR DAYS AGO
A FIRE FELL FROM THE SKY...

1850
01:21:28,318 --> 01:21:29,385
MM-HMM.

1851
01:21:29,385 --> 01:21:30,453
AND I THOUGHT
EVERYTHING IT BROUGHT

1852
01:21:30,453 --> 01:21:32,122
WOULD JUST EXTINGUISH
AND BURN AWAY.

1853
01:21:32,122 --> 01:21:33,323
I’M KINDA DUMB.

1854
01:21:33,323 --> 01:21:35,792
NOW, FOR ALL THE QUESTIONS
AND DOUBTS I HAD,

1855
01:21:35,792 --> 01:21:37,860
EVERYTHING SEEMS SO CLEAR.

1856
01:21:37,860 --> 01:21:39,062
HI, SISTER CHUCK.

1857
01:21:39,062 --> 01:21:41,463
I THINK THE ONE
IN THE BLACK LIKES ME.

1858
01:21:41,463 --> 01:21:46,235
IN THE NAME OF THE FATHER,
THE SON, AND THE HOLY SPIRIT.
AMEN.

1859
01:21:46,235 --> 01:21:47,770
FATHER OLIVER PLATT.

1860
01:21:49,238 --> 01:21:50,473
DEAR SISTER.

1861
01:21:50,473 --> 01:21:53,142
DO YOU NOW WANT TO COMMIT

1862
01:21:53,142 --> 01:21:55,645
TO THIS BOND
OF PERPETUAL DEVOTION?

1863
01:21:55,645 --> 01:21:56,680
YES I WILL.

1864
01:21:56,680 --> 01:21:58,247
CAN I TRY FOR A WEEK?

1865
01:21:58,247 --> 01:22:01,150
DO YOU WANT TO STRIVE
FOR THE PERFECT LOVE OF GOD

1866
01:22:01,150 --> 01:22:04,253
AND OF YOUR NEIGHBOR,
FOLLOWING THE SPIRIT
OF THE GOSPEL?

1867
01:22:04,253 --> 01:22:07,323
YEAH.
I GUESS.

1868
01:22:07,323 --> 01:22:08,792
YES. I WILL.

1869
01:22:08,792 --> 01:22:11,260
BY THE GRACE
OF THE HOLY SPIRIT,

1870
01:22:11,260 --> 01:22:13,530
DO YOU WANT TO GENEROUSLY
SPEND YOUR WHOLE LIFE

1871
01:22:13,530 --> 01:22:15,365
IN THE SERVICE
OF GOD’S PEOPLE?

1872
01:22:15,365 --> 01:22:16,900
[LAUGHS]

1873
01:22:16,900 --> 01:22:18,100
YOU THINK
SHE’S GONNA DO IT?

1874
01:22:18,100 --> 01:22:20,003
NO WAY, MAN.

1875
01:22:20,003 --> 01:22:21,772
BY THE GRACE
OF THE HOLY SPIRIT,

1876
01:22:21,772 --> 01:22:23,673
DO YOU WANT TO SPEND
YOUR WHOLE LIFE

1877
01:22:23,673 --> 01:22:25,042
IN THE SERVICE
OF GOD’S PEOPLE?

1878
01:22:25,042 --> 01:22:26,042
OH, AND GOD’S CAR.

1879
01:22:26,042 --> 01:22:28,412
YOU’LL HAVE TO TAKE CARE
OF THAT TOO.

1880
01:22:28,412 --> 01:22:31,948
WHEN HE WAS A FUTURE SLAVE
HE WORKED IN THE HAIR GEL MINES.

1881
01:22:33,483 --> 01:22:35,818
[SIGHS]
YEARS OF EXPENSIVE
NUN TRAINING

1882
01:22:35,818 --> 01:22:37,753
JUST WASTED.

1883
01:22:39,288 --> 01:22:41,557
YES. I WI--

1884
01:22:41,557 --> 01:22:42,658
IT’S SUPER POPE.

1885
01:22:42,658 --> 01:22:43,827
[LAUGHS]

1886
01:22:45,662 --> 01:22:48,532
IF THE LUTHERANS
CREATE A CYBORG.

1887
01:22:51,467 --> 01:22:54,637
IT’S LIBERATION THEOLOGY
VERSUS OPUS DEI.

1888
01:22:56,472 --> 01:22:57,840
I OPEN MY MOUTH AT YOU.

1889
01:23:04,380 --> 01:23:05,682
MY SHIRT WAS KNOCKED OFF.

1890
01:23:05,682 --> 01:23:07,583
IT WAS KNOCKED OFF.
I SWEAR.

1891
01:23:10,820 --> 01:23:13,657
WOW. HE’S GOT THE LONGEST
BUTT CRACK I’VE EVER SEEN.

1892
01:23:13,657 --> 01:23:14,623
MM-HMM.

1893
01:23:16,793 --> 01:23:18,828
OH. CALL THE RECONSTRUCTIVE
UROLOGIST.

1894
01:23:22,298 --> 01:23:24,433
LOOK AT THAT BEAUTIFUL
STAINED GLASS WINDOW.

1895
01:23:24,433 --> 01:23:25,835
THEY MUST HAVE HAD
A LOSER BISHOP

1896
01:23:25,835 --> 01:23:28,337
TO GET A BASILICA
LIKE THIS.

1897
01:23:28,337 --> 01:23:30,173
I THINK IT’S JUST
THE ARBY’S EMPLOYEE CHAPEL.

1898
01:23:33,743 --> 01:23:35,745
YOU STILL THINK
I TOOK MY SHIRT OFF.

1899
01:23:35,745 --> 01:23:37,480
DON’T YOU?

1900
01:23:41,417 --> 01:23:42,852
BETTER ONE.

1901
01:23:42,852 --> 01:23:44,753
BETTER TWO.

1902
01:23:50,693 --> 01:23:52,528
I JUST WANNA SEE
WHERE HE’S GONNA GO WITH THIS.

1903
01:23:52,528 --> 01:23:54,297
I’M JUST GONNA STAND HERE
AND WATCH.

1904
01:23:54,297 --> 01:23:56,933
OH. I SEE.
WELL, OUCH, THEN.

1905
01:23:56,933 --> 01:23:59,635
HUH.

1906
01:23:59,635 --> 01:24:01,337
FUTURE SACRED STATUARY HATER.

1907
01:24:01,337 --> 01:24:04,073
HERE.

1908
01:24:07,043 --> 01:24:09,878
WELL,
NOW HIS CHEST IS HEALED.

1909
01:24:09,878 --> 01:24:11,513
OH, WELL,
NOW IT’S NOT.

1910
01:24:11,513 --> 01:24:13,417
OH, WELL,
NOW IT IS AGAIN.
SORRY.

1911
01:24:13,417 --> 01:24:14,717
OH, NOW IT’S NOT.
MY FAULT.

1912
01:24:14,717 --> 01:24:16,018
OH, NOW IT’S NOT AGAIN.

1913
01:24:16,018 --> 01:24:17,187
IT IS. IT’S NOT.

1914
01:24:17,187 --> 01:24:18,320
OH.

1915
01:24:21,057 --> 01:24:22,425
DID I MAKE MY POINT,
THOUGH?

1916
01:24:22,425 --> 01:24:23,593
ELOQUENTLY.

1917
01:24:23,593 --> 01:24:25,128
OH.

1918
01:24:25,128 --> 01:24:27,430
[BEEPING]

1919
01:24:27,430 --> 01:24:29,432
RIP TAYLOR
AS THE ANDROID.

1920
01:24:33,470 --> 01:24:34,903
HUH?

1921
01:24:34,903 --> 01:24:36,840
THE MOVIE THAT DELIVERS
MORE "HUHs" PER SECOND.

1922
01:24:39,208 --> 01:24:41,510
I TRIED TO LIGHT
A VOTIVE CANDLE FOR MY GRANDMA

1923
01:24:41,510 --> 01:24:43,112
AND IT GOT OUT OF CONTROL.

1924
01:24:45,715 --> 01:24:50,353
THIS IS A WEIRD P.S.A.
FOR THE CATHOLIC CHURCH.

1925
01:24:50,353 --> 01:24:53,890
OH, THANKS.
GREAT NUN CEREMONY.

1926
01:24:55,090 --> 01:24:57,427
UH, IS THIS ALLOWED
IN THE CHAPEL?

1927
01:24:57,427 --> 01:24:59,528
THE AMBULANCE IS HERE.

1928
01:24:59,528 --> 01:25:00,797
AMBULANCE.

1929
01:25:00,797 --> 01:25:03,733
SO MUCH TO LEARN.
SO MUCH.

1930
01:25:03,733 --> 01:25:07,003
OH, SHH.
YOU’RE GONNA BE ALL RIGHT.
OKAY?

1931
01:25:07,003 --> 01:25:08,137
I LEARN FROM YOU.

1932
01:25:08,137 --> 01:25:09,472
MM-HMM.

1933
01:25:09,472 --> 01:25:10,473
I WANT...

1934
01:25:10,473 --> 01:25:13,643
TO PLAY WITH A FLASHLIGHT.

1935
01:25:13,643 --> 01:25:16,913
GREATER LOVE
HAS NO MAN THAN THIS.

1936
01:25:17,980 --> 01:25:19,648
I WANNA BE THAT MAN.

1937
01:25:19,648 --> 01:25:21,050
JESUS WAS A KICKBOXER,
RIGHT?

1938
01:25:21,050 --> 01:25:22,818
YOU ARE.

1939
01:25:22,818 --> 01:25:24,220
YOU ARE.

1940
01:25:24,220 --> 01:25:26,222
YOU ASK ME...

1941
01:25:26,222 --> 01:25:28,525
IF THERE’S A HEAVEN
OUT THERE.

1942
01:25:28,525 --> 01:25:29,725
SHH.

1943
01:25:29,725 --> 01:25:32,095
I DON’T WANNA KNOW.
I’M AN AGNOSTIC.

1944
01:25:32,095 --> 01:25:33,328
I KNOW.

1945
01:25:33,328 --> 01:25:35,865
FOUR DAYS AGO,
A FIRE FELL FROM THE SKY.

1946
01:25:35,865 --> 01:25:36,933
I KNOW.

1947
01:25:36,933 --> 01:25:39,068
EVERYTHING HE WANTED
WAS EVERYTHING I NEEDED.

1948
01:25:39,068 --> 01:25:41,670
SO, NEITHER OF US
ACTUALLY GOT ANYTHING.

1949
01:25:41,670 --> 01:25:43,540
[PHONE RINGING]

1950
01:25:43,540 --> 01:25:46,008
HILL STREET REHAB.
HOW CAN I HELP YOU?

1951
01:25:46,008 --> 01:25:47,477
HELLO.
I’M A RUNAWAY.

1952
01:25:47,477 --> 01:25:48,477
I’M ALL ALONE.

1953
01:25:48,477 --> 01:25:50,012
CAN YOU HELP ME PLEASE?

1954
01:25:50,012 --> 01:25:51,047
SCORE.

1955
01:25:51,047 --> 01:25:52,848
NICE COUNSELOR PICTURE.

1956
01:25:52,848 --> 01:25:55,585
NOW THAT PASSION
FOR LIVING AND GIVING LIFE

1957
01:25:55,585 --> 01:25:58,722
BURNS DEEPLY AND FOREVER
IN MY HEART.

1958
01:26:00,857 --> 01:26:02,392
OKAY. YOU GUYS.
HEY. LISTEN.

1959
01:26:02,392 --> 01:26:04,360
I GOT SOMETHING REALLY COOL
I WANNA SHOW YOU.

1960
01:26:04,360 --> 01:26:05,862
JUST--JUST WAIT RIGHT HERE.
OKAY?

1961
01:26:05,862 --> 01:26:07,863
UM, OKAY.

1962
01:26:07,863 --> 01:26:09,632
JUST WAIT RIGHT THERE.

1963
01:26:09,632 --> 01:26:11,400
SO, HE DITCHED US.

1964
01:26:11,400 --> 01:26:12,402
APPARENTLY.

1965
01:26:12,402 --> 01:26:13,402
HMM.

1966
01:26:13,402 --> 01:26:14,403
NO. IT’S REALLY,
REALLY COOL.

1967
01:26:14,403 --> 01:26:15,672
JUST HANG ON.

1968
01:26:15,672 --> 01:26:17,173
HEY. HEY, SERVO.
WHERE’S THAT THING OF YOURS?

1969
01:26:17,173 --> 01:26:18,307
WHAT THING?

1970
01:26:18,307 --> 01:26:19,975
UH, YOU KNOW, COULD YOU
STEP IT UP A BIT, MIKE?

1971
01:26:19,975 --> 01:26:21,777
THE ACTORS
HAVE REALLY STUPID NAMES.

1972
01:26:21,777 --> 01:26:24,280
JUST A MINUTE.

1973
01:26:24,280 --> 01:26:25,748
HEY, CROW.
LOOK.

1974
01:26:25,748 --> 01:26:26,983
JUST "ADASH," PLEASE.

1975
01:26:26,983 --> 01:26:27,983
[LAUGHS]

1976
01:26:27,983 --> 01:26:29,185
WHAT?

1977
01:26:29,185 --> 01:26:30,587
WELL,
I’M JUST MAKIN’ FUN OF THE--

1978
01:26:30,587 --> 01:26:31,587
WELL, DON’T.

1979
01:26:31,587 --> 01:26:32,955
OKAY.
HERE WE GO.

1980
01:26:32,955 --> 01:26:34,323
HERE WE GO WHAT?

1981
01:26:34,323 --> 01:26:36,058
NOW, WATCH.
WATCH.

1982
01:26:36,058 --> 01:26:39,195
[GROWLING]

1983
01:26:39,195 --> 01:26:40,963
UH, MIKE?
WHY ARE YOU GROWLING?

1984
01:26:40,963 --> 01:26:42,998
IT’S A GIANT DINOSAUR.
SEE?

1985
01:26:42,998 --> 01:26:45,000
I DON’T GET YOU,
MIKE.

1986
01:26:45,000 --> 01:26:46,635
IT’S--IT’S
FORCED PERSPECTIVE.

1987
01:26:46,635 --> 01:26:47,637
BY BEING OVER HERE,

1988
01:26:47,637 --> 01:26:49,605
I CAN MAKE THIS
TOY DINOSAUR LOOK HUGE.

1989
01:26:49,605 --> 01:26:50,873
OVER WHERE?

1990
01:26:50,873 --> 01:26:52,342
OH, OH, HELL.
THERE YOU ARE.

1991
01:26:52,342 --> 01:26:54,343
WHAT ARE YOU DOING
WITH MY TOY?

1992
01:26:54,343 --> 01:26:56,512
I--I’M DEMONSTRATING
FORCED PERSPECTIVE.

1993
01:26:56,512 --> 01:26:58,380
OH,
HOW NICE FOR YOU.

1994
01:26:58,380 --> 01:27:00,048
OH,
DON’T BE SO SARDONIC.

1995
01:27:00,048 --> 01:27:01,283
IT’S NEAT. LOOK.
YOU CAN BITE YOUR HEAD--

1996
01:27:01,283 --> 01:27:02,785
OKAY, MIKE.
LET’S HUMOR YOU.

1997
01:27:02,785 --> 01:27:04,187
IT IS NEAT.

1998
01:27:04,187 --> 01:27:05,788
WELL,
SURE IT IS.

1999
01:27:05,788 --> 01:27:07,857
AND YOU CAN DO IT WITH
ALL KINDS OF THINGS.

2000
01:27:07,857 --> 01:27:09,992
WHY, UH, HECK.
IF YOU WANTED, YOU COULD

2001
01:27:09,992 --> 01:27:11,893
MAKE A GIANT WRENCH.

2002
01:27:11,893 --> 01:27:12,895
LOOK.
LOOK OUT, YOU TWO.

2003
01:27:12,895 --> 01:27:14,863
AHH!
I’M A GIANT WRENCH. AAH!

2004
01:27:14,863 --> 01:27:16,832
SO IT’S A WRENCH.
ONLY REALLY BIG.

2005
01:27:16,832 --> 01:27:17,833
BIG WRENCH.

2006
01:27:17,833 --> 01:27:19,302
YEAH.
AND LOOK.

2007
01:27:19,302 --> 01:27:21,972
UH, WHAT WAS ONCE
AN ORDINARY SET
OF PINKING SHEARS

2008
01:27:21,972 --> 01:27:24,740
BECOMES
A SORT OF A CROCODILE.

2009
01:27:24,740 --> 01:27:26,008
[LAUGHS]
CLEVER.

2010
01:27:26,008 --> 01:27:27,410
CROCODILE.
YEAH.

2011
01:27:27,410 --> 01:27:28,410
ISN’T THAT NEAT?
AND LOOK.

2012
01:27:28,410 --> 01:27:30,713
YOU KNOW YOUR
LITTLE TOY RABBIT?

2013
01:27:30,713 --> 01:27:31,982
YEAH?

2014
01:27:31,982 --> 01:27:34,317
IT BECOMES THE STAR
OF NIGHT OF THE LEPUS.

2015
01:27:34,317 --> 01:27:36,418
MIKE,
WHAT’S ALL THIS REALLY ABOUT?

2016
01:27:36,418 --> 01:27:39,222
COME ON. THIS IS BECAUSE JOEL
STOPPED BY RECENTLY,
ISN’T IT?

2017
01:27:39,222 --> 01:27:40,323
IT’S JOEL,
RIGHT?

2018
01:27:40,323 --> 01:27:42,592
NO. NO.
WAIT. WAIT WAIT.
THERE’S MORE.

2019
01:27:42,592 --> 01:27:45,862
WITH FORCED PERSPECTIVE THIS
"PRECIOUS MOMENTS" FIGURINE

2020
01:27:45,862 --> 01:27:48,530
LOOMS AS LARGE
AS THE STATUE OF LIBERTY.

2021
01:27:48,530 --> 01:27:50,500
YOU KNOW,
HE HAS A POINT, CROW.

2022
01:27:50,500 --> 01:27:51,733
NO, NO, NO, NO.
HE HAS NO POINT.

2023
01:27:51,733 --> 01:27:53,068
DON’T ENCOURAGE HIM.

2024
01:27:53,068 --> 01:27:55,103
HEY, AND,
AND CHILDREN, LOOK.

2025
01:27:55,103 --> 01:27:57,107
HERE COMES GAMERA.

2026
01:27:57,107 --> 01:27:58,607
GAMERA IS FRIEND
TO ALL CHILDREN.

2027
01:27:58,607 --> 01:28:00,343
HAVE YOU SEEN
HIS MEDICATION?

2028
01:28:00,343 --> 01:28:02,145
NO I--I THINK
HE’S OFF IT AGAIN.

2029
01:28:02,145 --> 01:28:03,178
OH, NO.

2030
01:28:03,178 --> 01:28:04,247
AND FINALLY...

2031
01:28:04,247 --> 01:28:05,348
SERVO’S CHEW TOY

2032
01:28:05,348 --> 01:28:07,117
LOOKS JUST LIKE
THE SATELLITE OF LOVE.

2033
01:28:07,117 --> 01:28:08,217
SEE?

2034
01:28:08,217 --> 01:28:09,585
HUH.

2035
01:28:09,585 --> 01:28:11,420
WELL, HEY.
HEY THERE YA GO.

2036
01:28:11,420 --> 01:28:12,722
THAT’S THE SPIRIT,
SERVO.

2037
01:28:12,722 --> 01:28:13,890
YOU’VE MADE YOURSELF INTO

2038
01:28:13,890 --> 01:28:16,392
"GIANT SERVO--
DESTROYER OF WHOLE CITIES."

2039
01:28:16,392 --> 01:28:18,695
UH, MIKE?
ACTUALLY I’M STILL OVER HERE.

2040
01:28:18,695 --> 01:28:20,730
OH. OH, YEAH.
THERE YOU ARE.

2041
01:28:20,730 --> 01:28:21,730
WHAT, UH--

2042
01:28:21,730 --> 01:28:22,732
[ROARS]

2043
01:28:22,732 --> 01:28:25,768
AAH! AAH!
IT--IT’S A GIANT SERVO!

2044
01:28:25,768 --> 01:28:26,768
RUN!

2045
01:28:26,768 --> 01:28:28,237
HELP!
IT’S A GIANT SERVO!

2046
01:28:28,237 --> 01:28:30,573
OH, NO!
A HORRIBLE GIANT SERVO!

2047
01:28:30,573 --> 01:28:32,175
RUN FOR YOUR LIFE,
MIKE!

2048
01:28:32,175 --> 01:28:33,475
HEAD FOR THE HILLS,
MIKE!

2049
01:28:33,475 --> 01:28:34,477
RUN!

2050
01:28:34,477 --> 01:28:35,945
RUN, MIKE!
RUN!

2051
01:28:35,945 --> 01:28:37,580
[LAUGHTER]

2052
01:28:37,580 --> 01:28:38,948
THAT’S IT,
YOU POOR SAP.

2053
01:28:38,948 --> 01:28:40,248
WHOO,
WE STUCK HIM BAD.

2054
01:28:40,248 --> 01:28:41,950
OH, MAN.
GOOD ONE, TOM.

2055
01:28:41,950 --> 01:28:43,618
UH, HOW DID YOU MANAGE
THE EFFECT SO WELL?

2056
01:28:43,618 --> 01:28:45,220
[LAUGHS]
WELL, WHAT DO YOU MEAN?

2057
01:28:45,220 --> 01:28:47,423
I MEAN, HOW DO YOU OPERATE
THE OTHER HEAD WHILE
YOU SIT THERE?

2058
01:28:47,423 --> 01:28:50,192
YOU KNOW, I WAS JUST ABOUT
TO ASK YOU THE SAME QUESTION.

2059
01:28:50,192 --> 01:28:51,427
OH. YOU WERE.

2060
01:28:51,427 --> 01:28:52,495
[ROARS]

2061
01:28:52,495 --> 01:28:54,830
OKAY. BACK AWAY
VERY SLOWLY AND RUN!

2062
01:28:54,830 --> 01:28:55,865
[SCREAMS]

2063
01:28:55,865 --> 01:28:56,898
OW.

2064
01:28:56,898 --> 01:28:58,935
HI. IT’S ME.
TOM SERVO.

2065
01:28:58,935 --> 01:29:00,537
DON’T TRY TO FIGURE IT OUT.

2066
01:29:00,537 --> 01:29:02,505
HELL, I GOT AT LEAST
A DOZEN OF ME.

2067
01:29:02,505 --> 01:29:05,073
UH, GOOD NIGHT.
[LAUGHS]

2068
01:29:16,652 --> 01:29:17,653
[LAUGHTER]

2069
01:29:17,653 --> 01:29:19,055
GRRR.

2070
01:29:19,055 --> 01:29:20,155
IT’S FUN.

2071
01:29:20,155 --> 01:29:21,390
HI, GUYS.

2072
01:29:21,390 --> 01:29:23,025
HUH.

2073
01:29:23,025 --> 01:29:24,027
NOTICE ANYTHING?

2074
01:29:24,027 --> 01:29:25,327
UH-HUH.
SURE, MIKE.

2075
01:29:25,327 --> 01:29:26,628
I’M WEARING A FUNNY CHIN.

2076
01:29:26,628 --> 01:29:27,997
OH, LOOK.
JUST STOP, WOULD YA?

2077
01:29:27,997 --> 01:29:29,198
GEEZ.

2078
01:29:29,198 --> 01:29:30,967
BUT I CAN’T.
IT’S BIG AND IT’S FUNNY.

2079
01:29:30,967 --> 01:29:32,835
♪ I HAVE A BIG CHIN
I HAVE A BIG CHIN ♪

2080
01:29:32,835 --> 01:29:34,403
DON’T YOU EVEN CARE
HOW INSULTING YOU ARE

2081
01:29:34,403 --> 01:29:35,905
TO THE THOUSANDS
OF PEOPLE OUT THERE

2082
01:29:35,905 --> 01:29:37,840
WHO HAVE BIG,
PROSTHETIC, FOAM CHINS?

2083
01:29:37,840 --> 01:29:39,508
HMM.

2084
01:29:39,508 --> 01:29:40,977
NOPE.
YOU KNOW WHY?

2085
01:29:40,977 --> 01:29:43,112
’CAUSE I HAVE A BIG CHIN.

2086
01:29:43,112 --> 01:29:44,547
HO HO HO HO.

2087
01:29:44,547 --> 01:29:45,548
IT’S BIG.

2088
01:29:45,548 --> 01:29:46,748
SORRY, EVERYONE.

2089
01:29:46,748 --> 01:29:48,717
UH, PEARL’S CALLING,
YOU INSENSITIVE COW.

2090
01:29:48,717 --> 01:29:49,785
OH.
WATCH THIS.

2091
01:29:49,785 --> 01:29:53,222
[GROANS]
BIG CHIN.

2092
01:29:53,222 --> 01:29:54,523
SAY.

2093
01:29:54,523 --> 01:29:56,158
GOOD.
GOOD, GOOD, GOOD, GOOD.

2094
01:29:56,158 --> 01:29:59,062
RESULTS SHOW THIS FILM
CAUSES BIZARRE BEHAVIOR

2095
01:29:59,062 --> 01:30:01,297
WITHOUT THE USE
OF HALLUCINOGENS.

2096
01:30:01,297 --> 01:30:03,867
BRAIN GUY,
SEND THIS REPORT
TO THE INSTITUTE.

2097
01:30:03,867 --> 01:30:05,133
I DON’T FOLLOW YOU,
MY FRIEND.

2098
01:30:05,133 --> 01:30:06,135
NO WAY.

2099
01:30:06,135 --> 01:30:07,570
WE’RE GOING ON THE ROAD.

2100
01:30:07,570 --> 01:30:08,972
TOO TRUE,
FAIR LADY.

2101
01:30:08,972 --> 01:30:10,773
OUR SOUND IS TIGHT,
YA KNOW?

2102
01:30:10,773 --> 01:30:12,040
MELLOW?

2103
01:30:12,040 --> 01:30:14,110
BOBO’S LYRICS
ARE PURE POETRY, MAN.

2104
01:30:14,110 --> 01:30:16,845
YES. WE’RE OPENING
THE MOBY GRAPE REUNION TOUR

2105
01:30:16,845 --> 01:30:18,147
IN SANTA CRUZ.

2106
01:30:18,147 --> 01:30:19,248
OH.

2107
01:30:19,248 --> 01:30:20,248
YOU ARE.

2108
01:30:20,248 --> 01:30:21,317
HMM.

2109
01:30:21,317 --> 01:30:22,585
HOW NICE.

2110
01:30:22,585 --> 01:30:25,555
WELL, I HAVE SOME
PARTING GIFTS FOR BOTH OF YOU.

2111
01:30:25,555 --> 01:30:27,857
THESE ARE HANDMADE
LOVE NECKLACES

2112
01:30:27,857 --> 01:30:29,458
SO’S YOU BOTH HAVE
SOMETHING SPECIAL

2113
01:30:29,458 --> 01:30:31,027
TO REMEMBER ME BY.

2114
01:30:31,027 --> 01:30:34,197
PEARL, YOU ARE TOO, TOO SOLID
FOR THIS WORLD, MAN.

2115
01:30:34,197 --> 01:30:36,998
BOBO.
HIT ME WITH SOME LYRIC.

2116
01:30:36,998 --> 01:30:40,770
♪ LIKE A DOG IN THE SAND ♪

2117
01:30:40,770 --> 01:30:43,205
♪ I AM YOURS ♪

2118
01:30:43,205 --> 01:30:45,708
[EXPLOSIONS]

2119
01:30:45,708 --> 01:30:49,512
NOW THEY’RE
EIGHT MILES HIGH.
